window.TMD=window.TMD||{};TMD["S03"]=[{"z":"致老师","t":"To The Teachers","k":"text","p":[2,3,4],"b":[["h2","To The Teachers","致老师",0],["p","Now that they have finished S1 and S2, the students' level has shifted from novice to post-beginner. Students at this level should have a basic knowledge of English. They should know things like the alphabet, the target vocabulary, simple greetings, and self-introduction. They should be able to make sentences using the basic structure Subject+Verb+Object. In S3, the teacher should help the students to expand their knowledge of sentence patterns, especially:","学生学完 S1 和 S2 后，程度已经从初学者进步到初级以上。这个程度的学生应该具备基本的英语知识，例如字母、目标单词、简单的问候语和自我介绍，也应该能用“主语＋动词＋宾语”的基本结构造句。在 S3，老师应帮助学生扩展句型知识，特别是：",0],["li","-The present continuous tense (e.g. What are you doing? I am singing.)","- 现在进行时（例如：What are you doing? I am singing.）",0],["li","-Prepositions (e.g. Where is the book? It's on the desk.)","- 介词（例如：Where is the book? It's on the desk.）",0],["li","-Pronouns (e.g. my, your, his, her and its). The students' knowledge will expand each time they learn a new lesson. And, it's a good idea to have them review S1 and S2. By doing this, students are given chances to combine the old knowledge and the new information together. The students' language learning can thus be made more effective. We hope you enjoy using S3 with your students. This book should give you a clear idea of the knowledge and skills you need to teach S3. Please read them carefully and make the best of them with your students.","- 代词（例如：my、your、his、her 和 its）。学生每学一课，知识就会扩展一些。让学生复习 S1 和 S2 是很好的做法，这能让学生有机会把旧知识和新信息结合起来，使语言学习更有效。希望您喜欢和学生一起使用 S3。本书会让您清楚了解教 S3 所需的知识和技巧，请仔细阅读，并和学生一起充分运用。",0],["h2","Teaching Materials Introduction","教材介绍",0],["p","There are two series, which are the S series (See It & Say It) and the EEC series (Easy English Conversation), to help students learn English more confidently. Here are the teaching materials for S3:","本课程有两套系列：S 系列（See It & Say It）和 EEC 系列（Easy English Conversation），帮助学生更有自信地学习英语。以下是 S3 的教材：",0],["h2","S Series","S 系列",0],["h3","●Student's Books","● 学生用书",0],["p","Classroom Readers 3 Classroom Activities 3A and 3B Homework Exercises 3A and 3B","Classroom Readers 3、Classroom Activities 3A 和 3B、Homework Exercises 3A 和 3B",0],["h3","●Progress Report Book","● 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["p","Today's Lesson Evaluation Sheet","今日课程（Today's Lesson）、评估表（Evaluation Sheet）",0],["h3","●VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","S SeriesClassroom Readers, Classroom Activities, Homework Exercises","S 系列 Classroom Readers、Classroom Activities、Homework Exercises",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["h3","●Evaluation Sheets","● 评估本",0],["p","Listening labs Quizzes Tests Activity Sheets S3 consist of five books: Classroom Readers 3, Classroom Activities 3A and 3B, (used in the classroom), and Homework Exercises 3A and 3B, (intended for home use). S3 has a three-month (24 sessions) time span in which to be completed. There are twelve lessons in Classroom Readers, fifteen lessons in Classroom Activities, three Test Days, three Activity Days and three Review Days. This teacher's manual gives Teachers a clear presentation for each lesson and informs Teachers of the pace, grammar, communication and phonetic objectives. Each lesson, time permitting, should include some types of game/exercise based on that day's lesson or as a review of previous lessons. It is important to read this section of the book thoroughly before teaching.","听力练习、小测验、测验、活动单。S3 包含五本书：Classroom Readers 3、Classroom Activities 3A 和 3B（课堂上使用），以及 Homework Exercises 3A 和 3B（在家使用）。S3 预计在三个月（24 堂课）内完成，包含 Classroom Readers 十二课、Classroom Activities 十五课、三次测验日、三次活动日和三次复习日。本教师手册为每一课提供清楚的教学呈现，并告诉老师教学进度，以及语法、沟通和发音的目标。时间允许的话，每堂课都应加入一些以当天课程为主，或复习之前课程的游戏／练习。教学前务必详读本书这个部分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers: CR","Classroom Readers：CR",0],["p","The Classroom Readers contain short stories and vocabulary. In S3, the students are going to learn English from stories! S2 and parts of the S3 Classroom Readers are designed in dialog form to help the students get used to reading and speaking. The students will get to know Mike Monkey and his family's life from the stories. Then, in Classroom Activities, the students will learn more English, for example, sentence patterns. The teacher can access the whole S Series on Jordan's Website. The website is a good teaching resource and a fun way to learn English. The students will like using digital teaching; it's animated and the sound effects are cool.","Classroom Readers 收录短篇故事和单词。在 S3，学生要从故事中学英语！S2 和部分 S3 的 Classroom Readers 以对话形式设计，帮助学生习惯阅读和口语。学生会从故事中认识 Mike Monkey 和他一家人的生活；接着在 Classroom Activities 中学到更多英语，例如句型。老师可以在乔登网站上使用整套 S 系列，网站是很好的教学资源，也是学英语的有趣方式。学生会喜欢数字教学，因为有动画，音效也很酷。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities: CA","Classroom Activities：CA",0],["p","There are two Classroom Activities books: 3A and 3B. The CA books provide a variety of activities to strengthen English skills. There is also a strong emphasis on phonics and pronunciation to help students develop good reading and speaking habits. With the exception of matching exercises, puzzles or phonetic activities, this book should be used as an ORAL guide to stimulate English communication. It is NOT intended as a reader or a workbook. The blank portions are necessary for the activities so that the language is produced orally and not simply read by the students. The exercises are also intended as a guide for teachers to emphasize key Grammar/Sentence/Question Patterns. Since students will learn verbs in S3, the teacher will do a lot of body language for students to understand the verbs.","Classroom Activities 共有两本：3A 和 3B，提供各种活动来加强英语能力。本书也非常重视自然拼读和发音，帮助学生养成良好的阅读和口语习惯。除了配对练习、拼图或发音活动之外，这本书应作为“口语”引导，用来激发英语沟通。它“不是”读本，也不是作业本。书中的空白部分是活动所需，目的是让学生用口语产出语言，而不只是照着念。这些练习也是老师用来强调重点语法／句型／问句句型的指引。由于学生在 S3 会学到动词，老师要多用肢体语言帮助学生理解动词。",0],["h2","Homework Exercises: HE","Homework Exercises：HE",0],["p","The Homework Exercises book is in two volumes: 3A and 3B. The students can do one of the books while the teacher is correcting the other one. Moreover, students have a great chance to practice what they have learned from school that day by writing these books, and the teacher can easily understand the students' learning results. Students will get more chances to make sentences while doing Homework Exercises. So,it is important to go over them at the end of class.","Homework Exercises 分为 3A 和 3B 两册。学生可以写其中一本，老师同时批改另一本。此外，学生写作业时，有很好的机会练习当天在学校学到的内容，老师也能轻松了解学生的学习成果。写 Homework Exercises 时，学生会有更多造句的机会，所以下课前一定要先带学生看过作业。",0],["h2","Progress Report Book: PRB","学习进度手册：PRB",0],["h3","●Teaching Syllabus/ Today's Homework","● 教学进度／今日作业",0],["p","There are in total twenty four spaces for the students and teachers to record the rate of progress for each class. The teacher is responsible for helping the students fill out the Teaching Syllabus and Today's Homework forms. Please write down their progress in the Teaching Syllabus. These forms are located in the Progress Report Book that each student should have. Check each student's book after they finish filling out the form, and record their performance in class. The teacher should record supplementary items used, or homework assigned, in the space marked \"others\"","学生和老师共有二十四个栏记录每堂课的进度。老师负责协助学生填写“教学进度”和“今日作业”表格，请在“教学进度”中写下上课进度。这些表格都在每位学生的学习进度手册里。学生填写完表格后，请检查每位学生的手册，并记录他们在课堂上的表现。老师应在“其他（others）”栏记录使用的补充教材或指派的作业。",0],["h3","● Performance","● 学习表现",0],["p","Some specific items of learning contents are listed in this area for Teacher to check teaching points and for parents to know clearly what their kids have learned from the class. The teacher can note supplementary items used in the space marked \"Others.\" Put a tick in the squares for \"Excellent, \" \"Good\" or \"Try Harder,\" according to their performance. \"Excellent\" means students understand all the contents and are able to get use of them; \"Good\" means students can almost understand what they learned in class but not good at performing; \"Try Harder\" means students need more help with the lesson, and have their parents pay more attention to their kids.","这一栏列出一些具体的学习内容，让老师检查教学重点，也让家长清楚知道孩子在课堂上学到了什么。老师可以在“其他（Others）”栏记录使用的补充教材。依照学生的表现，在“Excellent（优秀）”、“Good（良好）”或“Try Harder（再加油）”的方格中打钩。“Excellent”表示学生了解所有内容并能运用；“Good”表示学生大致了解上课内容，但运用还不够熟练；“Try Harder”表示学生在这一课需要更多协助，也请家长多关心孩子。",0],["h3","● Teacher and Parent's Comments","● 老师与家长意见",0],["p","This section is for the teacher and parents to communicate with each other. The teacher may also use this space to record the date, time and content of make-up classes.","这一栏让老师和家长互相沟通。老师也可以在这里记录补课的日期、时间和内容。",0],["h3","● Quiz Grade","● 小测验成绩",0],["p","The teacher may write down the grade of any quiz in this space.","老师可以在这里写上小测验成绩。",0],["h3","● Evaluation Sheet","● 评估表",0],["p","There are in total three evaluation sheets, which should be recorded in Class 8, Class 16, and Class 24 in this term. These evaluation sheets, which are for students to evaluate themselves, will help the parents to understand how much the children have learned from the English course and also about their participation in class. Before they start, explain the sheet as clearly as possible. After finishing the explanation, the students should check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performance. Example: Good Fair Try Harder","本学期共有三张评估表，分别在第 8 课、第 16 课和第 24 课填写。这些评估表是让学生自我评估用的，可以帮助家长了解孩子在英语课学到多少，以及上课的参与情况。开始前，请尽量清楚地说明表格内容。说明完后，学生依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）",0],["h2","VCD/MP3",null,0],["p","The contents of the S3 MP3 are:","S3 MP3 的内容包括：",0],["h3","Animation","动画",0],["li","● Classroom Reader 3",null,0],["li","● Classroom Activities Book 3A and 3B","● Classroom Activities Book 3A 和 3B",0],["h3","Sounds","音档",0],["li","● Classroom Reader 3",null,0],["li","● Classroom Activities 3A and 3B","● Classroom Activities 3A 和 3B",0],["li","● Homework Exercises 3A and 3B","● Homework Exercises 3A 和 3B",0],["li","● EEC Book 2 Lesson 1-Lesson 6 The teacher may introduce or review lessons using the MP3. This will help the students to become familiar with different learning experiences. Moreover, please encourage the students to review or preview the lesson using the MP3, and on Jordan's Website.","● EEC Book 2 Lesson 1–Lesson 6。老师可以用 MP3 介绍或复习课程，这能帮助学生熟悉不同的学习经验。此外，请鼓励学生用 MP3 和乔登网站复习或预习课程。",0],["h2","Evaluation Sheets","评估本",0],["p","Review lessons will always precede test days. The reviews are designed to cover key grammar and communication points as well as vocabulary to be tested. Always follow the exercise with a game/ activity of your own that addresses the material you want to emphasize. Quizzes should be given after attendance taking. It is up to the Teacher to decide whether or not the students will need a quick review before a quiz. If a student scores lesson than 85% on a test or quiz, he/ she will be required to take it again after class.","测验日之前一定会有复习课。复习课的设计涵盖重要的语法和沟通重点，以及要考的单词。练习之后，一定要接着进行您自己设计、针对想强调内容的游戏／活动。小测验应在点名后进行。是否需要在小测验前快速复习，由老师决定。学生测验或小测验分数低于 85% 时，必须在下课后重考。",0],["h3","●Spelling Quiz","● 拼写小测验",0],["p","Give a spelling quiz covering the words taught in previous lessons during warm-ups. The teacher can have the students write down the words in the notebooks or Progress Report Books. Before the quiz, the teacher may review the vocabulary that will be on the quiz.","在热身时间针对之前教过的单词进行拼写小测验。老师可以请学生把单词写在笔记本或学习进度手册上。小测验前，老师可以先复习要考的单词。",0],["h3","●Quiz","● 小测验",0],["p","There are in total three quizzes. They are in Class 6, Class 14 and Class 22 of the term. This is the preparation for the coming test. The students can find their mistakes from their own learning and have a chance to enhance them again. And as well, the teachers can realize the weakest learning area of each student and strengthen it.","本学期共有三次小测验，分别在第 6 课、第 14 课和第 22 课。这是为之后的测验做准备。学生可以从中找出自己的错误，有机会再加强；老师也能了解每位学生最弱的学习部分，并加强它。",0],["h3","●Listening Lab","● 听力练习",0],["p","There are three listening lab tests in this term, which always come on the formal quiz days of Class 6, Class 14, and Class","本学期共有三次听力测验，都在正式小测验日，也就是第 6 课、第 14 课和第",0],["li","22. It's a great chance to improve students' listening comprehension using the Listening Lab Tape. Please notice your students' reaction while taking this test. If they have difficulty understanding the questions, please play it again. Don't let your students feel frustrated and fail. Building their confidences is the most important mission.","22 课进行。这是运用听力练习录音带提升学生听力理解的好机会。测验时请留意学生的反应；如果他们听不懂题目，请再播放一次。不要让学生感到挫折或失败。建立他们的自信是最重要的任务。",0],["h3","●Test","● 测验",0],["p","There are in total three tests in Class 7, Class 15 and Class 23 in this term. Teacher can see students' achievements from the tests. This is one of the most important standards for students whether they can promote to the highest level or not. As to oral evaluation, besides taping the students' oral response while doing each oral test, the teacher has to motivate the students to speak up. And, the teacher may record some words of encouragement to the student.","本学期共有三次测验，分别在第 7 课、第 15 课和第 23 课。老师可以从测验看出学生的学习成果，这也是学生能否升上更高级别的最重要标准之一。口语评估部分，除了在每次口语测验时录下学生的回答，老师也必须鼓励学生勇敢大声说出来，并可以录一些鼓励的话给学生。",0],["h3","●Activity Sheets","● 活动单",0],["p","These are a good resource for teachers. Of course, students can play games or activities using these sheets through group works, and practice what they have learned form today's lesson as well. Furthermore, parents can easily know the students' performances in class.","活动单是老师很好的资源。学生可以通过分组合作，用活动单玩游戏或进行活动，同时练习当天学到的内容。此外，家长也能轻松了解孩子在课堂上的表现。",0],["h2","EEC Series","EEC 系列",0],["h3","●Text Book","● 课本",0],["p","Easy English Conversation Book 2 Lesson 1- 6","Easy English Conversation Book 2 Lesson 1–6",0],["h3","●Compact Disk","● CD",0],["p","Basically, there are six books in the EEC series. The idea of using this series along with the S series is to enhance the students' speaking and listening abilities. Indeed, they are useful and worthy conversation books. Like EEC Book One, EEC Two is focused on teaching children a very basic level of English. For each lesson, there is a detailed explanation about how to teach dialogues, vocabulary and activities in the Teacher's Manual. The daily dialogues are designed to teach mannerisms and speech in a western style according students' level. EEC Book Two contains three sections: Let's See and Say, Let's Check, and What Can I do? Each section has specific learning objectives.","EEC 系列基本上共有六本，与 S 系列搭配使用的目的是加强学生的口语和听力能力，是非常实用又有价值的会话书。和 EEC Book One 一样，EEC Book Two 着重于教孩子基础的英语。教师手册中每一课都详细说明如何教对话、单词和活动。日常对话依照学生的程度设计，用来教导西方的礼仪与说话方式。EEC Book Two 包含三个部分：Let's See and Say、Let's Check 和 What Can I Do?，每个部分都有特定的学习目标。",0],["h3","●Let's See And Say","● Let's See And Say",0],["p","This section contains a dialogue and a main picture. The picture helps the reader to understand the dialog.The teacher should explain the situation using the picture.","这个部分包含一段对话和一张主图，图片帮助读者了解对话。老师应用图片说明情境。",0],["h3","●Let's Check","● Let's Check",0],["p","In this section, there are both listening and writing activities. They are designed to show what the students have learned from the unit. The listening exercises are for reviewing the dialogue and sequence of the units. The writing exercises enhance the students' ability to learn vocabulary.","这个部分有听力和书写活动，目的是呈现学生在这个单元学到了什么。听力练习用来复习各单元的对话和顺序；书写练习则加强学生学习单词的能力。",0],["h3","●What Can I Do?","● What Can I Do?",0],["p","This section is the student's self-evaluation. Before the end of the class, the teacher should tell the students to open their books and finish this evaluation. First, the teacher should read and explain each item. The students then check the appropriate space according to their perception of their performances. Also they can explain the meaning of the list to their parents at home. Example: Good Fair Try Harder What Can I Do? (From Lesson 1) Try I CAN Good Fair Harder I can start a conversation I can ask \" Do you play baseball ?\" I can say \"What's cool!\" I can be nice to my friends I can invite friends to join the team","这个部分是学生的自我评估。下课前，老师应请学生打开课本完成这份评估。老师先念出并解释每个项目，学生再依照自己对表现的感受，在适当的栏打钩。学生回家后也可以向家长解释清单的意思。例如：好（Good）、普通（Fair）、再加油（Try Harder）。What Can I Do?（第 1 课）：I can start a conversation. / I can ask \"Do you play baseball?\" / I can say \"That's cool!\" / I can be nice to my friends. / I can invite friends to join the team.",0],["h2","Teaching Skills","教学技巧",0],["h3","● Phonics","● 自然拼读",0],["p","The students will learn more vowels in S 3, like the long \"e\" sound or short \"u\" sound. It is better to review the phonics that the students have learned so far. Because vowels are more difficult to remember than consonants, teachers had better review all the time when teaching the same or related sounds.","学生在 S3 会学到更多元音，例如长元音“e”或短元音“u”。最好先复习学生到目前为止学过的发音。因为元音比辅音难记，老师在教相同或相关的发音时，最好随时复习。",0],["h3","● Spelling","● 拼写",0],["p","As they learn more phonics, students will spell and pronounce words more easily. Sometimes they can spell the words phonetically then pronounce them but have no idea about the meaning. Teachers don't have to care about how much vocabulary students have remembered or understood, but teachers have to care that students can spell the words by listening or try to pronounce the words that they haven't learned before. A good method is to follow these procedures EACH time a new word is introduced:","学会越多发音，学生拼写和念单词就越容易。有时学生能用发音拼出单词并念出来，却不知道意思。老师不必在意学生记住或理解了多少单词，但要在意学生能不能听音拼写，或试着念出没学过的单词。一个好方法是：“每次”介绍新单词时，都依照以下步骤进行：",0],["li","1. Say the word and spell it, with the students repeating. Do this several times.","1. 念出单词并拼出来，让学生跟着复诵。重复几次。",0],["li","2. Write the word on the board. Introduce it phonetically, especially for the vowels. Point to a student to say the first letter. Point to another student to say the next letter. Point to students randomly. Keep them on their toes. Spell out the word this way, then start over again. Keep going until everyone has said a letter. This should be done very fast almost as if you are spelling the word yourself. Point to the student rather than calling them by name. It is faster and you aren't interrupting the spelling.","2. 把单词写在黑板上，用自然拼读介绍它。指一位学生说出第一个字母，再指另一位学生说下一个字母。随机指学生，不要照座位顺序，让大家随时保持专注。用这种方式拼完整个字，再从头开始，直到每个人都说过一个字母。速度要非常快，就像您自己在拼写一样。用手指学生而不是叫名字，这样比较快，也不会打断拼写。",0],["h3","● Eclectic Teaching For S3","● S3 综合教学法",0],["li","1. T.P.R. (Total Physical Response)","1. T.P.R.（全肢体反应教学法）",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"教学技巧","t":"Teaching Skills","k":"text","p":[5],"b":[["p","TPR will be used often in S3.Teachers should prepare specific and easily-remembered actions for each verb, to help the students remember the verb.","S3 会经常使用 TPR。老师应为每个动词准备具体、容易记住的动作，帮助学生记住动词。",0],["li","2. V.A.C. (Visual Aids Concept) A good way to help students understand English is to use pictures, flashcards, objects, and other tools. These items will add interest to your English teaching. The teacher may ask the students to bring them to school; this is not only convenient for Teachers but also can have students be more involved in learning English. You can also use the resource of the website. It will spark the students' learning interest as well.","2. V.A.C.（视觉辅助概念）：帮助学生理解英语的好方法是使用图片、单词卡、实物和其他教具，这些东西能让英语教学更有趣。老师可以请学生把东西带到学校，这不但对老师方便，也能让学生更投入英语学习。也可以使用网站上的资源，同样能激发学生的学习兴趣。",0],["h3","3. Repetition","3. 重复练习",0],["p","Using dice for this drill will be a lot of fun. Teachers roll the dice and have students say the vocabulary as many times as the number that the dice shows.","用骰子进行这个练习会很有趣。老师掷骰子，骰子显示几点，学生就把单词说几次。",0],["d","noodles","T",0],["d","noodles T (Roll the dice): Number 5","Ss",0],["d","noodles, noodles, noodles, noodles, noodles","Ss",0],["h3","4. Chain Drill","4. 接龙练习",0],["p","Have the students practice certain sentence pattern in turns by passing the flashcards.","让学生传单词卡，轮流练习某个句型。",0],["d","Are they playing?","T",0],["d","Yes, they are. Are they eating?","S1",0],["d","Yes, they are.","S2",0],["h3","5. Ball Drill","5. 传球练习",0],["p","The teacher throws the ball to the students and plays music. The students have to pass the ball to the music. Once the music stops, everyone has to stop passing the ball and look at the teacher. The teacher will show a flashcard or point to the monitor. The student who gets the ball has to say the word or sentence. This drill can also be done with two balls. Have two teams compete; that might be fun.","老师把球丢给学生并播放音乐，学生要随着音乐传球。音乐一停，大家都要停止传球并看着老师。老师展示一张单词卡或指着屏幕，拿到球的学生要说出单词或句子。这个练习也可以用两颗球进行，让两队比赛会很有趣。",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are playing.","Ss",0],["d","Are they playing?","S1",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are playing.","S2",0],["d","Are they playing?","S3",0],["h3","6. Chart Drill","6. 图表练习",0],["p","Give the students a sticky ball. Have a student throw it at any square and then make sentences according to the square.","给学生一颗黏黏球，请一位学生把球丢到任一格，再依照那一格的内容造句。",0],["d","What is Jenny doing?","T",0],["d","She is drinking.","S",0],["p","Jenny Sophia John eating ● drinking playing",null,0],["h3","7. Substitution Drill","7. 替换练习",0],["p","Write a sentence pattern on the board. For example:","在黑板上写一个句型。例如：",0],["p","These are______.",null,0],["d","(show one of the flashcards: shirts, and have Ss finish the sentence)","T",0],["d","They are shirts.","Ss",0],["h3","8. Role Play","8. 角色扮演",0],["li","- Divide the students into many groups and have them practice the dialogue or conversation. Classroom Activities Lesson 13 \"Peter's Family\" is a suitable topic for role-play.","- 把学生分成许多组练习对话。Classroom Activities 第 13 课“Peter's Family”很适合做角色扮演。",0],["li","9. Cloze Eliminate some key words from the sentences and have the students fill in the blanks. Cloze is often used to practice the verb \"to be.\" (i.e., I am, he is, they are, etc.)","9. 克漏字：把句子中的一些关键字去掉，请学生填空。克漏字常用来练习 be 动词（例如 I am、he is、they are 等）。",0],["h3","10. Question & Answer","10. 问与答",0],["p","Do Question & Answer at the beginning of each class for 5-10 minutes. You may also wish to ask students questions while teaching from the Classroom Reader. Try to be a storyteller; let the students enjoy your story. After the story, ask them some questions to make sure they understand.","每堂课开始时进行 5–10 分钟的问与答。教 Classroom Reader 时也可以问学生问题。试着当一位说故事的人，让学生享受您的故事；讲完故事后问学生一些问题，确认他们都懂了。",0],["li","11. Matching Classroom Activity Lesson 11 is just right to do matching. After teaching body parts, the teacher chooses a character from the book and has the students make sentences about the character's facial features, etc. For example:","11. 配对：Classroom Activities 第 11 课很适合做配对。教完身体部位后，老师从书中选一个角色，请学生描述这个角色的五官等特征并造句。例如：",0],["d","Mike Monkey.","T",0],["d","Mike Monkey's eyes are blue.","Ss",0],["h3","12. Expansion Drill","12. 扩展练习",0],["p","This is an effective way to practice English. The students will learn about food in this level. The teacher can have the students think about different categories of food. For example:","这是练习英语的有效方法。学生在这一级会学到食物，老师可以请学生想想不同种类的食物。例如：",0],["d","Let's think of some words that are related to fast food.","T",0],["d","sandwich, hamburger, apple pie....","Ss",0],["p","You can find some additonal resources on Jordan's website.","在乔登网站上可以找到一些额外的资源。",0],["h3","13. Transformation","13. 句型转换",0],["p","This drill is good for practicing tenses. Since the students have learned the present tense and the present continuous tenses, the teacher can say a sentence and have the students change its tense.","这个练习很适合练习时态。学生已经学过现在时和现在进行时，老师可以说一个句子，请学生改变它的时态。",0],["d","I am playing in the park.","T",0],["d","You play in the park.","S",0],["h3","14. Situational Practice","14. 情境练习",0],["p","Create different kinds of situations depending on the content of the lessons to help the students understand, and also enjoy learning English.","依照课程内容设计各种情境，帮助学生理解，也享受学英语的乐趣。",0],["h3","●Digital Teaching: www.jordan.com.tw","● 数字教学：www.jordan.com.tw",0],["p","All of S3 is on Jordan's website. This includes the","S3 的所有内容都在乔登网站上，包括",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"班级管理","t":"Classroom Management","k":"text","p":[6,7],"b":[["p","Classroom Reader, the Classroom Activities Book, the Homework Exercises Book, and EEC Book 2. The students will have a lot of fun learning English while watching and working with the animated characters on this web site. Please encourage the students to practice English on the touchscreen all-in-one in class as well as at home. Preview, Assist, and Review are three important aspects of digital teaching. It is a high-technology multimedia, but it is easy to use.","Classroom Reader、Classroom Activities Book、Homework Exercises Book 和 EEC Book 2。学生通过观看网站上的动画角色并和它们互动，能非常愉快地学英语。请鼓励学生在课堂上和在家用触控一体机练习英语。预习、辅助、复习是数字教学的三大重点。这是高科技的多媒体教材，但使用很简单。",0],["h3","●How to visit Jordan's Web Site","● 如何使用乔登网站",0],["p","www.jordan.com.tw ▼ ▼乔登美语教学网▼▼ ▼ e-Learning ▼ e-Learning白金会员▼▼ ▼ Enter the password ▼ Big Kid 大儿童学习区▼▼▼ ▼ Lesson IV儿童进阶▼▼ ▼ Book 3","www.jordan.com.tw ▼ 乔登美语教学网 ▼ e-Learning ▼ e-Learning 白金会员 ▼ 输入密码 ▼ 大儿童学习区 Big Kid ▼ 儿童进阶 Lesson IV ▼ Book 3",0],["h2","Classroom Language","课堂用语",0],["h3","1.Commands","1. 指令",0],["p","Clap your hands for Mary! Raise your hands to answer the question. Put on your jackets. Take off your shoes. Listen and do. Hand in your homework on time. Pass the card and say the word.",null,0],["h3","2.Interactions","2. 互动用语",0],["p","Wonderful! You did a good job today. Keep trying! What are you wearing today? You look good in purple. Who bought you the shoes? The hat is very in right now. What is your favorite food? An apple a day keeps the doctor away.",null,0],["h3","How To Manage Your Class","班级管理",0],["h3","●Class Preparation","● 课前准备",0],["li","(1) Please arrive at school thirty minutes early to do class preparation.","(1) 请提早三十分钟到学校做课前准备。",0],["li","-Fill out the Teacher's Handbook","- 填写教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）",0],["li","-Prepare teaching materials","- 准备教材",0],["li","-Log on to Jordan's website and get familiar with today's lesson by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","- 登录乔登网站，操作触控一体机熟悉今天的课程。",0],["li","-Help the absent students make up the missing class","- 协助缺席的学生补课",0],["li","(2) Please go into the classroom five minutes early to get everything done, and also interact with students.","(2) 请提早五分钟进教室把一切准备好，并和学生互动。",0],["li","-Check that the touchscreen all-in-one is ready for the class.","- 确认触控一体机已为上课准备就绪。",0],["h2","Discipline","秩序管理",0],["p","The teacher should maintain proper discipline at all times. Swearing, spitting, throwing objects, standing on chairs/desks, hitting others, kicking walls, etc. ... are prohibited. Eating and drinking during class time will be left up to the individual schools/teachers, but these actions should be discouraged. A simple, common sense approach to discipline is usually best. Discipline involves keeping everyone happy. Even the students who are disciplined should end up happy. The student should understand that it is not them the teacher is unhappy with, just their behaviors. Discipline should never be a personal criticism. The student should know that the teacher likes them, but only wants their behaviors to be improved. Some basic things to remember about classroom behaviors:","- 确认触控一体机已为接下来的课程准备就绪。秩序管理：老师应随时维持良好的课堂秩序。禁止骂脏话、吐口水、丢东西、站在椅子／桌子上、打人、踢墙壁等行为。上课时间是否可以吃喝由各分校／老师决定，但应尽量避免。简单、合乎常理的管理方式通常最好。秩序管理是要让每个人都开心，即使是被管教的学生，最后也应该开心。学生应该明白，老师不高兴的不是他这个人，而是他的行为。管教绝不应是对人的批评；学生应该知道老师喜欢他，只是希望他的行为能改进。关于课堂行为，有几点基本原则要记住：",0],["li","- A misbehaving class is usually a bored class. A quick pace will help to ensure the students maintain attention.","- 秩序不好的班级通常是无聊的班级。快速的节奏有助于让学生保持专注。",0],["li","-Have your teaching aids and materials at hand to avoid lengthy delays, which give the students the opportunity to start misbehaving.","- 把教具和教材准备在手边，避免拖延太久，让学生有机会开始捣蛋。",0],["li","- Call on students in a random order. If a student doesn't know when it is his/her turn they will pay closer attention.","- 随机点学生。如果学生不知道什么时候轮到自己，就会更专心。",0],["li","- Mix choral work with pair work and individual practice. If possible, switch from one type of practice to another often to help keep interest and variety. Finally, return to group work to follow-up/reinforce the lesson. Minimize individual work if time is short. If a student is creating a problem in class, give him/her a long stare or a tap on the shoulder to let them know you disapprove. If the student persists, tell him/her to stop the disruptive behavior. If the problem continues, take away reward cards or have him/her stand up. Finally, if the student won't stop, send him/her out of the classroom to see the secretary. The student's parents should be notified of the behavior. You should treat the student well after each of these steps. You must show the individual that you are still friends, but you don't approve of their actions.","- 全班齐声练习、两人练习和个别练习交替进行。可能的话，经常变换练习方式，保持新鲜感和变化。最后回到全班练习，延伸／巩固本课内容。时间不够时，尽量减少个别练习。如果有学生在课堂上制造问题，先盯着他看久一点，或拍拍他的肩膀，让他知道您不认同。如果学生仍然继续，请他停止干扰行为。问题若持续，就收回奖励卡或请他站起来。最后，如果学生还是不停止，请他到教室外找行政人员，并通知家长学生的行为。每一步之后都要好好对待这位学生，让他知道你们还是朋友，只是您不认同他的行为。",0],["h3","●New Students in Your Class","● 班上的新同学",0],["p","There are always new students transferring into the class. Please help them adapt. Here are some tips:","班上总会有转进来的新同学，请帮助他们适应。以下是一些建议：",0],["p","Introduce them to the class. Help them make up the lessons until they can catch up with the class. Pay attention to their learning attitude and help them solve problems immediately.","向全班介绍新同学；帮助他们补课，直到跟上全班进度；留意他们的学习态度，并立即协助解决问题。",0],["h3","●Homework And Grading","● 作业与评分",0],["p","Establish from the first day of class that students need to turn in homework in a timely fashion. You must let students know you want their homework EVERY time the class meets. The homework helps to reinforce key lesson concepts and without completing it prior to the next class the student may begin to fall behind. Be very firm about making sure they turn it in on time! Correct the homework exercises carefully, this is a very important process for the very beginner. Be strict! That will help them in cultivating a good habit to write clearly and neatly.","从第一天上课就要让学生知道，作业必须准时缴交。您要让学生知道，“每次”上课都要交作业。作业能帮助巩固课程的重要观念，如果下次上课前没有完成，学生可能会开始落后。务必坚持要求准时交作业！仔细批改作业，这对初学者是非常重要的过程。要严格！这能帮助他们养成书写清楚整齐的好习惯。",0],["h3","How to help the beginners doing homework successfully,","以下是帮助初学者",0],["h3","here are some tips","顺利完成作业的一些秘诀：",0],["li","1. Make full use of the Reinforcement section of the lesso plan for each class. Have the students open the Homework Exercises to preview all the items in today's lesson.","1. 充分利用每堂课教案中的“Reinforcement（加强复习）”部分，请学生打开 Homework Exercises，预习今天课程的所有题目。",0],["li","2. Make a clear explanation for them to understand the content of today's Homework Exercises. And ask them to practice some exercises to make sure they understand. Grading of homework and tests should be consistent between the FT and the CT.A good rule of thumb to follow when grading homework is to subtract two points for a missing or incorrect word and one point for a missing or incorrect letter. If you are using letter grades (A, B, C, etc.) convert the number total to a letter grade as follows:","2. 清楚说明今天 Homework Exercises 的内容，让学生了解，并请他们先练习几题，确认他们都懂了。外籍老师（FT）和中籍老师（CT）批改作业和测验的标准要一致。批改作业有个好用的原则：漏写或写错一个字扣两分，漏写或写错一个字母扣一分。如果您用等第（A、B、C 等），请依照以下方式把分数换算成等第：",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching","电话教学",0],["p","As teachers, we are not only concerned with students' achievements in class, but also concerned with their study habits while they are at home. Therefore, we've designed Ttelephone Teaching Material (TTM) to help students review English at home by answering some questions on the phone and let the parents know about their kids' ability in speaking English. The teacher should write comments in the Teacher's Handbook, and, for encouragement, give them reward cards according to their performance during the following class. For doing well on telephone teaching, the teacher may lead students to prepare those questions in class and give students 2 or 3 attempts to answer each question. In addition, while doing Telephone Teaching, be sure to greet students at the beginning of a conversation and give students some encouragement after they answer each question.","身为老师，我们不只关心学生在课堂上的表现，也关心他们在家的学习习惯。因此我们设计了电话教学教材（TTM），让学生在电话中回答问题，在家复习英语，也让家长了解孩子的英语口语能力。老师应用等第（A、B、C 或 D）为学生的回答评分，把评语写在“教师手册（Teacher's Handbook）”中，并在下次上课时依照表现给予奖励卡作为鼓励。为了让电话教学顺利，老师可以在课堂上带学生准备这些问题，每题给学生 2 到 3 次回答机会。此外，进行电话教学时，对话开始时一定要先问候学生，学生每回答一题后也要给予鼓励。步骤：",0],["h3","Procedures","步骤",0],["li","1. Greetings: Say hello to the students or their family. Let them know you want to talk to the student.","1. 问候：向学生或家人问好，让他们知道您想跟学生说话。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) Good afternoon, good evening.",null,0],["li","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today? 90-100 A 70-80 C 80-90 B 60-70 D","(2) Hello! (Student's name), this is (teacher's name). How are you today?　评分：90–100 A、80–90 B、70–80 C、60–70 D",0],["li","2. Questions and Answers: Try to encourage the students to answer with complete sentences.","2. 问与答：尽量鼓励学生用完整的句子回答。",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) I know you knew that, try again!",null,0],["li","(2) Good! Very good! You did a good job! Wonderful! Very nice! Good boy! Good girl!",null,0],["li","3. Ending: Continue to encourage the students again and remind them of something if needed:","3. 结尾：再次鼓励学生，需要的话提醒他们一些事情：",0],["h3","Suggestions","建议用语",0],["li","(1) You are very good. Please finish your homework.",null,0],["li","(2) Don't forget to ask your parents to sign the \"Progress Report Book.\"",null,0],["li","(3) You are a good boy/girl. Did you prepare for the quiz/test next class?",null,0],["li","(4) You always do a great job! Is your daddy or mommy home? Please ask him/her to come to the phone, thank you.",null,0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"课程大纲","t":"Syllabus","k":"img","p":[8],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"学习目标","t":"Learning Goals","k":"text","p":[9],"b":[["h2","Learning Goals","学习目标",0],["h2","A) Grammar Goals","A) 语法目标",0],["li","1. Able to use preposition \"in,\" \"on\" and \"under.\"","1. 能使用介词 \"in\"、\"on\" 和 \"under\"。",0],["li","2. Able to use more adjectives, for example: We are thirsty/ cold / young...etc.","2. 能使用更多形容词，例如：We are thirsty/cold/young 等。",0],["li","3. Review phonics: consonants and short vowels.","3. 复习自然拼读：辅音和短元音。",0],["li","4. Able to use the possessives, for example: my, your, his, her, their, our..etc","4. 能使用所有格，例如：my、your、his、her、their、our 等。",0],["li","5. Able to make questions with \"who\" and answer.","5. 能用 \"who\" 提问并回答。",0],["li","6. Able to use the present continuous tense to make positive sentences, questions and negative sentences.","6. 能用现在进行时造肯定句、问句和否定句。",0],["li","7. Able to recognize the possessive with \"s.\"","7. 能认识加“'s”的所有格。",0],["li","8. Able to recognize many prepositions and make sentences with 'Where.\"","8. 能认识许多介词，并用 \"Where\" 造句。",0],["li","9. Able to use plural \"Be\" verb to make asking sentences with \"wh\" and answering sentences. For example: What are these?","9. 能用复数 be 动词造 wh 问句并回答，例如：What are these?",0],["li","10. Able to tell \"these\" and \"those\" and make sentences","10. 能分辨 \"these\" 和 \"those\" 并造句。",0],["li","11. Able to change singular to plural, for example: This is a jacket-- These are jackets.","11. 能把单数改成复数，例如：This is a jacket. → These are jackets.",0],["h2","B) Communicative Goals","B) 沟通目标",0],["li","1. Able to use the present continuous tense to describe actions that are in progress at the moment of speaking.","1. 能用现在进行时描述说话当下正在进行的动作。",0],["li","2. Able to recognize common clothing items","2. 能认识常见的衣物。",0],["li","3. Able to use prepositions to express the idea of locations","3. 能用介词表达位置。",0],["li","4. Able to recognize singular and plural nouns","4. 能认识单数和复数名词。",0],["li","5. Able to speak 100 new words","5. 能说出 100 个新单词。",0],["li","6. Able to recognize shapes, colors and body parts.","6. 能认识形状、颜色和身体部位。",0],["li","7. Able to introduce family members","7. 能介绍家人。",0],["li","8. Able to describe things with new colors","8. 能用新的颜色描述东西。",0],["li","9. Able to recognize common places, for example: supermarket.","9. 能认识常见的地方，例如：supermarket。",0],["h2","C) Vocabulary Goals","C) 单词目标",0],["p","Class 1: read, newspaper, write, letter, draw, watch, drink, tea, eat, fruit, Class 2: lunch, time, rice, sandwich, play, milk, sleep, cook, sing Class 4: color, dance, feed Class 5: computer, these, your, jacket, shirt, skirt, sock(s), shoe(s) Class 9: frog, those, at, jump, run, belt, hat, pajamas, sneakers Class 10: know, chopsticks, toothbrush, towel, tissue, comb, slipper(s) Class 11: food, noodle(s), dumpling(s), very, vegetables, fish, chicken, leg, egg Class 12: out, see, tomorrow, on, under, table, sofa Class 17: name, his, long, tail, her, eye(s), your, ear(s), nose, mouth, head Class 18: our, house, its, door, room, their, hair, hand, arm, leg, foot Class 19: home, who, she's, he's, grandmother, grandfather, aunt, uncle, busy, mother, father, sister, brother Class 20: say, it's, money, basket, go(ing), shopping, shout, cry, talk Class 21: work, where, coconut, road, but, smile, behind, in front of, beside, between, near","第 1 课：read, newspaper, write, letter, draw, watch, drink, tea, eat, fruit　第 2 课：lunch, time, rice, sandwich, play, milk, sleep, cook, sing　第 4 课：color, dance, feed　第 5 课：touchscreen all-in-one, these, your, jacket, shirt, skirt, sock(s), shoe(s)　第 9 课：frog, those, at, jump, run, belt, hat, pajamas, sneakers　第 10 课：know, chopsticks, toothbrush, towel, tissue, comb, slipper(s)　第 11 课：food, noodle(s), dumpling(s), very, vegetables, fish, chicken, leg, egg　第 12 课：out, see, tomorrow, on, under, table, sofa　第 17 课：name, his, long, tail, her, eye(s), your, ear(s), nose, mouth, head　第 18 课：our, house, its, door, room, their, hair, hand, arm, leg, foot　第 19 课：home, who, she's, he's, grandmother, grandfather, aunt, uncle, busy, mother, father, sister, brother　第 20 课：say, it's, money, basket, go(ing), shopping, shout, cry, talk　第 21 课：work, where, coconut, road, but, smile, behind, in front of, beside, between, near",0]],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"第 1 课","t":"Class 1","k":"class","p":[10,11,12,13,14],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R/ C.A. To describe actions in the present tense To use suitable verbs to describe particular actions","C.R./C.A.：能用现在时描述动作；能用适当的动词描述特定的动作。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Extending a conversation Making or accepting invitations Asking others about their habits Helping others to feel at ease","延续对话；提出或接受邀请；询问别人的习惯；让别人感到自在",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 1","Classroom Readers 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","reading, writing, drawing",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","He is / They are (verb) + ing.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson 1","Classroom Activities 3A 第 1 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","watch TV, read a newspaper, write a letter, drink tea, eat fruit",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, photocopies of page 5, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, name cards","单词单词卡、第 5 页复印件、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、名牌",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 1","EEC 2 第 1 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Cap, baseball diamond, first base, mitt, mask, tap.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you want to join us?","A",1],["d","Of course.","B",1],["d","Bring your cap, OK?","A",1],["d","Great! I will.","B",1],["d","I am sure the team will like you.","A",1],["d","That's cool.","B",1],["h2","Greeting (10 mins)","打招呼（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Welcome your new students to class. Give the students an opportunity to get to know each other.","(1) 欢迎新同学来上课，给学生互相认识的机会。",0],["li","(2) Do a quick TPR activity to let the students preview all the verbs that they are going to learn today.","(2) 进行一个快速的 TPR 活动，让学生预习今天要学的所有动词。",0],["li","(3) Introduce the new verbs. Do this by writing the verbs, spelling them, and making some sort of gesture indicating the verb's meaning. They are responsible for spelling both forms. They are also responsible for spelling all new vocabulary. During this phase of every class from now on, teach and practice spelling.","(3) 介绍新动词：写出动词、拼出来，并做出表示动词意思的手势。学生要会拼动词的两种形式，也要会拼所有新单词。从现在起，每堂课这个阶段都要教拼写、练拼写。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40 mins)","Classroom Readers（40 mins）",0],["h2","Lesson 1: It is a test","第 1 课 It Is a Test",0],["h2","1-Part 1:","1. 第 1 部分：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson the first time using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Let the students read the conversation along with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Look!","C",0],["d","Everybody please repeat! (Teach this word with TPR)","T",0],["d","Look!","Ss",0],["d","It is a test.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \" It is a test!\"","T",0],["d","It is a test.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to the monitor) What are they doing?","T",0],["d","They are reading.","C",0],["d","Oh! They are reading. Everybody please repeat.","T",0],["d","They are reading.","Ss",0],["d","Right! They are reading. And they are also writing. Let's listen again.","T",0],["d","They are writing.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat.","T",0],["d","They are writing.","Ss",0],["d","( Point to Sam on the monitor) Everybody look at Sam. Is he reading?","T",0],["d","No!","Ss",0],["d","( Click on next part of the conversation.)","T",0],["d","Look!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Look!","Ss",0],["d","Sam is not reading.","C",0],["d","Sam is not reading. Everybody repeat.","T",0],["d","Sam is not reading.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to Sam again.) Is he writing?","T",0],["d","No!","Ss",0],["d","You are right! Let's listen to the touchscreen all-in-one.","T",0],["d","He is not writing.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat.","T",0],["d","He is not writing.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. So what is he doing in the class?","T",0],["d","He is drawing.","C",0],["d","That's right. He is drawing. Everybody say it again.","T",0],["d","He is drawing.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to Sam.) Do you know what he's drawing?","T",0],["d","Sam is drawing Miss Brown.","C",0],["d","I see! Sam is drawing Miss Brown. Everybody say it again.","T",0],["d","Sam is drawing Miss Brown.","Ss",0],["p","Repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them to read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","重复这个流程 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(1) The progressive or continuous tense is a little tricky. And there is a lot to remember. Remember to start with \" I am writing/ drawing/ reading.\" Then move on to \" He/ She / It is ____.\" You can use some characters that they are familiar with to teach \"he\" and \"she\". For example, you can draw \"Harry Potter\" or show them the picture of Harry Potter to teach \"he\".","(1) 进行时有点难，要记的东西也很多。记得先从 \"I am writing/drawing/reading.\" 开始，再进入 \"He/She/It is ___.\"。可以用学生熟悉的角色教 \"he\" 和 \"she\"，例如画出“哈利波特”或给学生看哈利波特的图片来教 \"he\"。",0],["h3","(2) Open Your Books","(2) 打开课本",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生个别念对话。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities Lesson One: At Home (40 mins)","Classroom Activities 第 1 课 At Home 在家（40 mins）",0],["h2","1-Part 1 Learning:","1. 第 1 部分　学习（Learning）：",0],["li","(1) Show the content which will be taught today on the monitor for the first time. Introduce the words one by one. Start with \"watch.\"","(1) 第一次在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"watch\" 开始。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \" watch TV!\"","T",0],["d","Watch TV!","Ss",0],["p","After they practice saying \"watch TV\", click on the next new phrase, \"read a newspaper\"","学生练习说 \"watch TV\" 之后，点击下一个新短语 \"read a newspaper\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \" read a newspaper!\"","T",0],["d","Read a newspaper.","Ss",0],["p","Repeat this procedure about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["h3","(2) TPR practice-","(2) TPR 练习：",0],["p","Make sure that all the students are familiar with all the vocabulary you have taught using TPR. Design a certain gesture for each action by yourself, and ask them to do the gesture when they hear the order from you. Of course you can also do the gesture, but ask them to say the words in English! This could be a competitive game.","用 TPR 确认所有学生都熟悉您教过的单词。自己为每个动作设计一个手势，请学生听到您的指令时做出手势。当然您也可以做手势，请学生用英语说出单词！可以用比赛的方式进行。",0],["li","(3) Write \"-ing\" on the white board, and present all the verbs one by one. When you place \"read\" in front of \"-ing\" on the board, ask all the students to repeat \"reading\" after you.","(3) 在白板上写“-ing”，逐一呈现所有动词。把 \"read\" 放在“-ing”前面时，请全班跟着您复诵 \"reading\"。",0],["d","Everybody say,\" reading!\"","T",0],["d","Reading!","Ss",0],["p","Repeat each word several times until they've got it.","每个字重复几次，直到学生熟练。",0],["li","(4) Replay the \"learning\" section again, and ask the students to make complete sentences according to the monitor. For example, click on \" watch TV\",","(4) 再播放一次“Learning”部分，请学生依照屏幕说出完整的句子。例如点击 \"watch TV\"，",0],["d","Everybody say, \"watching TV!\"","T",0],["p","Ss Watching TV!","Ss：Watching TV!",0],["d","Everybody say, \" He is watching TV.\"","T",0],["d","He is watching TV.","Ss",0],["p","Repeat this procedure 2-3 times, and make sure that all of them are familiar with the target sentences.","重复这个流程 2–3 次，确认所有学生都熟悉目标句子。",0],["li","(5) Competitive gameDivide the students into two teams. Ask them to use the hammer to hit the indicated flashcard and make sentences. The fastest one can score for his or her team. For example,","(5) 比赛游戏：把学生分成两队，请他们用锤子敲指定的单词卡并造句，最快的人为自己的队伍得分。例如：",0],["d","Read a newspaper! Number 3!","T",0],["d","(Number 3 from the two teams come to the front, hits the flashcard, and says...)","Ss",0],["p","He is reading a newspaper!",null,0],["h3","(6) Open the Book","(6) 打开课本",0],["p","Have the students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(7) Writing practice","(7) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write complete sentences on the board according to hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly will be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["li","(8) ActivityPhotocopy the pictures and characters on page 5. Give them out to the students. You read the statements and the students who has the pictures has to come to the front of the class and read his or her statement.","(8) 活动：复印第 5 页的图片和角色，发给学生。您念出叙述句，拿着那张图的学生要到教室前面念出他的句子。",0],["h3","(9) Activity Sheet 1","(9) 活动单 1",0],["p","Have the students look at Classroom Activities page 5. At the top of the page, there are pictures indicating various activities (drinking tea, eating fruit, etc.). Below them are the pictures and names of various people (Charlie, Katie, Miss Brown, etc.). We can see squiggly blue lines connecting the activities with the people, and a list of statements at the bottom of the page (Charlie is writing a letter, etc.) Have the students look at Activity Sheet 1. It is similar to page 5, but with unfinished sentences, and without the squiggly lines. Have the students draw lines connecting different activities with different people.Then have them complete the sentences at the bottom of the sheet talking about the people and their activities. They should not copy from the book, but should make up their own sentences. Examples:","请学生看 Classroom Activities 第 5 页。页面上方有表示各种活动的图片（喝茶、吃水果等），下面是各个人物的图片和名字（Charlie、Katie、Miss Brown 等），用蓝色的弯曲线条把活动和人物连起来，页面下方则列出一些叙述句（Charlie is writing a letter 等）。请学生看活动单 1，它和第 5 页很像，但句子没有完成，也没有弯曲的线条。请学生画线把不同的活动和不同的人物连起来，再完成活动单下方描述人物和活动的句子。学生不能照抄课本，要自己造句。例如：",0],["p","Charlie is eating fruit. Katie is watching TV.",null,0],["h2","2- Part 2. Exercise:","2. 第 2 部分　练习：",0],["p","Enter the pages \" Matching\" and \"Fill in the Blanks\" to practice the exercises on the monitor using the touchscreen all-in-one with your students. Don't forget to give them chances to operate the touchscreen all-in-one.","进入“Matching”和“Fill in the Blanks”页面，和学生一起用触控一体机在屏幕上做练习。别忘了让学生有机会操作触控一体机。",0],["li","(1) Have them solve the puzzle and chorally say the sentences. A noun has been added that explains the action in the sentence in more detail. For example, Charlie is writing. What is he writing? He is writing a letter. On page 6 have your students fill in the blanks. When they're finished, have them come to the front once again and read their sentences.","(1) 请学生解出拼图并一起念出句子。句子中加了一个名词，更详细地说明动作。例如：Charlie is writing. What is he writing? He is writing a letter. 请学生填写第 6 页的空格，完成后再请他们到前面念出自己的句子。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of Let's See And Say. Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduction:","引导：",0],["p","Introduce the lesson by having the students listen to the monologue. You can either read the monolog, or use the MP 3. Let's See And Say: Monolog What's your favorite sport? Do you like to play baseball? Let's have a go.","让学生听独白介绍本课，您可以自己念，或使用 MP3。Let's See And Say 独白：What's your favorite sport? Do you like to play baseball? Let's have a go.",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the monolog they have listened to. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their ideas. Write the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasize for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson by combining the dialog that the students have just practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialogue and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with each other. At this stage, the teacher should tell the students about real-life situations where they can use this kind of conversation.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能互相进行对话。这个阶段老师应告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. This is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1"]],[30,["Part 1","1.1 Vocabulary","Part 2","1.2","Part 3","1.3","Part 4","1.4","Part 5","1.5"]],[75,["Big Kids","大儿童学习区▼▼▼"]],[75,["Lesson IV","▼ 儿童进阶▼▼","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 1","Part 1","Learning","Matching","Fill in the Blanks","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[127,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["It is a test"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 2 课","t":"Class 2","k":"class","p":[15,16,17,18,19,20],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA To describe actions in the present tense To use suitable verbs to describe particular actions","C.R./C.A.：能用现在时描述动作；能用适当的动词描述特定的动作。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","To ask/ answer questions about what one is doing To talk about activities","能问答某人正在做什么；能谈论各种活动。",1],["h3","Extending a conversation","延续对话",1],["p","Making or accepting invitations Asking others about their habits Helping others to feel at ease","提出或接受邀请；询问别人的习惯；让别人感到自在",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 2","Classroom Readers 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Eating, lunch, time, rice, apple, sandwich",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Is he/ she eating?",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson 2","Classroom Activities 3A 第 2 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Play, playing, sleep, sleeping, cook, cooking, sing, singing, milk",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, photocopies of question/ answer sentence patterns, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die","单词单词卡、问答句型复印件、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 1","EEC 2 第 1 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Cap, baseball diamond, first base, mitt, mask, cap",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you want to join us?","A",1],["d","Of course.","B",1],["d","Bring your cap, OK?","A",1],["d","Great! I will.","B",1],["d","I am sure the team will like you.","A",1],["d","That's cool.","B",1],["h2","Greeting (10 mins)","打招呼（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from last lesson. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼上一课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the new words. If you can use gestures to make your point to make it fun, that would be really impressive to the students. You can also ask some of the students to come up to the front to do some actions to let the others take a guess. Don't forget to let them practice the answer sentences by answering your questions, \" What am I/ is he/ is she doing?\"","(2) 介绍新单词。如果能用手势让说明更有趣，学生会印象深刻。也可以请几位学生到前面做动作让其他人猜。别忘了让学生回答您的问题 \"What am I / is he / is she doing?\"，练习回答的句子。",0],["li","(3) Word ScrambleWrite some of the words on the board all scrambled. Divide the class into teams. The first team to figure out the word gets scores for the team.","(3) 单词重组：在黑板上写一些字母顺序打乱的单词，把全班分成几队，最先猜出单词的队伍得分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40 mins) Lesson 2: Lunch Time!","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 2 课 Lunch Time! 午餐时间！",0],["h2","1-Part 1:","1. 第 1 部分：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson the first time using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Let the students read the conversation along with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 请学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Is Kai eating?","C",0],["d","Is Kai eating? (Point to Kai.)","T",0],["p","Everybody repeat together.","请大家一起复诵。",0],["d","Look!","Ss",0],["d","Is Kai eating?","Ss",0],["d","Everybody, \"Is Kai eating?\" (With gesture of \"eating.\") Yes or No?","T",0],["d","Yes!","Ss",0],["d","Very good ( Click on the monitor for the next sentence.).","T",0],["d","Yes, he is.","C",0],["d","Everybody please repeat.","T",0],["d","Yes, he is.","Ss",0],["d","Right! What is he eating? ( Click on the monitor.)","T",0],["d","He is eating rice.","C",0],["d","Everybody please repeat.","T",0],["d","He is eating rice.","Ss",0],["d","( Point to Sam on the monitor) Everybody look at Sam. How about Sam?","T",0],["p","(Click on the next sentence.)","（点击下一句。）",0],["d","Is Sam eating?","C",0],["d","Is Sam eating?","T",0],["d","Is Sam eating?","Ss",0],["d","Yes or no? Everybody?","T",0],["d","Yes!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Click on the next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Yes, he is.","C",0],["d","(Point to Sam.) Then what is he eating?","T",0],["d","Apple!","Ss",0],["d","Good. (Click on the next sentence.)","T",0],["d","He is eating an apple.","C",0],["d","He is eating an apple. Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","He is eating an apple.","Ss",0],["p","Go over the whole reading using this same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(3) Have a student come to the front of the class. Have him draw something. Let everybody point to him and say, \" He is drawing.\" Have the rest of the students repeat the sentences a few times. Be sure to practice with \"he\" and \"she\". After they've all had a chance to speak, ask the question, \"Is he/she drawing?\" Let them practice with \"yes\" sentences first, and then \"no\" sentence patterns. Do this several times.","(3) 请一位学生到教室前面画一样东西，请大家指着他说 \"He is drawing.\"，其他学生复诵几次，一定要练习 \"he\" 和 \"she\"。每个人都说过之后，问 \"Is he/she drawing?\"，先练习 \"yes\" 的句子，再练习 \"no\" 的句型，重复几次。",0],["li","(4) Put the students in pairs. Give them 1 minute to discuss what action they will perform. Ask each pair to come to the front of the class in turns. When they are in front of the class, one student has his back to the class and does an action while the class starts guessing. The other students answer questions from the class.","(4) 让学生两两一组，给他们 1 分钟讨论要表演什么动作，再请每一组轮流到教室前面。一位学生背对全班做动作，全班开始猜，另一位学生回答全班的问题。",0],["li","(5) Open Book:","(5) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Two: Camping","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 2 课 Camping 露营",0],["h3","2-Part 1: Vocabulary","2. 第 1 部分：单词",0],["li","(1) Show the content which will be taught today on the monitor the first time. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"play\",","(1) 第一次在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"play\" 开始。",0],["d","Play!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \" Play!\"","T",0],["d","Play!","Ss",0],["p","After they practice saying \"play\", click on the next new vocabulary \"milk\",","学生练习说 \"play\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"milk\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"milk!\"","T",0],["d","milk!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach sleep, cook, and sing. Repeat this procedure about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 sleep、cook 和 sing。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) Dice GameAfter they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. This time, you can use the flashcards instead of the touchscreen all-in-one. Put all the flashcards on the board in order, but don't show them the words yet. Number the flashcards from one to five. For \"six\", you can ask the students to do something special, such as asking them to stand up, turn around, and then sit down when they see \"six\"! You can roll the dice by yourself or ask volunteers to roll the dice. The other students have to say the word three times ( or according to the number on the dice.)","(2) 骰子游戏：学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。这次可以用单词卡代替触控一体机：把所有单词卡依序贴在黑板上，但先不要让学生看到字，把单词卡编号 1 到 5。掷到“6”时，可以请学生做点特别的事，例如站起来、转一圈再坐下！老师可以自己掷骰子，或请自愿的学生掷，其他学生要把单词说三次（或依照骰子的点数）。",0],["li","(3) Part 2.2Enter page 2.2 and have the students practice the question sentences and also answering sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct answer at the first. Let them say the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. Then lead the class to check the answers together.","(3) 2.2 部分：进入 2.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习问句和答句。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对答案。",0],["li","(4) Use a chain drill to practice this part some more. Photocopy the question and answer and give them to the students so that each student has either the question or the answer. Have them look for their corresponding partners.","(4) 用接龙练习多练习这部分。复印问句和答句发给学生，每位学生拿到问句或答句，请他们找到对应的搭档。",0],["li","(5) Team Mime Use the new verbs learned in Lesson One and Lesson Two. Divide the class into two teams. Have a team member come to the front. You show or tell them a verb and have the student act it out. The other team has only 30 seconds to guess the answer.","(5) 分队比手画脚：使用第 1 课和第 2 课学到的新动词。把全班分成两队，请一位队员到前面，给他看或告诉他一个动词，请他表演出来，另一队只有 30 秒可以猜答案。",0],["li","(6) Part 2.3 Enter page 2.3 and have the students look at the picture at the beginning. Then tell the students about the picture.","(6) 2.3 部分：进入 2.3 页，一开始先让学生看图片，再告诉学生图片的内容。",0],["d","Can you see Miss Brown?","T",0],["d","Yes.","Ss",0],["d","(Points to Miss Brown) Is Miss Brown eating?","T",0],["d","(Have them say the correct sentence patterns.) No, she is not. She is cooking.","Ss",0],["p","Then check the answer on the touchscreen all-in-one. And do the other exercises using the same procedure.","接着在触控一体机上核对答案，用同样的流程做其他练习。",0],["li","(7) Part-2.4 Enter page 2.4 and lead the students practice the words with short \"u\" sound with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(7) 2.4 部分：进入 2.4 页，带学生跟着触控一体机练习有短元音“u”的单词。",0],["d","(Click on number 1)","T",0],["d","bus!","C",0],["d","Everybody say, \"b-b-b, /b/, /b/, /b/\"","T",0],["d","\"b-b-b, /b/, /b/, /b/\"","Ss",0],["d","Everybody say, \"u-u-u, /︿/- /︿/-/︿/\"","T",0],["d","\"u-u-u, /︿/- /︿/-/︿/\"","Ss",0],["d","bus!","T",0],["d","Bus!","Ss",0],["p","Have the students repeat all the words with the procedure above. Use flashcards to teach the meaning of these words.","用上面的流程请学生复诵所有单词，再用单词卡教这些单词的意思。",0],["li","(8) Part 2.5Review the sounds of \"u\" before watching the touchscreen all-in-one","(8) 2.5 部分：看触控一体机之前先复习“u”的音。",0],["d","U-U-U","T",0],["d","u-u-u","Ss",0],["d","U-u","T",0],["d","bus!","Ss",0],["p","Play the touchscreen all-in-one and tell the students if they hear the \"u\" sound, please jump up, and clap their hands.","播放触控一体机，告诉学生听到“u”的音时要跳起来拍手。",0],["li","(9) Open the Book Have the students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","(9) 打开课本：请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(10) Writing practice","(10) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write complete sentences on the board according to hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly will be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["p","Listening Comprehension:","听力理解：",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the teaches needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["li","(1) Listen to the words and write down the number in the correct picture","(1) 听单词，把数字写在正确的图片上",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students be \"B\". Do it again, switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in the correct picture.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write the numbers (1, 2, 3) in the correct order.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them listen to you and do the exercise. (The teachers can read the words again if necessary.) Take a look around and correct the students' answers.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，订正学生的答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen to the words and match","(2) 听单词，连连看",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Introduce this section by playing the monolog. Let's Check- Monolog:","播放独白介绍这个部分。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What can you see in a baseball diamond? What do you need when you play baseball? Please turn to page 6, Let's Check. Listen to the words and match.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to connect the words to the correct picture while listening to the MP 3. Continue to play the MP 3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边把单词和正确的图片连起来。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP 3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish, start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog again if necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Check \"V\" what you and your friend can do","(3) 练习：勾选“V”你和朋友会做的事",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by eliciting answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15 mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review today's lesson using the books.","(1) 用课本复习今天的课程。",0],["li","(2) Review today's lesson using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习今天的课程。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so that they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have the students write them down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. This is a good time to give students reward cards according their performance today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them that they are going to have telephone teaching in a couple of days.","(3) 提醒学生过几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #1","电话教学教材 #1",0],["d","Hello. How are you?","T",0],["d","Fine, thanks. How are you?","S",0],["d","Fine, thank you. Are you old?","T",0],["d","No, I am a not. I am not old.","S",0],["d","That's good. Make a sentence with \"eating\".","T",0],["d","I am eating a/an ________.","S",0],["d","Good. Now make a sentence with \"reading\".","T",0],["d","________ is reading a book.","S",0],["d","Are you watching TV?","T",0],["d","Yes/No, ___________.","S",0],["d","Very good. Bye-bye.","T",0]],"g":[[26,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activities","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1"]],[31,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV"]],[31,["Book 3","Classroom Reader","Lesson 2","Learning","And","Playing"]],[69,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 2","Part 2.1","Vocabulary","Part 2.2","Find and Connected","Pictures. Then make a","question.","Part 2.3","Look at the pictures and","answer the questions.","Part 2.4","Part 2.5"]],[138,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Lunch Time!"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 3 课","t":"Class 3","k":"class","p":[21,22,23,24],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CA To ask / answer questions about what one is doing To talk about activities","C.A.：能问答某人正在做什么；能谈论各种活动。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","To ask / answer questions about what one is doing To talk about activities Extending a conversation Making or accepting invitations Asking others about their habits Helping others to feel at ease","能问答某人正在做什么；能谈论各种活动。延续对话；提出或接受邀请；询问别人的习惯；让别人感到自在",1],["d","Review","Classroom Readers",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson 3","Classroom Activities 3A 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 1","EEC 2 第 1 课",1],["h3","vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Cap, baseball diamond, first base, mitt, mask.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Do you want to join us?","A",1],["d","Of course.","B",1],["d","Bring your cap, OK?","A",1],["d","Great! I will.","B",1],["d","I am sure the team will like you.","A",1],["d","That's cool.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) This is a review lesson. Spend this class reviewing the content of the previous lessons. Especially the parts where your students need additional reinforcement.","(1) 这是一堂复习课。用这堂课复习之前课程的内容，特别是学生需要额外加强的部分。",0],["li","(2) Attendance spelling. As you call out their names, have them spell a word they have learned.","(2) 点名拼写：点名时请学生拼一个学过的单词。",0],["li","(3) Word RecallWrite between 15-20 words on the board. You can refer to S2 for any additional words, if you'd like. Quickly review any words they may have forgotten. Then, erase the words and have them write down as many words they can remember. The one with the most correctly spelled words is the winner.","(3) 单词记忆：在黑板上写 15–20 个单词，也可以参考 S2 加入其他单词。快速复习学生可能忘记的字，再擦掉，请学生写出所有记得的单词，拼对最多的人获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40 mins)","Classroom Readers（40 mins）",0],["h2","Review Section","复习部分",0],["li","(1) Quickly show the content of the previous lessons using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 用触控一体机快速展示之前课程的内容。",0],["li","(2) Let the students complete the conversations by themselves while looking at the pictures on the monitor. Who can speak out a sentence can win one point for his or her team. If any one of them can speak the sentence totally correctly, he or she can win two points for his or her team.","(2) 请学生看着屏幕上的图片，自己完成对话。能说出一个句子的人为自己的队伍得一分；能完全正确说出句子的人得两分。",0],["h3","(3) Target sentences practice-","(3) 目标句型练习：",0],["p","Give each student one flashcard, and ask anyone of them stand up and do the action according to his or her flashcard. While he or she is doing the action, the others have to point to the student and say the sentence, \" He/ She is ___ing.\" For example,","每位学生发一张单词卡，请任一位学生站起来，依照自己的单词卡做动作。他做动作时，其他人要指着他说 \"He/She is ___ing.\"。例如：",0],["d","Sam! Stand up, please.","T",0],["d","( He has the \"eating\" flashcard.) ( Pretending eating.)","S1",0],["d","Everybody point to Sam and say the sentence. 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","He is eating.","Ss",0],["d","Very good.","T",0],["p","Go over this procedure, until everybody gets a chance to stand up and do the action. You can also do individual practice.","依照这个流程进行，直到每个人都有机会站起来做动作，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(4) Review \"yes/No\" questions for the students when they are all familiar with last target sentence. Divide the students into two teams, and put the flashcards on the board. But you have to hold one set of the flashcard meanwhile. Give each team one plastic hammer, and ask one student form each team come up to the front of the classroom and back to the board.","(4) 学生都熟悉上一个目标句型后，复习“Yes/No”问句。把学生分成两队，把单词卡贴在黑板上，但您手上要另外拿一组单词卡。每队一支塑料锤，每队派一位学生到教室前面，背对黑板。",0],["d","(Show any one of you flashcard to the class. For example, \"singing.\")","T",0],["d","Is he/ she singing?","Ss",0],["d","(Shake your head.)","T",0],["d","No, he is not.","Ss",0],["d","(Show another flashcard.)","T",0],["d","Is he/ she ____?","Ss",0],["p","If you shake your head. They answer \"no\" again. If you nod your head, they answer with \"yes\" sentence. As soon as they say \"yes- sentence\", the two students who stands in the front has to turn back to hit the correct flashcard immediately and say, \" He/ She is ____ing.\" After saying the sentence, they have to run back to their seats and sit down. Who is back to the seat faster will be the winner.","如果您摇头，学生要再回答“no”；如果您点头，学生要用“yes”的句子回答。学生一说出 yes 的句子，站在前面的两位学生就要立刻转身敲正确的单词卡，并说 \"He/She is ___ing.\"，说完要跑回座位坐下，较快回到座位的人获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Three","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 3 课",0],["p","3-Part 1 Answer the questions about yourself. Then choose a partner to take turns","3. 第 1 部分：回答关于自己的问题，再找一位搭档轮流",0],["h3","",null,0],["h3","asking and answering questions","问答",0],["li","(1) Do a quick review of some of the adjective they've learned.","(1) 快速复习一些学过的形容词。",0],["li","(2) Enter page 3.1 and have the students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 进入 3.1 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。",0],["d","(Click on the first question.)","T",0],["d","Are you Japanese?","C",0],["d","Are you Japanese?","T",0],["d","No, I am not.","Ss",0],["p","You can also call on students individually to speak out their answers. Then move to question 2 and go over them process to lead the students to practice until they practice every question.","也可以个别叫学生说出答案，再进行第 2 题，用同样的流程带学生练习，直到每一题都练习过。",0],["h3","(3) Part 3.2- Unscramble the words.","(3) 3.2 部分：单词重组",0],["li","a. Re-teach this section by writing scrambled words on the board and have the students unscramble them. It could be a competitive game. Which team can recognize the word first will be the winner.","a. 在黑板上写字母打乱的单词，请学生重组，重新教这个部分。可以用比赛的方式进行，最先认出单词的队伍获胜。",0],["li","b. Enter page 3.2 and have students complete the exercise with the touchscreen all-in-one. You can also play a spelling game meanwhile. For example, you have to divide the students into two teams first, then start to lead the student work with the monitor.","b. 进入 3.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机完成练习。也可以同时玩拼写游戏：先把学生分成两队，再带学生跟着屏幕练习。",0],["d","(Click on the first scrambled word.) What word is this?","T",0],["d","reading!","Ss",0],["p","There are seven letters in this word. Each team has to make seven students stand up and spell out the word together. But each student can only speak out one letter. The first one would be the winner.","这个字有七个字母，每队要派七位学生站起来一起拼出这个字，但每人只能说一个字母，最快的队伍获胜。",0],["h3","(4) Part3.3- Fill in the blanks.","(4) 3.3 部分：填空",0],["p","Enter page 2.3 and have the students practice this part with the words they've learned. This is fairly straightforward. Have them look at the words Match the words with the sentences. Don't forget to make sure they use the indefinite article.","进入 3.3 页，请学生用学过的单词练习这部分。这很简单：请学生看单词，把单词和句子配对。别忘了确认他们有使用不定冠词。",0],["h3","(5) Part 3.4- More Fill in the Blanks.","(5) 3.4 部分：更多填空",0],["p","Enter page 2.3 and have the students see the picture at the beginning. Then show the students how to do the exercise by the example. Don't click on the answer before the student takes a try to complete the sentence by themselves. Let them find out the word according to the given ones first. Then check the answer on the touchscreen all-in-one. And do all of the exercises by the same procedure.","进入 3.4 页，一开始先让学生看图片，再用例题示范做法。学生自己试着完成句子之前，不要点击答案；让他们先依照提供的字找出答案，再在触控一体机上核对。所有练习都用同样的流程进行。",0],["h3","(6) Part-3.5- Phonics Review","(6) 3.5 部分：发音复习",0],["p","Enter page 3.5 and lead the students Review the sound of \"ch\", \"s\", \"es\", \"ing\", and short \"u\".","进入 3.5 页，带学生复习“ch”、“s”、“es”、“ing”和短元音“u”的音。",0],["li","a. Lead the student do the exercise with the touchscreen all-in-one as a class. You can also them to do some gesture to make this exercise fun. For example, if the word has the same sound as the first word, they have to raise their two hands up and make them a circle. If it doesn't, they have to make a \"cross\" with their hands. Check the answer after they do the gesture.","a. 带全班跟着触控一体机做练习，也可以请学生做一些手势让练习更有趣。例如：单词和第一个字的音相同，就举起双手围成圆圈；不同的话，就用双手比出“叉叉”。做完手势后再核对答案。",0],["li","b. Write a list of words that include these sounds on the board and practice speed reading with your students.","b. 在黑板上写一串含有这些音的单词，和学生练习快速朗读。",0],["h3","(7) Phonics Game-Tic- Tac- Toe","(7) 发音游戏：圈圈叉叉",0],["p","Draw a tic-tac-toe grid on the board. Number each space. Divide the class in to two teams. The first players choose a space. The teacher says a word that they have never studied. Using their phonics skills, the student must determine what the beginning letter of the word is. If they guess correctly, that player's team gets the space on the tic-tac-toe grid.","在黑板上画井字格，每格编号，把全班分成两队。第一位玩家选一格，老师说一个学生没学过的单词，学生要运用发音技巧判断这个字的第一个字母是什么。猜对的话，该队就得到那一格。",0],["h3","(8) Open the Book","(8) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(9) Writing practice","(9) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hint from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly would be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation. Note: Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Write great and wonderful things about the children to the parents, and remind the parents to push the student review the learning content from class one to class three and preview the homework and listen to the tape.","(3) 写一些称赞孩子的话给家长，并提醒家长督促孩子复习第 1 课到第 3 课的内容、预习作业并听录音。",0]],"g":[[29,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV"]],[29,["Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[48,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Lesson 3","Part 3.1","Part 3.2","Unscramble the words.","Part 3.3","Fill in the blanks.","Part 3.4","Part 3.5"]],[79,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼ 儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 3","New Words"]],[79,["Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[89,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 4 课","t":"Class 4","k":"class","p":[25,26,27,28,29],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CA To ask/ answer questions about what one is doing To express activities","C.A.：能问答某人正在做什么；能表达各种活动。",1],["h3","ECC: Asking other's if they are ready","EEC：询问别人是否准备好了",1],["p","Giving or responding to blessings","给予或回应祝福",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Review","Classroom Readers 复习",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson4","Classroom Activities 3A 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Color, coloring, sing, singing, feed, feeding",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 2","EEC 2 第 2 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","plant, piano, fish tank, armchair, vase, carpet.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Are you ready, son?","A",1],["d","Yeah.","B",1],["d","Have a nice game!","A",1],["d","Thanks, mom!","B",1],["d","And good luck.","A",1],["d","Thanks. I really need it.","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Start the class by giving them a surprise spelling quiz. Give them 10-20 words that they should know how to spell. It can also be a competitive game.","(1) 上课一开始先来个突击拼写小测验，考 10–20 个学生应该会拼的字，也可以用比赛的方式进行。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the new words. Write them on the board and \"act them out\" as you are writing them on the board. Have an outgoing student come to the front and act out the new words. ( You can have a lot of fun with feeding.) Make sure you teach them how to spell the new words.","(2) 介绍新单词：把单词写在黑板上，写的同时“演出来”。请一位外向的学生到前面表演新单词（feeding 可以玩得很开心）。一定要教学生怎么拼这些新单词。",0],["li","(3) Game: ConcentrationYou'll need to prepare before class. Write an even number of numbers in rows on a piece of paper. Then write a different vocabulary word under two different numbers. Each word should be written twice. When you want to play the game, write the numbers, not the words, on the board. Divide the class into two teams. The first contestant should choose two numbers in English. Look at the cheat sheet that was prepared before class and tell the students what word goes with those two numbers. If the words are a match, then that team wins a point. Of the words don't match, then the play goes to the other team where a player must guess two more numbers and try to get a match. The team that ends up with the most matches wins the game. You might also have the students spell the words that they match up before you award them a point. Another option is to have them use the word in a sentence.","(3) 游戏：记忆翻牌。需要在上课前准备：在一张纸上一排排写下偶数个数字，再把不同的单词写在两个不同的数字下面，每个单词写两次。玩游戏时，只把数字（不是单词）写在黑板上。把全班分成两队，第一位参赛者用英语选两个数字，老师看课前准备好的对照表，告诉学生这两个数字对应什么字。如果两个字相同，该队得一分；不同的话，就换另一队的玩家猜另外两个数字，试着配对。配对最多的队伍获胜。也可以要求学生拼出配对到的单词，或用这个字造句，才给分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40 mins) Review Section","Classroom Readers（40 mins）复习部分",0],["li","(1) Show the content of the previous lessons quickly by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 用触控一体机快速展示之前课程的内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students complete the conversations by themselves with looking at the pictures on the monitor. Who can speak out a sentence can win one point for his or her team. If any one of them can speak the sentence totally correctly, he or she can win two points for his or her team.","(2) 带学生看着屏幕上的图片，自己完成对话。能说出一个句子的人为自己的队伍得一分；能完全正确说出句子的人得两分。",0],["h3","(3) Target sentences practice-","(3) 目标句型练习：",0],["p","Show one flashcard each time. The student has to answer the question according to your hint and also the flashcard shown by you at the same time. For example,","每次展示一张单词卡，学生要依照您的提示和您展示的单词卡回答问题。例如：",0],["d","(Show the student the flashcard of \"eating\".) What is he doing?","T",0],["d","He is eating.","Ss",0],["p","Go over this procedure, until every word is practiced. You can also do individual practice.","依照这个流程进行，直到每个单词都练习过，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(4) Review \"yes/No\" questions for the students when they are all familiar with last target sentence. Divide the students into two teams, and put the flashcards on the board. But you have to hold one set of the flashcard meanwhile. Give each team one plastic hammer, and ask one student form each team come up to the front of the classroom and back to the board.","(4) 学生都熟悉上一个目标句型后，复习“Yes/No”问句。把学生分成两队，把单词卡贴在黑板上，但您手上要另外拿一组单词卡。每队一支塑料锤，每队派一位学生到教室前面，背对黑板。",0],["d","(Show any one of you flashcard to the class. For example, \"singing.\")","T",0],["d","Is he/ she singing?","Ss",0],["d","(Shake your head.)","T",0],["d","No, he is not.","Ss",0],["d","(Show another flashcard.)","T",0],["d","Is he/ she ____?","Ss",0],["p","If you shake your head. They answer \"no\" again. If you nod your head, they answer with \"yes\" sentence. As soon as they say \"yes- sentence\", the two students who stands in the front has to turn back to hit the correct flashcard immediately and say, \" He/ She is ____ing.\" After saying the sentence, they have to run back to their seats and sit down. Who is back to the seat faster will be the winner.","如果您摇头，学生要再回答“no”；如果您点头，学生要用“yes”的句子回答。学生一说出 yes 的句子，站在前面的两位学生就要立刻转身敲正确的单词卡，并说 \"He/She is ___ing.\"，说完要跑回座位坐下，较快回到座位的人获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Four","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 4 课",0],["h3","4-Part 1 Vocabulary","4. 第 1 部分：单词",0],["li","(1) Quickly review the new words. Incorporate these words into the sentence patterns. She is coloring, she is singing and he is feeding the fish. Practice this chorally and individually.","(1) 快速复习新单词，把这些字放进句型中：She is coloring. She is singing. He is feeding the fish. 先全班一起练习，再个别练习。",0],["li","(2) Enter page 4.1 and have the students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 进入 4.1 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。",0],["d","(Click on the first word.)","T",0],["d","coloring.","C",0],["d","coloring. Everybody repeat, 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","coloring!","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Let's see next one. ( Click on \"singing.\")","T",0],["d","singing.","C",0],["d","1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","singing.","Ss",0],["p","Go over the same procedure for several time until all the student are getting familiar with all the new words of this lesson.","用同样的流程反复几次，直到所有学生都熟悉本课的新单词。",0],["h3","(3) Game-Pass the Word.","(3) 游戏：传话",0],["p","Divide the class into teams. And also divide the board into two parts. Give each team on marker. When the game starts, ask number one from two teams go out of the classroom with the teacher. You have to tell this two students one word. Then make them back to the classroom and pass word to the student who is behind him or her. Then the second done pass it to the third one... The last one has to run to the board and write down the answer very quickly. If they can write the correct word, they can get one point. If hey can also spell them correctly, they can get two points. After the first term, the number one student goes to the last one of his or her team. Then go over the game one more time. Try your best to let all the students has a chance to write the word if you have enough time.","把全班分成几队，黑板也分成两部分，每队一支白板笔。游戏开始时，请两队的 1 号学生跟老师到教室外，告诉这两位学生一个单词，再让他们回到教室，把字传给后面的学生，第二位再传给第三位……最后一位要跑到黑板前很快写下答案。写对单词得一分，拼写也正确得两分。第一轮结束后，1 号学生排到队伍最后，再玩一次。时间足够的话，尽量让每位学生都有机会写字。",0],["h3","(4) Part 4.2- Break Time.","(4) 4.2 部分：休息时间",0],["li","a. It's break time! What are all these people doing during their break? Go through each of the examples with your students. You can either ask a question or make a statement like, \"Look! He's feeding the fish!\"","a. 休息时间到了！这些人在休息时间做什么呢？和学生一起看每个例子，可以问问题，或说 \"Look! He's feeding the fish!\" 这样的句子。",0],["li","b. Enter page 4.2 and have students complete the exercise with the touchscreen all-in-one. You can give them chance to do free talking first. For example,","b. 进入 4.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机完成练习。可以先让学生自由对话。例如：",0],["d","What are they doing?","T",0],["d","Drinking!","S1",0],["d","Very good! Could you come to the front to point to the person who is drinking?","T",0],["d","(Come to point.)","S1",0],["d","Very good. And anybody else can tell me something more?","T",0],["d","She is coloring.","S2",0],["d","Very good.","T",0],["p","Repeat the same procedure for several times until most of them have practiced. Ask them to listen to the touchscreen all-in-one and practice together with you after they have done the free talking practice.","重复同样的流程几次，直到大部分学生都练习过。自由对话练习后，请学生听触控一体机，和您一起练习。",0],["h3","(5) Part4.3- Pair Work.","(5) 4.3 部分：两人练习",0],["p","Enter page 2.3 and have the students practice this part with the words they've learned. This is fairly straightforward. Have them look at the words Match the words with the sentences. Don't forget to make sure they use the indefinite article.","进入 3.3 页，请学生用学过的单词练习这部分。这很简单：请学生看单词，把单词和句子配对。别忘了确认他们有使用不定冠词。",0],["h3","(6) Part 4.4- Interview Your Classmates","(6) 4.4 部分：访问同学",0],["li","1. Ask the student to put an X besides the corresponding picture. They are not to show their classmates what they have chosen.","1. 请学生在对应的图片旁画 X，不可以让同学看到自己选了什么。",0],["li","2. After they have filled the little form, ask them to interview 5 of their classmates by asking, \" What is your name? Are you ________?\" They need to complete the chart by making X in the right box.","2. 填完小表格后，请学生访问 5 位同学，问 \"What is your name? Are you ___?\"，并在正确的格子画 X 完成表格。",0],["h3","(7) Part-4.5- Phonics Review: S/ES","(7) 4.5 部分：发音复习 S/ES",0],["p","Enter page 4.5 and lead the students Review the sound of \"s\", and \"es\". Lead the student do the exercise with the touchscreen all-in-one as a class. Read each word to the class and have them repeat after you. Really emphasize the two sounds because they are so easily confused.","进入 4.5 页，带学生复习“s”和“es”的音，带全班跟着触控一体机做练习。逐一念出每个字，请学生跟着您复诵，特别强调这两个音，因为它们很容易混淆。",0],["d","cats!","C",0],["d","Cats! Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Cats!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody say, \"one cat.\"","T",0],["d","One cat.","Ss",0],["d","Two cats.","T",0],["d","Two cats.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Let's listen to next word.","T",0],["d","clowns.","C",0],["h3","(8) Phonics Game-Hit the Correct Sound.","(8) 发音游戏：敲出正确的音",0],["p","Write \"S\" and \"ES\" on the board. And divide the class into two teams. Each team has one plastic hammer from you. They have to listen to you carefully and hit \"S\" when they hear a word with s sound. On the other hand, they have to hit \"ES\" when they hear the word with \"es\" sound. When they hit the board, they have to repeat the word again. If he or she can hit the correct half of the board, he or she can get point for the team.","在黑板上写“S”和“ES”，把全班分成两队，每队一支塑料锤。学生要仔细听，听到 s 音的字就敲“S”，听到 es 音的字就敲“ES”，敲完要再念一次那个字。敲对的人为队伍得分。",0],["h3","(9) The drawing Competition Game.","(9) 画画比赛",0],["p","Divide the class into two teams. Call out one student from each team to the front of the classroom. Call out an object or a sentence. Give them 30 seconds to draw the picture. The student, who draws the best picture, gets a point.","把全班分成两队，每队叫一位学生到教室前面。说出一样东西或一个句子，给他们 30 秒画出来，画得最好的人得一分。",0],["li","(10) Open the Book:","(10) 打开课本：",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(11) Writing practice","(11) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly will be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["li","(12) Activity Sheet 2:","(12) 活动单 2：",0],["p","When the students are quite familiar with the sentence patterns, give them Activity Sheet 2. Have them look at the pictures and make sentences. If they are unsure, warm them up a bit by drilling and practicing the sentence patterns. You may also write some sample sentence patterns on the board. Now have them do Activity Sheet 2.","学生相当熟悉句型后，发下活动单 2，请他们看图造句。如果学生不太确定，先用操练和练习句型帮他们热身，也可以在黑板上写一些句型范例，再请他们写活动单 2。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\" Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See And Say\" section in lesson two. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 2 课“Let's See And Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","The little boy is talking with his mother in the living room. He is ready for the game. Are you ready? Let's go and play baseball.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have just listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. Teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, Teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["li","Step 5:","步骤 5：",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["li","Step 6:","步骤 6：",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Write great and wonderful things about the children to the parents, and remind the parents to push the student review the learning content from class one to class three and preview the homework and listen to the tape.","(3) 写一些称赞孩子的话给家长，并提醒家长督促孩子复习第 1 课到第 3 课的内容、预习作业并听录音。",0],["li","(4) Remind the students that they are going to have a telephone teaching in the couple of days.","(4) 提醒学生过几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #2","电话教学教材 #2",0],["d","Hello. How are you?","T",0],["d","I'm fine. Thank you!","S",0],["d","Are you sleeping?","T",0],["d","No, I am not. I am not sleeping.","S",0],["d","That's good. Are you feeding the fish?","T",0],["d","Yes/No, ____________.","S",0],["d","OK. Now make a sentence with \"dancing\".","T",0],["d","___________________.","S",0],["d","Make a sentence with \"coloring\".","T",0],["d","____________________.","S",0],["d","Good. Bye-bye.","T",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[28,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids"]],[28,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 4","Part 4.1","Part 4.2","Break Time.","Part 4.3","Pair Work.","Part 4.4","Interview Your Classmate","Part 4.5","Phonics Review"]],[44,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4","New Words","Learning & Playing","Translation"]],[115,["● Follow the same","steps above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 5 课","t":"Class 5","k":"class","p":[30,31,32,33,34],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CA:","C.A.：",1],["p","To identify things in the singular/ plural form To express activities identify clothing ECC:","能说出单数／复数的物品；能表达各种活动；能说出衣物名称。EEC：",1],["p","Asking other's if they are ready Giving or responding to blessings","询问别人是否准备好了；给予或回应祝福",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson3","Classroom Readers 第 3 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Pay attention, computer, these",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","This is/ These are _________(s).",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson5","Classroom Activities 3A 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Your, jacket, shirt, sock(s), shoe(s)",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 2","EEC 2 第 2 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","plant, piano, fish tank, armchair, vase, carpet.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Are you ready, son?","A",1],["d","Yeah.","B",1],["d","Have a nice game!","A",1],["d","Thanks, mom!","B",1],["d","And good luck.","A",1],["d","Thanks. I really need it.","B",1],["h2","Greeting (10 mins)","打招呼（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Attendance spelling. Call on an unsuspecting student and have them spell a word from the previous lessons.","(1) 点名拼写：叫一位没有预期的学生，请他拼一个之前课程的单词。",0],["li","(2) It can also be a competitive game- You can fix all the flashcard of the vocabulary (Without the word, only the picture.) which they've learned on the board, and number them. Each word has a number then. Let the students take turn to come to the front of the classroom and take a draw. You show the number on the draw to the class, then call on a number of the student. The student has to come to write the first letter of the word, then pass the marker to next student to let him or her to write second letter of the word...when the last student from the team finish writing the last letter of the word, his or her team should shout, \" teacher me!\" If they spell the word correctly, they can get some points.","(2) 也可以用比赛的方式进行：把学过的所有单词单词卡（只有图、没有字）贴在黑板上并编号，每个字对应一个号码。请学生轮流到教室前面抽签，您把签上的号码给全班看，再叫一个学生的号码。这位学生要上台写出单词的第一个字母，再把白板笔传给下一位写第二个字母……该队最后一位写完最后一个字母时，全队要喊 \"Teacher, me!\"，拼对就能得分。",0],["li","(3) Introduce the new words to the students. Be sure to teach them the plural forms as well.","(3) 向学生介绍新单词，一定也要教复数形。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40mins) Lesson 3 Computer Games!","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 3 课 Computer Games! 电脑游戏！",0],["h3","5-Part 1","5. 第 1 部分",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson at the first time by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Students!","C",0],["d","Students! (Point to yourself.) Yes or no?","T",0],["d","No!","Ss",0],["d","Students! (Point to the students) Yes or no?","T",0],["d","Yes!","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Everybody point to yourself and say \"students!\" 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Students!","Ss",0],["d","Pay attention!","C",0],["d","Everybody say, \"pay attention.\"","T",0],["d","Pay attention.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody is paying attention now. (point to the computer in the picture.) What is this?","T",0],["d","A computer!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","This is a touchscreen all-in-one.","C",0],["d","Let's repeat it again.","T",0],["d","This is a touchscreen all-in-one.","Ss",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(4) Hold up one pencil and say, \" This is a pencil.\" Have the class repeat after you.","(4) 拿起一枝铅笔说 \"This is a pencil.\"，请全班跟着您复诵。",0],["li","(5) Hold up four or five pencils and say, \" These are pencils.\" Once again, have the class repeat after you. We're teaching them the concept of plurals. Continue this exercise with various other objects.","(5) 拿起四、五枝铅笔说 \"These are pencils.\"，再请全班跟着您复诵。这是在教学生复数的概念。用其他各种物品继续这个练习。",0],["li","(6) \"Pay attention\" can be fun to teach. Have them pretend that they are falling asleep. Yell out, \"Pay attention!\" and have them all wake up and listen to you.","(6) 教 \"Pay attention\" 可以很有趣：请学生假装快睡着了，您大喊 \"Pay attention!\"，请大家醒过来听您说话。",0],["li","(7) Open Book:","(7) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually. Be sure to point the use of \"this\" and \"these\".","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。一定要指出 \"this\" 和 \"these\" 的用法。",0],["h3","(8) Game- Invisible Elephant","(8) 游戏：隐形大象",0],["p","Divide the class into two teams. Tell the students that you are going to draw a picture for them. Draw the outline of an elephant in the air with your finger. Ask them, \" What is this?\" The person who correctly identifies and spells the object wins a point for their team.","把全班分成两队，告诉学生您要画一张图给他们看。用手指在空中画出大象的轮廓，问 \"What is this?\"，正确说出并拼出这样东西的人为自己的队伍得一分。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Five","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 5 课",0],["h2","5-Part 1 vocabulary:","5. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content which will be taught today on the monitor at the first time. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"jacket\",","(1) 第一次在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"jacket\" 开始。",0],["d","jacket!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \" jacket!\"","T",0],["d","jacket!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"jacket\", click on next new vocabulary- \" shirt\",","学生练习说 \"jacket\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"shirt\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"repeat!\"","T",0],["d","repeat!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach skirt, sock(s), and shoe(s). Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 skirt、sock(s) 和 shoe(s)。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) Dice DrillAfter they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. This time, you can use the flashcards instead of the touchscreen all-in-one. Put all the flashcards on the board in order. Number the flashcards from one to six. Besides the flashcards, you also need a die to do the practice. First, you can lead the students practice the target sentence, \"This is a ______.\" The students have to make sentences according to the number on the die. For example, if you get two dots from the die, and flashcard two is the picture of skirt. They are supposed to say,\" This is a skirt.\" After they get familiar with the singular sentence pattern, use the same way to lead them practice \" These are ______s.\"","(2) 骰子练习：学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。这次可以用单词卡代替触控一体机：把所有单词卡依序贴在黑板上，编号 1 到 6，另外还需要一颗骰子。先带学生练习目标句型 \"This is a ___.\"，学生要依照骰子的点数造句。例如掷出两点，2 号单词卡是裙子，就要说 \"This is a skirt.\"。学生熟悉单数句型后，用同样的方式带他们练习 \"These are ___s.\"。",0],["h3","(3) Part 5.2- Katie's Closet","(3) 5.2 部分：Katie 的衣橱",0],["p","Enter page 5.2 and have students practice the target sentences with you. Ask them to answer the question according to your hint. For example, if you point to one of the shirts and ask them, \" What is this?\" They have to answer, \"This is a shirt.\" If you point to the skirts and ask, \" What are these?\" They have to answer, \" These are skirts.\"You can lead the students go over the whole exercise (Both of part A and B) first. But try your best to make the student answer the questions according to the pictures and your hint by themselves.","进入 5.2 页，请学生跟着您练习目标句型，依照您的提示回答问题。例如：您指着其中一件衬衫问 \"What is this?\"，学生要回答 \"This is a shirt.\"；指着裙子问 \"What are these?\"，学生要回答 \"These are skirts.\"。可以先带学生把整个练习（A 和 B 部分）做一遍，但尽量让学生自己依照图片和您的提示回答。",0],["li","(4) Part A-Pair them up and have them do the exercises together. After they've completed the exercises, have them read their answer to the class. Part B- Look at the pictures and have them write the answers Have them read their answers out loud again.","(4) A 部分：让学生两两一组一起做练习，完成后请他们向全班念出答案。B 部分：请学生看图写答案，再大声念出答案。",0],["li","(5) After doing Step 4 and 5, you can check the answers by the touchscreen all-in-one with you students.","(5) 完成步骤 4 和 5 后，可以和学生一起用触控一体机核对答案。",0],["h3","(6) Game- parrots","(6) 游戏：鹦鹉",0],["p","The students are the parrots in this game. They have to repeat what you say, but only your statement is true. If the statement is false, the students have to keep silent. You can modify this statement for \"this\" and \"these\".","学生在这个游戏中当鹦鹉，要重复您说的话，但只有在您说的是真的时候才能重复；如果说的是错的，学生要保持安静。可以把句子改成 \"this\" 和 \"these\" 的句型。",0],["h3","(7) Part5.3- Phonics- Short O","(7) 5.3 部分：自然拼读　短元音 O",0],["p","Enter page 5.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with short O sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. For example,","进入 5.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有短元音 O 的单词发音。例如：",0],["d","( Click on the first word.)","T",0],["d","Sock!","C",0],["d","Sock! Everybody repeat, 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Sock!","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Everybody! \"S-S-S?\"","T",0],["d","/s/-/s/-/s/","Ss",0],["d","O-O-O","T",0],["d","/a/-/a/-/a/","Ss",0],["d","/s/ /a/","T",0],["d","/sa/","Ss",0],["d","c-k, c-k, /k/-/k/-/k/, repeat!","T",0],["d","c-k, c-k, /k/-/k/-/k/","Ss",0],["d","Say, \" socks!\"","T",0],["d","socks!","Ss",0],["p","Repeat the procedure several time to let them practice all the short O words.","重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有短元音 O 的单词。",0],["li","(8) Part 5.4 Make the students open their book to page 25 and listen to you carefully. They have to try to make appropriate response by writing \"check\" or \"cross\" by themselves first. Enter page 2.3 and have the students check the answers of part 5.4 after they finish their writing practice.","(8) 5.4 部分：请学生打开课本第 25 页仔细听您念，先自己试着写“勾”或“叉”做出适当的反应。写完后，进入触控一体机的 5.4 页，请学生核对 5.4 部分的答案。",0],["h3","(9) Open the Book","(9) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(10) Writing practice","(10) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hint from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly would be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["p","Listening Comprehension:","听力理解：",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises the, teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and use a \"V\" or an \"X\"","(1) 听一听，用“V”或“X”作答",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and write a \"V\" or an \"X\" according to the word you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write a \"V\" or an \"X\" according to the word you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and circle","(2) 听一听，圈出答案",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What can you see in the living room? There is a piano, a fish tank, a vase, a plant and a carpet. Please turn to page 10. Let's Check. Listen to the words and circle.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to circle the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边圈出正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["d","Connect the things you have at home to \"Your House.\"","Exercise",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 7","步骤 7",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15 mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them to review for test one which is on class 7. And they are going to have a quiz and listening lab next time.","(3) 提醒学生准备第 7 课的测验 1，下次上课有小测验和听力练习。",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[28,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV"]],[28,["Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 5","Part 5.1","Vocabulary","Part 5.2","Katie's Closet","Part 5.3","Phonics- Short O","Part 5.4"]],[95,["'","● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Computer Games!"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 6 课","t":"Class 6","k":"class","p":[35,36,37],"b":[["h3","Review Day 1","复习日 1",1],["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CA:","C.A.：",1],["p","To review everything they've learned To have a writing quiz and listening quiz ECC:","复习所有学过的内容；进行笔试小测验和听力小测验。EEC：",1],["p","Asking other's if they are ready Giving or responding to blessings","询问别人是否准备好了；给予或回应祝福",1],["h3","Classroom Readers none","Classroom Readers：无",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","review","复习",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A none","Classroom Activities 3A：无",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","review","复习",1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Listening Lab tapes, tape recorder, review flash cards, copy of the quiz and the test, phonics flashcards","听力练习录音带、录音机、复习单词卡、小测验和测验卷复印件、发音单词卡",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 2","EEC 2 第 2 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","plant, piano, fish tank, armchair, vase, carpet.",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Are you ready, son?","A",1],["d","Yeah.","B",1],["d","Have a nice game!","A",1],["d","Thanks, mom!","B",1],["d","And good luck.","A",1],["d","Thanks. I really need it.","B",1],["h2","Quiz Review (20 mins)","小测验复习 Quiz Review（20 mins）",0],["p","Take this time to review for the quiz. Have a copy of the quiz and go over each portion with your class. Don't let them see the quiz. There are many ways you can review for the quiz, such as drill, oral practice and board work. Of course you can also make all of the practice as team competitions. If they run everything well, and you still have plenty of time, you can also use the digital equipment to review for them.","利用这段时间为小测验做复习。拿一份小测验卷，和全班逐一复习每个部分，但不要让学生看到考卷。复习的方法很多，例如操练、口语练习和黑板练习，当然也可以把所有练习都设计成分队比赛。如果一切顺利、时间还很充裕，也可以用数字教学设备帮学生复习。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Get the students prepared for the quiz. Have them clear any unnecessary items from their desks. And ask them to separate their seats from each other.","让学生准备小测验，请他们把桌上不需要的东西收起来，并把座位分开。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Do a couple of listening exercises to \"warm up\" their ears. Turn on the tape recorder and have them write down their answers. Try not to play each portion of the listening lab more than twice. The words on the tape should be clear enough and slow enough for them to understand.","先做几题听力练习让学生的耳朵“热身”，再播放录音带请学生写下答案。听力练习的每个部分尽量不要播放超过两次。录音带上的单词应该够清楚、够慢，让学生听得懂。",0],["h2","Test Review","测验复习",0],["h3","Games/ Activities","游戏／活动",0],["li","1. The students have just been introduced to the present progressive tense in both the question and answer patterns. You should play a variety of games and activities that will further reinforce these ideas. If they seem to grasp the present progressive tense, you might want to review numbers, color or anything else that is relevant. Here are a couple of suggested activities.","1. 学生刚学过现在进行时的问句和答句，应该玩各种游戏和活动来加强这些观念。如果学生似乎已经掌握现在进行时，可以复习数字、颜色或其他相关内容。以下是一些建议活动。",0],["li","2. True/ False Chair. You make a statement and the students run to the chair marked \" True\" or the other chair marked \" False\". First, give the students in each team a number. Hold up a flash card and name an object followed by a number. If the card dose not show the object you've called out, then number two runs to the false chair. If the card shows the object you've called out, they should run to the \"True Chair\". The player who sits in the correct chair wins a point. While the student is sitting the correct chair, hold up the card and ask again, \" What is it?\" Another point is given if the question is answered correctly. Since they've been learning the present continuous tense, use question and answer continuous tense, use question and answer continuous patterns.","2. 是非椅子：您说一个句子，学生跑到标示“True”或“False”的椅子。先给每队学生编号，举起一张单词卡，说出一样东西再接一个号码。如果单词卡上不是您说的东西，那个号码的学生要跑到“False”椅子；如果是，就跑到“True”椅子。坐对椅子的人得一分。学生坐在正确的椅子上时，再举起单词卡问 \"What is it?\"，答对再得一分。学生正在学现在进行时，所以请使用现在进行时的问答句型。",0],["li","3. Word and sentence Building. Choose some words and sentence patterns that are not related. Ask your class to make up sentences using the words. For example: down, run, cat, help, or street. Can you help me? The cat is running down the street.","3. 单词造句：选一些彼此无关的单词和句型，请全班用这些字造句。例如：down、run、cat、help、street → Can you help me? The cat is running down the street.",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["p","Progress Report","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them to review for test one which is on class 7. And remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching in the couple of days.","(3) 提醒学生准备第 7 课的测验 1，并提醒他们过几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #3","电话教学教材 #3",0],["li","1. Please make a sentence with \"This belt.\"","1. 请用 \"This belt\" 造句。",0],["li","2. Please make a sentence with \"These skirts.\"","2. 请用 \"These skirts\" 造句。",0],["li","3. Please make a sentence with \"That sneaker.\"","3. 请用 \"That sneaker\" 造句。",0],["li","4. Please make a sentence with \"Those shirts.\"","4. 请用 \"Those shirts\" 造句。",0],["li","5. Are the baby frog big?",null,0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 4","Classroom","Readers/Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson 5"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":95},{"z":"第 7 课","t":"Class 7","k":"class","p":[38],"b":[["h2","Test Day 1","测验日 1",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","To review everything they've learned To To have a written test and oral test","复习所有学过的内容；进行笔试测验和口语测验",0],["h3","Classroom Readers none","Classroom Readers：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A none","Classroom Activities 3A：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Copies of the test, copies of the oral test","测验卷复印件、口语测验复印件",0],["h2","Review (10mins)","复习 Review（10 mins）",0],["p","Do a quick review of the major areas of the test with the students. Go over vocabulary, sentence patterns, phonics, and spelling with the students. Have a copy of the test, but don't give the answer directly. Rephrase the test questions.","和学生快速复习测验的主要部分：单词、句型、发音和拼写。拿一份测验卷，但不要直接给答案，把测验题目换个说法。",0],["h2","Test (50mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","The test will probably take the rest of the class. If any students should finish early, have them prepare for their oral test quietly.","测验大概会用掉这堂课剩下的时间。如果有学生提早写完，请他们安静地准备口语测验。",0],["h2","Oral Test (50 mins) 3-5 minutes for each students","口语测验 Oral Test（50 mins）每位学生 3–5 分钟",0],["p","Conduct the oral test outside the classroom individually with the students. Each question is worth four point; one for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first. Assign a classroom leader to monitor their behavior while you are out of the classroom or position yourself so you can see the class through the window. The oral test is worth 20% of the first test total!","在教室外个别进行口语测验，每题四分：理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各一分。先给学生改正自己错误的机会。您不在教室时，指定一位班长维持秩序，或站在可以从窗外看到班级的位置。口语测验占第一次测验总成绩的 20%！",0],["h2","THE ORAL TEST","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. Are Sam and Charlie classmates?",null,0],["li","2. Are Kim and Katie boys?",null,0],["li","3. Make a sentence with \"eating.\"","3. 用 \"eating\" 造句。",0],["li","4. Make a sentence with \"reading.\"","4. 用 \"reading\" 造句。",0],["li","5. Are you old?",null,0]],"g":[[13,["None"]],[15,["None"]],[17,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activities","Lesson 4","Playing","● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":110},{"z":"第 8 课","t":"Class 8","k":"class","p":[39,40],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 1","活动日 1",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","To review everything they've learned by playing games and activities","通过游戏和活动复习所有学过的内容",0],["h3","Classroom Readers none","Classroom Readers：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A none","Classroom Activities 3A：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Number flashcards, vocabulary flashcards, a box, English Dictionary, copies of the dictionary worksheet","数字单词卡、单词单词卡、一个盒子、英文字典、字典练习单复印件",0],["h2","Games and Activities (50mins)","游戏与活动 Games and Activities（50 mins）",0],["p","Today is the first game and activity day for S3. You should conduct games ands activities that reflect material that has been learned. Use games that would emphasize vocabulary, present progressive verbs and sentence patterns. Here's a list and explanation of some games you can play.","今天是 S3 的第一次游戏活动日。进行的游戏和活动应该反映学过的内容，选择能加强单词、现在进行时动词和句型的游戏。以下是一些可以玩的游戏及说明。",0],["li","1. Auction. This game is to reinforce numbers, clothing and adjectives. Divide the class into groups of two or three students. Each group has $6 to spend at the auction. The winning group is the one who spends the least and buys the most. Appoint a leader for each group. The leaders of each group have to bid for the items by raising their hands and saying a price. They should consult their groups before bidding. Appoint one stu dent to be the bookkeeper and to keep track of the items bought and the money spent. Now you play the role of the auctioneer by showing a flashcard and saying something to describe it. For example,","1. 拍卖会：这个游戏可以加强数字、衣物和形容词。把全班分成两三人一组，每组有 6 元可以在拍卖会上花，花最少钱、买最多东西的组别获胜。每组指定一位组长，组长要举手喊价竞标，喊价前应先和组员商量。指定一位学生当记账员，记录买到的东西和花掉的钱。您扮演拍卖官，展示一张单词卡并描述它。例如：",0],["d","Look at this vase! Isn't it beautiful? The starting price is $2. Do I hear $2?","T",0],["p","Leader A: $2 Leader B: $3","组长 A：$2　组长 B：$3",0],["d","$3. Thank you. $4, do I hear $4? No, going , going, gone! ( Hit the desk.) Leader B then comes up and collects the vase card from the teacher and the bookkeeper records the money spent by the group on the board.","T",0],["li","2. The tiger and the rabbit. Have the students stand in a circle holding hands. One student is the rabbit. He or she stands in the middle of the circle, while another student is a tiger. The tiger stands outside the circle. The tiger taps a student on the shoulder and says, \"May I come in?\" The student replies, \"At nine o'clock.\" Then all the students move until they get into the circle, the tiger has to chase the rabbit out of the circle. The rabbit is safe if it goes around the circle 3 times without being caught. If the rabbit is not caught, it can rejoin the circle and another rabbit is selected. If the rabbit is caught, it then becomes the new tiger.","2. 老虎和兔子：请学生手牵手围成一圈。一位学生当兔子，站在圈圈中间；另一位学生当老虎，站在圈圈外面。老虎拍拍一位学生的肩膀说 \"May I come in?\"，那位学生回答 \"At nine o'clock.\"，接着大家移动，老虎进到圈圈里后要把兔子追出圈外。兔子绕圈跑 3 圈没被抓到就安全了，可以回到圈圈中，再选另一只兔子；如果兔子被抓到，就变成新的老虎。",0],["li","3. Word Building. Choose five words, which are not really related. Ask the students to make up a sentence or a story using these words.","3. 单词造句：选五个彼此不太相关的单词，请学生用这些字造句或编故事。",0],["li","4. I Spy. A student beings the game by saying, \"I spy with my little eye something beginning with ì B\". The rest of the class must try to figure out what the object is by asking, \" Is it a ball?\" and so on. The student who guesses correctly then gets to say the question.","4. 我是小间谍（I Spy）：一位学生开始说 \"I spy with my little eye something beginning with B.\"，其他同学要问 \"Is it a ball?\" 等问题，猜出是什么东西，猜对的学生接着出题。",0],["li","5. In, On and Under. Bring a box to class. Bring a student to the front of the classroom and give him/her an object. When you say \"in\", the student puts the object in the box. Do the same with \"on\" and \"under\". Pick up the pace until the track of the number of successful moves. There are just suggestions for you.","5. In、On 和 Under：带一个盒子到教室，请一位学生到教室前面并给他一样东西。您说 \"in\"，学生就把东西放进盒子里；\"on\" 和 \"under\" 也一样。逐渐加快速度，并记录成功的次数。以上仅供参考。",0],["h2","How to Use the Dictionary (50 mins)","如何使用字典 How to Use the Dictionary（50 mins）",0],["li","1. In S1 and S2 we've introduced using the dictionary. We've taught them about word order, how to look up a word and how to use the guide words. Let's take this time to review everything that they've learned.","1. 在 S1 和 S2 我们已经介绍过如何使用字典，教过单词的排列顺序、怎么查字，以及怎么使用指引字（guide words）。利用这段时间复习学过的所有内容。",0],["li","2. Exercise one will review placing the words in alphabetical order.","2. 练习一复习把单词依照字母顺序排列。",0],["li","3. Exercise two will review guide-words, Remember, not everyone's dictionary is the same, so the guide-words will be different with every student.","3. 练习二复习指引字。记住，每个人的字典不一样，所以每位学生的指引字也会不同。",0],["li","4. Exercise three will review matching words with the pictures.","4. 练习三复习把单词和图片配对。",0],["li","5. Finally, exercise four will be matching opposites.","5. 最后，练习四是反义词配对。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","Progress Report","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comment or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(1) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching in the next couple of days.","(2) 提醒学生接下来几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material 4","电话教学教材 4",0],["li","1. What are these? (Take out Classroom Activities 3A, turn to page 36, ask Ss see No.2 eggs in the boy's hand.)","1. What are these?（拿出 Classroom Activities 3A，翻到第 36 页，请学生看 2 号图男孩手上的蛋。）",0],["li","2. What are those? (Take out Classroom Activities 3A, turn to page 36, ask Ss see No.1 Kim is pointing those vegetables.)","2. What are those?（拿出 Classroom Activities 3A，翻到第 36 页，请学生看 1 号图 Kim 指着的那些蔬菜。）",0],["li","3. Are these slippers? (Take out Classroom Activities 3A, turn to page 28, ask Ss see picture No.2)","3. Are these slippers?（拿出 Classroom Activities 3A，翻到第 28 页，请学生看 2 号图。）",0],["li","4. Are those towels? (Take out Classroom Activities 3A, turn to page 31, ask Ss see No.2 the left picture.)","4. Are those towels?（拿出 Classroom Activities 3A，翻到第 31 页，请学生看 2 号图的左边。）",0],["li","5. Is Chinese food good?",null,0]],"g":[[13,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson5"]],[23,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Activities","Lesson 1- Lesson5","1.1/ 2.1/ 3.1/ 4.1/ 5.1"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":100},{"z":"第 9 课","t":"Class 9","k":"class","p":[41,42,43,44,45],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA:","C.R./C.A.：",1],["p","To practice simple progressives To identify clothing items","练习简单的进行时；能说出衣物名称。",1],["h3","EEC: Asking and showing concern for an activity","EEC：询问并关心别人在做的事",1],["p","Expressing disappointment","表达失望",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 4","Classroom Readers 第 4 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Frog, those, look at, jump, jumping, run, running",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","That is / Those are _________(s).",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson 6","Classroom Activities 3A 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Belt, hat, pajamas, sneakers",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 3","EEC 2 第 3 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","gate, crosswalk, traffic signal, crossing guard, street, side walk",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","How was the baseball game?","A",1],["d","Don't ask.","B",1],["d","Why? We lost?","A",1],["d","Yeah. The score was 5 to 4.","B",1],["d","Really?","A",1],["d","Terrible, isn't it?","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Review \" This / These is/ are _____________. Drill them on this pattern because we will be teaching them the use and comprehension of \" That is\" and \" Those are\".","(2) 复习 \"This is / These are ___.\"，反复操练这个句型，因为接下来要教 \"That is\" 和 \"Those are\" 的用法和理解。",0],["li","(3) Game- Unusual View. Draw a vocabulary object from an unusual point of view on the board. For example, a rectangle could be a table from above or a circle with a large black dot in the middle might be a pencil from the end. The person who guesses the object and spells it correctly can now take a turn drawing an object from an unusual view. Award points for correct answers.","(3) 游戏：特别视角：在黑板上从特别的角度画出一个单词的东西，例如从上面看的长方形可能是桌子，中间有大黑点的圆形可能是从尾端看的铅笔。猜出东西并拼对的人，可以换他用特别的角度画一样东西。答对就给分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40mins) Lesson 4 Baby Frogs!","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 4 课 Baby Frogs! 小青蛙！",0],["h3","4-Part 1","4. 第 1 部分",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson at first by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 先用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students to read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Students! Pay attention!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Students! Pay attention!","Ss",0],["d","(Point to he frog.) Everybody look here. What is it?","T",0],["d","A frog!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody show me your finger! Point to the frog. And say, \"","T",0],["p","That is a frog.\" 1-2-3-go!","\"That is a frog.\" 1-2-3-go!",0],["d","That is a frog.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","It is big.","C",0],["d","Everybody, It is big.\" (With gesture to show big.\")","T",0],["d","It is big. (With gesture to show big.\")","Ss",0],["d","(Point to the little frogs.) Look! What are those? ( Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Those are baby frogs.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat. 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Those are baby frogs.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. They are baby frogs. What are they doing?","T",0],["d","They are jumping.","C",0],["d","( Point to the baby frogs on the monitor) Everybody repeat it again. 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","They are jumping.","Ss",0],["d","How about Sam? What is he doing? (Point to Sam on the monitor).","T",0],["d","He is jumping.","Ss",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(3) You will need some singular and also plural flashcards for this practice. Use the following to teach today's sentence patterns.","(3) 这个练习需要一些单数和复数的单词卡，用以下方式教今天的句型。",0],["d","This is a/an ________. (Hold up an object.)","T",0],["d","This is a/an _________.","Ss",0],["d","These are _____s. (Hold up two or more objects.)","T",0],["d","These are _____s.","Ss",0],["d","That is a/an ________. (Point to something.)","T",0],["d","that is a/an __________.","Ss",0],["d","Those are _____________s. (Point to two or more objects.)","T",0],["d","Those are ________s.","Ss",0],["li","(4) After you've gone over this, have the students make sentences of their own using these patterns.","(4) 练习过后，请学生用这些句型自己造句。",0],["li","(5) Open Book:","(5) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h3","(6) Game- Tic- Tac- Toe","(6) 游戏：圈圈叉叉",0],["li","1. Divide the class into two teams. Make a tic-tac-toe grid on the board with singular or plural of nouns.","1. 把全班分成两队，在黑板上画井字格，格子里写名词的单数或复数。",0],["li","2. The teams take turns coming to the board and writing in one plural and singular from team X writes a correct form, he/she then marks a large X over that space. When team O writes a correct response, they mark a large O over that space.","2. 两队轮流到黑板前写出单数或复数形。X 队写对就在那一格画一个大 X，O 队写对就画一个大 O。",0],["li","3. The first team that succeeds in having three of \"it's\" marks in a row is the winner.","3. 最先把自己的记号连成一线的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Six","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 6 课",0],["h3","6-Part 1 vocabulary","6. 第 1 部分　单词",0],["li","(1) Show the content, which will be taught today on the monitor at first. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"belt\",","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"belt\" 开始。",0],["d","belt!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \" belt!\"","T",0],["d","belt!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"belt\", click on next new vocabulary- \" hat\",","学生练习说 \"belt\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"hat\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"hat!\"","T",0],["d","hat!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach pajamas, sneakers, Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 pajamas 和 sneakers。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) Dice GameAfter they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. This time, you can use the flashcards instead of the touchscreen all-in-one. The students have to say the word of the flashcard which you hold according to the number of the die. For example, if you got 2 dots, the students are supposed to say the words twice. If you got 3/4/5 dots, they are supposed to say the word 3/4/5 times. For \"one\", you can ask the students to do something special, such as asking them to stand up, switch the seats, and then sit down! For \"six\", you can give to each of the students one candy or a reward card. You can roll the dice by yourself or ask the volunteers to roll the dice. Then the other students have to speak out the word three times according to the number.","(2) 骰子游戏：学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。这次可以用单词卡代替触控一体机：学生要依照骰子的点数，说出您手上单词卡的单词。例如掷出 2 点，学生就把字说两次；掷出 3/4/5 点，就说 3/4/5 次。掷出“1”时，可以请学生做点特别的事，例如站起来换座位再坐下！掷出“6”时，可以给每位学生一颗糖或一张奖励卡。可以自己掷骰子，或请自愿的学生掷。",0],["li","(3) Part 6.2Enter page 6.2 and have students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct answer at the first. Let them speak out the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. And they lead the class to check the answers together. Lead the students take little tour through Sam's closet. Start with his belts. These items are a little distance away, so use those. Have the class look at the pictures on the monitor with you and practice the sentence patterns with them. Part A- This is a practical written exercise. Pair them up and have them complete the exercises together. Part B- Have them match the pictures with the words. Then, have them make sentences using the sentence patterns.","(3) 6.2 部分：进入 6.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对。带学生参观 Sam 的衣橱，从皮带开始。这些东西离得有点远，所以用 those。请全班和您一起看屏幕上的图片，练习句型。A 部分：这是实用的书写练习，让学生两两一组一起完成。B 部分：请学生把图片和单词配对，再用句型造句。",0],["h3","(4) Part 6.3- Phonics long E(ea)","(4) 6.3 部分：自然拼读　长元音 E（ea）",0],["p","Enter page 6.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with long E sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. Notice the different sounds that are being compared to the long E\". These sounds are easily confused with the long E\". Say each word clearly and precisely. For example,","进入 6.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有长元音 E 的单词发音。注意拿来和长元音 E 比较的其他音，这些音很容易和长元音 E 混淆。每个字都要念得清楚准确。例如：",0],["d","( Click on the first word.)","T",0],["d","Teacher!","C",0],["d","Teacher! Everybody repeat, 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Teacher!","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Everybody! T-T-T?\"","T",0],["d","/t/-/t/-/t/","Ss",0],["d","ea-ea-ea","T",0],["d","/i/-/i/-/i/","Ss",0],["d","/t/ /i/","T",0],["d","/ti/","Ss",0],["d","c-h, c-h, /ch/-/ch/-/ch/, repeat!","T",0],["d","c-h,c-h,/ch/-/ch/-/ch/","Ss",0],["d","e-r, e-r, /r/-/r/-/r/","T",0],["d","e-r, e-r, /r/-/r/-/r/","Ss",0],["d","Say, \"teacher\"!","T",0],["d","teacher!","S",0],["p","Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long E words.","重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有长元音 E 的单词。",0],["li","(5) Part 6.4 Make the students open their book to page 29 and listen to you carefully. They have to try to make appropriate response by writing \"check\" or \"cross\" by themselves first. Enter page 6.4 and have the students check the answers of part 6.4 after they finish their writing practice.","(5) 6.4 部分：请学生打开课本第 29 页仔细听您念，先自己试着写“勾”或“叉”做出适当的反应。写完后，进入 6.4 页，请学生核对 6.4 部分的答案。",0],["li","(6) For the remainder of the class, play the true/ false chairs. Divide the class into two teams. Mark one chair \"true\" and the other \"false\". Give each student in each team a number. Make a statement using today's grammar followed by a student's number. If the statement is true, the student runs to the true chair. Like wise if the statement is false. The student who sits on the correct chair gets a point.","(6) 这堂课剩下的时间玩是非椅子。把全班分成两队，一张椅子标“true”，另一张标“false”，每队学生都编号。用今天的语法说一个句子，再接一个学生的号码。句子是对的，学生就跑到 true 椅子；是错的，就跑到 false 椅子。坐对椅子的学生得一分。",0],["h3","(7) Open the Book","(7) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(8) Writing practice","(8) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to the hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly will be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h3","(9) Sentence practice","(9) 句子练习",0],["p","To prepare the students to do Activity Sheet 3, do a drill, some Q and A, or review Classroom Activities 3A, p.23 (This is / These are).","为了让学生准备写活动单 3，先做一些操练、问答，或复习 Classroom Activities 3A 第 23 页（This is / These are）。",0],["li","(10) Activity Sheet 3:","(10) 活动单 3：",0],["p","Give the students Activity Sheet 3. Using ClassroomActivities 3A P. 22-23 for inspiration, have them draw pictures and write sentences about clothing. (These are shoes, This is a skirt, etc.).","发下活动单 3，参考 Classroom Activities 3A 第 22–23 页，请学生画出衣物并写句子（These are shoes. This is a skirt. 等）。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\" Let's See & Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson three. The teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 3 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","How do you feel when you win or lose a game? Let's listen to what the little boy says.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students to listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialogue with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing","大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼ 儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activites","Lesson 6"]],[29,["Part 6.1","Vocabulary","Part 6.2","Sam's Closet.","Part 6.3","Phonics- Long E","Part 6.4"]],[132,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Baby Frogs!"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 10 课","t":"Class 10","k":"class","p":[46,47,48,49,50],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","CR/CA:","C.R./C.A.：",1],["p","Ask and answer questions about groups of things. To ask and answer questions with \"what\", using plurals \"these\" and \"those\"","能问答有关一组物品的问题；能用 \"what\" 搭配复数 \"these\" 和 \"those\" 问答。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Asking and showing concern for an activity Expressing disappointment","询问并关心别人在做的事；表达失望",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 5","Classroom Readers 第 5 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Know, OK, chopsticks",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","What are these/ those?",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson 7","Classroom Activities 3A 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Toothbrush, towel, tissue, comb, slippers",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die, an assortment of objects for the \"Cops and Robbers\" game.","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子、“警察抓小偷”游戏用的各种物品",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 3","EEC 2 第 3 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","gate, crosswalk, traffic signal, crossing guard, street, side walk",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","How was the baseball game?","A",1],["d","Don't ask.","B",1],["d","Why? We lost?","A",1],["d","Yeah. The score was 5 to 4.","B",1],["d","Really?","A",1],["d","Terrible, isn't it?","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Start out with a surprise spelling bee, have all the students stand up. Starting with lesson 1, ask each student a word they should be able to spell. If the students cannot spell the word, they must sit down. The last one who is standing is the winner.","(2) 先来一场突击拼写比赛，请所有学生站起来。从第 1 课开始，问每位学生一个应该会拼的字，拼不出来的人就坐下，最后还站着的人获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40 mins) Lesson 5 What Are Those?","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 5 课 What Are Those? 那些是什么？",0],["h2","5-Part 1:","5. 第 1 部分：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson first by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 先用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students to read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Students! What are these?","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Students! What are these?","Ss",0],["d","(Point to the chopsticks.) Everybody look here. What are these?","T",0],["d","I don't know!","Ss",0],["d","Let's listen to the touchscreen all-in-one.","T",0],["d","I know, Miss Brown! I know.","C",0],["d","Sam knows the answer. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Ok, Sam. What are these?","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat the sentence again.","T",0],["d","What are these?","Ss",0],["d","They are pencils.","C",0],["d","Are they pencils?","T",0],["d","No, they are not.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. They are not pencils. Let's listen to the answer together.","T",0],["d","No, Sam. They are not pencils.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat it again, \" They are not pencils.\" 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","They are not pencils.","Ss",0],["d","Miss Brown is going to ask Kai. Let's listen to her.","T",0],["d","Kai, what are they?","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Kai, what are they?","Ss",0],["d","They are chopsticks.","C",0],["d","Everybody say, \"chopsticks!\"","T",0],["d","chopsticks.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody say, \" They are chopsticks.\"","T",0],["d","They are chopsticks.","Ss",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them to read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(3) Choose a student to come to the front of the class. Point to a couple of nearby familiar objects and ask, \" what are these?\" He/She answers, \" These are _____s.\" Repeat this procedure several times.","(3) 选一位学生到教室前面，指着附近几个熟悉的东西问 \"What are these?\"，他回答 \"These are ___s.\"。重复几次。",0],["li","(4) Point some objects on the distance and ask, \"what are those?\" They answer \" those are _____s.\" Now repeat this a couple of times until they get it. This might take a few more times, so be patient.","(4) 指着远处的一些东西问 \"What are those?\"，学生回答 \"Those are ___s.\"。重复几次直到学生学会。可能需要多练习几次，请耐心进行。",0],["li","(5) Pair them up to practice these sentence patterns with each other.","(5) 让学生两两一组互相练习这些句型。",0],["li","(6) Open Book:","(6) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h3","(7) Game- Cops and Robbers","(7) 游戏：警察抓小偷",0],["li","1. Make an open area in the classroom. Divide the class into two teams, the cops and the robbers.","1. 在教室里空出一块场地，把全班分成两队：警察和小偷。",0],["li","2. Stand behind lines, facing each other. Put objects on the ground, about a third of the way from the robber to the cops.","2. 两队站在线后面，面对面。把东西放在地上，大约在小偷到警察距离的三分之一处。",0],["li","3. When you shout out the name of an object, the robbers run and try to pick it up and take it back across their line. If the cops touch them before they cross their line, they have to return the object.","3. 您喊出一样东西的名字时，小偷要跑去拿起来，带回自己的线后面。如果小偷在越过线之前被警察碰到，就要把东西还回去。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Seven","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 7 课",0],["h2","7 -Part 1 vocabulary:","7. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content, which will be taught today on the monitor first. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"toothbrush\",","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"toothbrush\" 开始。",0],["d","toothbrush!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \" toothbrush!\"","T",0],["d","toothbrush!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"toothbrush\", click on next new vocabulary- \" towel\",","学生练习说 \"toothbrush\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"towel\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"towel!\"","T",0],["d","towel!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach pajamas, sneakers, Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 pajamas 和 sneakers。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["h3","(2) Drawing Game-","(2) 画画游戏：",0],["p","After they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. Divide the class into two teams, and draw a line in the middle of the board. One side is for team A, another one is for team B. This game will start with the question asked by you,\" What can you see in the bathroom?\" One student from each team comes to the front of the classroom and draws something on their part of the board in five or ten seconds. When the time is up, they have to pass their markers to the students next to them. After they have finished the drawing, they have to say all the words out correctly. If they can say it out correctly, they will get one point for that picture.","学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。把全班分成两队，在黑板中间画一条线，一边给 A 队，一边给 B 队。游戏从您问的问题 \"What can you see in the bathroom?\" 开始。每队派一位学生到前面，在自己那一边的黑板上用五到十秒画一样东西，时间到就把白板笔交给旁边的同学。画完后，学生要正确说出所有单词，说对一张图就得一分。",0],["li","(3) Chain DrillYou ask the first student, \" What are these/ those?\" The student hopefully gives you the correct answer and then asks the question to their neighbor. Continue this for a couple of rounds.","(3) 接龙练习：您问第一位学生 \"What are these/those?\"，学生给出正确答案后，再问旁边的同学同样的问题。进行几轮。",0],["li","(4) Part 7.2Enter page 7.2 and have students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct the answer at first. Let them speak out the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. And they lead the class to check the answers together. Lead the students on a little tour through Sam's bathroom. Have the class look at the pictures on the monitor with you and practice the sentence patterns with them. Part A- Now they have to make question by looking at the pictures. Explain this to them and then turn them loose. When they're done, pair them up and have them ask/ answer with each other. Part B- This part is to determine if they can distinguish the difference between \"these\" and \"those\". As you can see, they need to ask and answer the questions. Have them read their answers to the class.","(4) 7.2 部分：进入 7.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对。带学生参观 Sam 的浴室，请全班和您一起看屏幕上的图片，练习句型。A 部分：学生要看图提出问句，说明后让他们自己做，完成后两两一组互相问答。B 部分：这部分要看学生能不能分辨 \"these\" 和 \"those\"，学生要问答问题，再向全班念出答案。",0],["h3","(5) Part 7.3- Phonics long E (ee)","(5) 7.3 部分：自然拼读　长元音 E（ee）",0],["p","Enter page 7.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with long E sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. Notice the different sounds that are being compared to the long \"E\". These sounds are easily confused with the long \"E\". Say each word clearly and precisely. We really want to teach the students how to spell these words as well as learn them phonetically. Say each word slowly and spell it. For example,","进入 7.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有长元音 E 的单词发音。注意拿来和长元音“E”比较的其他音，这些音很容易和长元音“E”混淆。每个字都要念得清楚准确。我们希望学生会拼这些字，也能用发音学会它们。慢慢念出每个字并拼出来。例如：",0],["d","(Click on the first word.)","T",0],["d","see-saw!","C",0],["d","see-saw! Everybody repeat, 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","see-saw","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Everybody! \"S-S-S?\"","T",0],["d","/s/-/s/-/s/","Ss",0],["d","ee-ee-ee","T",0],["d","/i/-/i/-/i/","Ss",0],["d","/s/ /i/","T",0],["d","/si/","Ss",0],["d","S-S-S!","T",0],["d","/s/-/s/-/s/","Ss",0],["d","aw-aw-/ /-/ /-/ /, repeat!","T",0],["d","aw-aw-/ /-/ /-/ /","Ss",0],["d","Say, \"see-saw\"!","T",0],["d","see-saw!","S",0],["p","Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long E words.","重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有长元音 E 的单词。",0],["li","(6) Part 7.4 Make the students open their book to page 33 and listen to you carefully. They have to try to make an appropriate response by writing, \"check\" or \"cross\" by themselves first. Enter page 7.4 and have the students check the answers of part 7.4 after they finish their writing practice.","(6) 7.4 部分：请学生打开课本第 33 页仔细听您念，先自己试着写“勾”或“叉”做出适当的反应。写完后，进入 7.4 页，请学生核对 7.4 部分的答案。",0],["h3","(7) Game-Sentence Dictation","(7) 游戏：句子听写",0],["p","Divide the class into two teams. The teacher says a sentence and the students must run to the board one at a time, each writing one word of the sentence. The first team to finish the sentence, including all the correct grammar, gets a point for their team.","把全班分成两队。老师说一个句子，学生一次一人跑到黑板前，每人写句子中的一个字。最先完成句子而且语法完全正确的队伍得一分。",0],["h3","(8) Open the Book","(8) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(9) Writing practice","(9) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly will be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and draw","(1) 听一听，画出来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. Teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and draw the picture in the box.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and draw the picture in the box.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and check \"V\" the correct boxes.","(2) 听一听，在正确的方格打钩“V”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of \"Let's Check\" section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What can you see in the school and on the street? There is a gate, a school guard and a crosswalk. Please turn to page 14. Let's check. Listen and check the correct boxes.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to check the correct picture by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边勾选正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["li","(3) As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teachers can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.) Exercise: Number the words in the picture below","(3) 学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）练习：为下图中的单词标上号码",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teachers should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability. Note: Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching in a couple of days.","(3) 提醒学生过几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #5","电话教学教材 #5",0],["li","1. Make a sentence, \"on\".","1. 用 \"on\" 造句。",0],["li","2. Make a sentence, \"in\".","2. 用 \"in\" 造句。",0],["li","3. Make a sentence, \"under\".","3. 用 \"under\" 造句。",0],["li","4. Make a sentence, \"those\".","4. 用 \"those\" 造句。",0],["li","5. Make a sentence, \"table\".","5. 用 \"table\" 造句。",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Big Kids","▼ 儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[29,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 7","Part7.1","Vocabulary","Part 7.2","In the Bathroom.","Part 7.3","Phonics- Long E","Part 7.4"]],[70,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["What Are Those?"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 11 课","t":"Class 11","k":"class","p":[51,52,53,54],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A To ask and answer questions about plural objects To ask and answer questions using \"Are these/ those ______?\"","C.R./C.A.：能问答有关复数物品的问题；能用 \"Are these/those ___?\" 问答。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Asking and showing concern for an activity Expressing disappointment","询问并关心别人在做的事；表达失望",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 6","Classroom Readers 第 6 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Food, noodles, dumplings, very, thank you",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Are these/ those ______?",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson 8","Classroom Activities 3A 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Vegetables, fish, chicken, leg, egg",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die, hand puppets, plastic ball, scratch paper for the \"Hot Rock\" game","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子、手偶、塑料球、“烫手石头”游戏用的计算纸",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 3","EEC 2 第 3 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","gate, crosswalk, traffic signal, crossing guard, street, side walk",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","How was the baseball game?","A",1],["d","Don't ask.","B",1],["d","Why? We lost?","A",1],["d","Yeah. The score was 5 to 4.","B",1],["d","Really?","A",1],["d","Terrible, isn't it?","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Introduce the new vocabulary words. Use flash cards and/ or exaggerated gestures to explain the meaning.","(2) 介绍新单词，用单词卡和／或夸张的手势说明意思。",0],["li","(3) Teach how to spell the new words.","(3) 教学生怎么拼新单词。",0],["li","(4) Game/ Activity- Scrambled Words.","(4) 游戏／活动：单词重组",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40mins) Lesson 6 Chinese Food","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 6 课 Chinese Food 中国菜",0],["h3","6-Part 1","6. 第 1 部分",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson first by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 先用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students to read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","They are eating.","C",0],["d","They are eating. Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","They are eating.","Ss",0],["d","Everybody look here. What are they eating?","T",0],["d","noodle!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Let's listen to the touchscreen all-in-one. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","They are eating Chinese food.","C",0],["d","They are eating Chinese food. Repeat it again.","T",0],["d","They are eating Chinese food.","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Are these noodles, Kai?","C",0],["d","Are these noodles, Kai? Everybody repeat.","T",0],["d","Are these noodles, Kai?","Ss",0],["d","Yes or no?","T",0],["d","Yes!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Yes, they are. They are noodles.","C",0],["d","(Point to the dumplings.) Do you know what are those?","T",0],["d","I don't know.","Ss",0],["d","Let's listen to the touchscreen all-in-one. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","No, they are nor. They are dumplings.","C",0],["d","Everybody say, \" dumplings.\"","T",0],["d","dumplings.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. They are dumplings","T",0],["d","They are dumplings","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Chinese food is very good.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat! 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Chinese food is very good.","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Thank you, Kai.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat.","T",0],["d","Thank you, Kai.","Ss",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this proce dure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them to read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(2) Hold a puppet and walk around the classroom asking the puppet questions about classroom objects and students. Say it like this:","(2) 拿着布偶在教室里走动，问布偶有关教室物品和学生的问题。可以这样说：",0],["d","Are these pens?","T",0],["p","P: Yes, they are. They are pens.","P（布偶）：Yes, they are. They are pens.",0],["d","Are those pens? (make sure that they're in the distance.)","T",0],["p","P: Yes, they are. They are pens. Repeat this procedures several times. Get some of students to act this out.","P（布偶）：Yes, they are. They are pens. 重复这个流程几次，请几位学生演出来。",0],["li","(3) Open Book:","(3) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["li","(4) Do a role-play and assign roles to the characters.","(4) 进行角色扮演，分配角色。",0],["h3","(5) Game/ Activity- Ball Toss","(5) 游戏／活动：丢球",0],["li","1. Have the students sit or stand in a circle. Decide if you want them to provide the singular or the plural form when they catch the ball.","1. 请学生坐着或站着围成一圈，决定接到球时要说单数还是复数形。",0],["li","2. You begin the game by tossing the ball to a student and saying a noun. If you said a singular noun, the student catching the ball must provide the plural form.","2. 您先把球丢给一位学生并说一个名词。如果说的是单数名词，接到球的学生要说出复数形。",0],["li","3. That student then throws the ball to another student and says a new noun.","3. 这位学生再把球丢给另一位学生，并说一个新的名词。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins)","Classroom Activities（40 mins）",0],["h2","Lesson Eight At the Dinner Table","第 8 课 At the Dinner Table 在餐桌上",0],["h3","8 -Part 1 vocabulary","8. 第 1 部分　单词",0],["li","(1) Show the content, which will be taught today on the monitor first. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"vegetable\",","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"vegetable\" 开始。",0],["d","vegetable!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"vegetable! \"","T",0],["d","vegetable!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"vegetable\", click on next new vocabulary- \" fish\",","学生练习说 \"vegetable\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"fish\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"fish!\"","T",0],["d","fish!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach chicken leg, egg Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 chicken leg 和 egg。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) This lesson will be fun to teach. What is everybody favorite activity? Eating! Read the words to them and have them recite the word with gesture. Notice that there is no plural from for fish. Fish can mean one or two.","(2) 这一课教起来会很有趣。大家最喜欢的活动是什么？吃东西！念出单词，请学生边做动作边念。注意 fish 没有复数形，fish 可以表示一条或两条。",0],["li","(3) Game-Fly Fish After they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. Divide the class into two teams. Each team can have a piece of paper from you, and draw a fish on their paper by themselves. You have to put all the flash cards for today's word on the board, and give each team a plastic hammer. The students have to come to the front of the classroom and hit the flashcard with the hammer when they hear the word from you. They also have to speak out the word while they are hitting. The students who finish fastest could \"fly\" his or her fish twice by slapping the floor with a book next to the \"fish\".","(3) 游戏：飞鱼：学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。把全班分成两队，每队发一张纸，自己在纸上画一条鱼。把今天所有单词的单词卡贴在黑板上，每队一支塑料锤。学生听到您说的单词时，要到教室前面用锤子敲那张单词卡，敲的同时要说出单词。最快完成的学生可以用课本在“鱼”旁边拍地板，让鱼“飞”两次。",0],["li","(4) Part 8.2Enter page 8.2 and have students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct the answer at first. Let them speak out the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. And they lead the class to check the answers together. Lead the students on a little tour through Sam's bathroom. Have the class look at the pictures on the monitor with you and practice the sentence patterns with them. Part A- This is a question/ answer exercise. Go through each question together at first. Then do a parallel line drill to practice. One side of the room asks the question and the other side answers it. Part B- This is to reinforce plurals and \"those/ these\". Have them look at the pictures to read their answers to the class.","(4) 8.2 部分：进入 8.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对。请全班和您一起看屏幕上的图片，练习句型。A 部分：这是问答练习，先一起把每一题看一遍，再做两排对话练习：教室一边的学生问，另一边的学生回答。B 部分：加强复数和 those/these，请学生看图向全班念出答案。",0],["h3","(5) Part 8.3- Phonics -\"ER\"","(5) 8.3 部分：自然拼读　“ER”",0],["p","Enter page 8.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with long ER sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. Introduce each of the new words to the students. Repeat each word 2-3 times. Write them on the board one at a time. Emphasize the \"ER\" sound at the end of the word. This can be a tricky sound to them, so really drill them with this.","进入 8.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有“ER”音的单词发音。逐一向学生介绍新单词，每个字重复 2–3 次，一次写一个字在黑板上，强调词尾的“ER”音。这个音对学生来说可能有点难，要多加操练。",0],["d","(Click on the first word.)","T",0],["d","teacher!","C",0],["d","teacher! Everybody repeat, 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","teacher!","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Everybody repeat, er-er-/r/-/r/-/r/","T",0],["d","er-er-/r/-/r/-/r/","Ss",0],["d","very good. (click on next word.)","T",0],["p","Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long E words.","重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有长元音 E 的单词。",0],["li","(6) Part 8.4 Make the students open their books to page 33 and listen to you carefully. They have to try to make appropriate response by writing, \"check\" or \"cross\" by themselves first. Enter page 8.4 and have the students check the answers of part 8.4 after they finish their writing practice. The routine is very familiar. Say the words slowly and clearly, emphasizing the \"ER\" sound at the end of each word.","(6) 8.4 部分：请学生打开课本仔细听您念，先自己试着写“勾”或“叉”做出适当的反应。写完后，进入 8.4 页，请学生核对 8.4 部分的答案。这个流程学生已经很熟悉了。慢慢、清楚地念出单词，强调每个字词尾的“ER”音。",0],["h3","(7) Game-Hot Rock","(7) 游戏：烫手石头",0],["p","Set your watch for a certain amount of time. Crumple up a paper ball. Tell the students what the question pattern will be. When the time starts, the student with the rock asks anyone else a question. As soon as the question is asked, the rock is passed to the person who is going to answer the question. They must answer correctly and only after that, passes the rock to someone else by asking another question. When the time is up, the person with the rock pays some penalty.","设定一段时间，把一张纸揉成纸球，告诉学生要用的问句句型。时间开始后，拿着“石头”的学生问任何一个人一个问题，问完就把石头传给要回答的人。回答的人必须答对，才能再问另一个问题并把石头传出去。时间到时，拿着石头的人要接受小处罚。",0],["h3","(8) Open the Book","(8) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(9) Writing practice","(9) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly will be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区▼▼","Big Kids","▼ 儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[29,["Big Kids","大儿童学习区▼▼▼","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 8","Part8.1","Vocabulary","Part 8.2","At the Dinner Table","Part 8.3","Phonics- \"er\"","Part 8 .4"]],[80,["儿童进阶▼▼","Big Kids","Book2"]],[80,["Classroom Activities","Lesson8","8.3","8.4","8.1","8.2"]],[120,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Chinese Food"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 12 课","t":"Class 12","k":"class","p":[55,56,57,58,59],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R/C.A. To identify the position of the objects To introduce prepositions","C.R./C.A.：能说出物品的位置；介绍介词。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Offering compliments. Expressing likes and favorites Agreeing to the opinions of others","称赞别人；表达喜好和最爱；同意别人的意见",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 7","Classroom Readers 第 7 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Out, on, goodbye, see, tomorrow",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","The ______ is on/in/under the ______.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3A Lesson 9","Classroom Activities 3A 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","In, on, under, table, sofa",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die, hand puppets, a box for teaching preposition","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子、手偶、教介词用的盒子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 4","EEC 2 第 4 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","red, pink, brown, yellow, blue, green",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Wow, look at your jacket.","A",1],["d","Thank you.","B",1],["d","The color is wonderful.","A",1],["d","Yes. It's my favorite color.","B",1],["d","Really? Mine too.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them. You can do a spelling review. Play the \" Wrong Way Spelling\" game. Say any word they know and then spell it wrong. This makes the students really listen and pay attention to how to spell something instead of mindlessly repeating after you. You can have two teams and the first person to spell it correctly wins the point for the team.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。可以玩“错误拼写”游戏复习拼写：说一个学生认识的字，再故意拼错。这能让学生真正仔细听、注意怎么拼，而不是无意识地跟着复诵。可以分成两队，最先拼对的人为队伍得一分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40mins) Lesson 7 See You Tomorrow","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 7 课 See You Tomorrow 明天见",0],["h3","7-Part 1","7. 第 1 部分",0],["li","(1) Books closed. We're going to teach them prepositions. These are some of the shortest words in English, but some of the most difficult words to learn. Use a puppet to introduce this concept of location. Put the puppet on the desk and say:","(1) 合上课本。我们要教学生介词。介词是英语中最短的字之一，却也是最难学的字之一。用布偶介绍位置的概念，把布偶放在桌上说：",0],["d","He is on the desk.","T",0],["d","He is on the desk.","Ss",0],["d","(put the puppet in the desk.) He is in the desk.","T",0],["d","He is in the desk.","Ss",0],["d","(put the puppet under the desk.) He is under the desk.","T",0],["d","He is under the desk.","Ss",0],["p","Really emphasize the prepositions when you're teaching them. They are extremely easy to confuse.","教的时候要特别强调介词，它们非常容易混淆。",0],["li","(2) Have each student make up three sentences using the newly learned prepositions.","(2) 请每位学生用新学的介词造三个句子。",0],["li","(3) Explain \"School is out\" by drawing a picture of students in school and then drawing a picture of the kids leaving the school while saying \"school is out!\" Now, say, \"school is out\" and motion for them to leave.","(3) 解释 \"School is out\"：画一张学生在学校的图，再画孩子离开学校的图，同时说 \"School is out!\"。接着说 \"School is out\"，并比手势请学生离开。",0],["li","(4) Show the content of this lesson by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(4) 用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(5) Lead the students to read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(5) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","School is out!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","School is out.","Ss",0],["d","(point to Kai.) Everybody look here. Can you see Kai?","T",0],["d","Yes!","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Kai is on the bus.","C",0],["d","Kai is on the bus. Everybody repeat it again.","T",0],["d","Kai is on the bus.","Ss",0],["d","How about Kim and Katie? (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Kim and Katie are on Bus One.","C",0],["d","(Point to Bus One) Everybody repeat it again.","T",0],["d","Kim and Katie are in Bus One.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to Sam) How about Sam?","T",0],["d","Sam is on Bus Five.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat! 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Sam is on Bus Five.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Can you see Benny?","T",0],["d","Yes.","Ss",0],["d","Everybody point to Benny.","T",0],["d","Benny is, too.","C",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(6) Open Book:","(6) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h3","(7) Game/ Activity-","(7) 游戏／活动：",0],["li","4. Bring a box to class. Bring a student to the front of the class and given them an object.","4. 带一个盒子到教室，请一位学生到教室前面，给他一样东西。",0],["li","5. When you say \"in\", the student puts the object in the box. Do the same with \"on\" and \"under\". Pick up the pace until the student either can't keep up or make a mistake.","5. 您说 \"in\"，学生就把东西放进盒子里；\"on\" 和 \"under\" 也一样。逐渐加快速度，直到学生跟不上或出错。",0],["li","6. Have the other students keep track of the number of successful moves. You can divide the class into teams and have two students play against each other.","6. 请其他学生记录成功的次数。也可以把全班分成几队，让两位学生互相比赛。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Nine- In the","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 9 课 In the",0],["h3","living Room.","Living Room 在客厅",0],["h2","9 -Part 1 vocabulary:","9. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content, which will be taught today on the monitor at first. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"table\",","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"table\" 开始。",0],["d","table!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"table! \"","T",0],["d","table!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"table\", click on next new vocabulary- \" sofa\",","学生练习说 \"table\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"sofa\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"sofa!\"","T",0],["d","sofa!","Ss",0],["p","You will need some teaching materials or gestures to teach \"in/on/under\". Also make the students repeat the words (with the gesture) with you while you are doing the gesture. Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","教 \"in/on/under\" 需要一些教具或手势。您做手势时，也请学生跟着您一边做手势一边念。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) That will be very important to explain the meaning of each preposition. The students will have some difficulties with \"on the _____.\" and \"under the ____.\" Really emphasize on these two prepositions practice.","(2) 解释每个介词的意思非常重要。学生对 \"on the ___\" 和 \"under the ___\" 会有些困难，请特别加强这两个介词的练习。",0],["h3","(3) Game-Fly Fish","(3) 游戏：飞鱼",0],["p","After they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. Divide the class into two teams. Each team can have a piece of paper from you, and draw a fish on their paper by themselves. You have to put all the flash cards for today's word on the board, and give each team a plastic hammer. The students have to come to the front of the classroom and hit the flashcard with the hammer when they hear the word from you. They also have to speak out the word while they are hitting. The student who finishes the fastest could \"fly\" his or her fish twice by slapping the floor with a book next to the \"fish\".","学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。把全班分成两队，每队发一张纸，自己在纸上画一条鱼。把今天所有单词的单词卡贴在黑板上，每队一支塑料锤。学生听到您说的单词时，要到教室前面用锤子敲那张单词卡，敲的同时要说出单词。最快完成的学生可以用课本在“鱼”旁边拍地板，让鱼“飞”两次。",0],["li","(4) Part 9.2Enter page 9.2 and have students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct answer at the first. Let them speak out the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. And they lead the class to check the answers together. Lead the students on a little tour through the living room. Have the class look at the pictures on the monitor with you and practice the sentence patterns with them.","(4) 9.2 部分：进入 9.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对。带学生参观客厅，请全班和您一起看屏幕上的图片，练习句型。",0],["li","1. Have your students look at the picture on the monitor. Tell them to memorize where everything is. Turn off the touchscreen all-in-one and call on individual students to answer you. For example, you can ask, \"Where are the cats?\" The student is supposed to answer,\" The cats are on the TV\" and so on.","1. 请学生看屏幕上的图片，记住每样东西的位置。关掉触控一体机，个别点学生回答。例如问 \"Where are the cats?\"，学生要回答 \"The cats are on the TV.\" 等。",0],["li","2. Part A- They have to fill in the blanks using the prepositions. When they have finished, ask questions relating to the exercise.","2. A 部分：学生要用介词填空。完成后，问一些和练习相关的问题。",0],["li","(5) Sentences-","(5) 句子练习：",0],["li","1. We're asking two things with these exercises. First, where they are and what are they doing. They've learned both ideas. Now they have to combine them. You may have to walk them through each exercise.","1. 这些练习要问两件事：第一，他们在哪里；第二，他们在做什么。学生两个概念都学过了，现在要把它们结合起来。可能需要带学生逐题练习。",0],["li","2. Ask, \"Where are/is they/he/she/it?\" and \"What are/is they/he/she/it doing?\" Call on unsuspecting students to answer you.","2. 问 \"Where are/is they/he/she/it?\" 和 \"What are/is they/he/she/it doing?\"，点没有预期的学生回答。",0],["h3","(6) Part 9.4- Phonics -\"AR\"","(6) 9.4 部分：自然拼读　“AR”",0],["p","Enter page 9.4 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with long ER sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. Introduce each of the new words to the students. Repeat each word 2-3 times. Write them on the board one at a time. Emphasize the \"AR\" sound at the end of the word. This can be a tricky sound to them, so really drill them with this.","进入 9.4 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有“AR”音的单词发音。逐一向学生介绍新单词，每个字重复 2–3 次，一次写一个字在黑板上，强调词尾的“AR”音。这个音对学生来说可能有点难，要多加操练。",0],["d","(Click on the first word.)","T",0],["d","Martian!","C",0],["d","Martian! Everybody repeat, 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Marian!","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Everybody repeat, ar-ar-/r/-/r/-/r/","T",0],["d","ar-ar-/r/-/r/-/r/","Ss",0],["d","/m/-/r/-/mr/","T",0],["d","/m/-/r/-/mr/","Ss",0],["d","Everybody say, \"Martian!\"","T",0],["d","Martian!","S",0],["d","very good. (click on next word.)","T",0],["p","Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long E words.","重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有长元音 E 的单词。",0],["li","(7) Part 9.5 Make the students open their books to page 41 and listen to you carefully. They have to try to make appropriate response by writing, \"check\" or \"cross\" by themselves first. Enter page 9.5 and have the students check the answers of part 9.5 after they finish their writing practice. The routine is very familiar. Say the words slowly and clearly, emphasizing the \"AR\" sound at the end of each word.","(7) 9.5 部分：请学生打开课本第 41 页仔细听您念，先自己试着写“勾”或“叉”做出适当的反应。写完后，进入 9.5 页，请学生核对 9.5 部分的答案。这个流程学生已经很熟悉了。慢慢、清楚地念出单词，强调每个字词尾的“AR”音。",0],["li","(8) Open the Book:","(8) 打开课本：",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["li","(9) Writing practice:","(9) 书写练习：",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly will be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See & Say.\" Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See And Say\" section in lesson four. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See & Say:","老师让学生听第 4 课“Let's See And Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See & Say 独白：",0],["p","Going to parties is fun. Would you like to go to the party? Let's join them now.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teachers also need to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialog to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching in the next couple of days.","(3) 提醒学生接下来几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #6","电话教学教材 #6",0],["li","1. Are Mike's eyes blue?",null,0],["li","2. Is your house small?",null,0],["li","3. Are your eyes blue?",null,0],["li","4. Is Tina's head big?",null,0],["li","5. Is your nose small?",null,0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[25,["Lesson 2","Learning & Playing"]],[69,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV"]],[69,["Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 9","Part9.1","Vocabulary","Part 9.2","In the Living Room","Part 9.3","Making Sentences","Part 9 .4","Phonics- \"ar\""]],[125,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["See You Tomorrow"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 13 课","t":"Class 13","k":"class","p":[60,61,62],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R/C.A. To ask questions by \"Are those/ these ______?\" and \" What are those/ these ______?\" EEC: Offering compliments. Expressing likes and favorites Agreeing to the opinions of others","C.R./C.A.：能用 \"Are those/these ___?\" 和 \"What are those/these ___?\" 提问。EEC：称赞别人；表达喜好和最爱；同意别人的意见",1],["h3","Classroom Readers None","Classroom Readers：无",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Review","复习",1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B Lesson 10","Classroom Activities 3B 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","This, that, these, those",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, preposition flashcards, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, plastic ball, a box","单词单词卡、介词单词卡、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、塑料球、一个盒子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 4","EEC 2 第 4 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","red, pink, brown, yellow, blue, green",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Wow, look at your jacket.","A",1],["d","Thank you.","B",1],["d","The color is wonderful.","A",1],["d","Yes. It's my favorite color.","B",1],["d","Really? Mine too.","A",1],["h2","Warm up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them. You can give the students some chance to operate the touchscreen all-in-one by their own, and review the previous lessons by speaking out the target sentences while they are looking at the pictures on the monitor.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。可以让学生有机会自己操作触控一体机，看着屏幕上的图片说出目标句子，复习之前的课程。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40mins) Lesson 10 These are","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 10 课 These Are",0],["h2","Jackets.","Jackets. 这些是夹克。",0],["h2","10.1-These are jackets:","10.1 These are jackets：",0],["li","(1) Enter page 10.1 and have students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct the answer at first. Let them speak out the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. And then lead the class to check the answers together. Part A- This is for reviewing the basic sentence patterns. Have the students fill in the blanks and read their answers aloud. Part B- Answer the questions using \"these\" or \"those\". Part C- Write question and answers according to the pictures.","(1) 进入 10.1 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对。A 部分：复习基本句型，请学生填空并大声念出答案。B 部分：用 \"these\" 或 \"those\" 回答问题。C 部分：依照图片写出问句和答句。",0],["h2","10.2- Preposition Review","10.2 介词复习",0],["li","(1) Fill in the sentences with the appropriate preposition. Remember, prepositions are very easy to confuse.","(1) 用适当的介词完成句子。记住，介词非常容易混淆。",0],["h2","10.3- Word Find","10.3 找单词",0],["li","(2) I really like these word finds. Not only are they fun, but it's a great teaching tool as well. The words under the puzzle are placed cleverly in the word finder. After they've found all the words, they get to make sentences out of them.","(2) 我非常喜欢这种找单词游戏，不但有趣，也是很棒的教学工具。拼图下方的单词巧妙地藏在字谜中。学生找出所有单词后，要用这些字造句。",0],["h2","10.4 Phonics Review (15 minutes)","10.4 发音复习（15 分钟）",0],["p","This section is to review all the different sounds they've learned in the last four lessons.","这部分复习前四课学过的所有不同发音。",0],["h2","10.5 Song- Are you Sleeping? (10 minute)","10.5 歌曲：Are You Sleeping?（10 分钟）",0],["h2","10.6 Games and Activities (25 minutes)","10.6 游戏与活动（25 分钟）",0],["p","Since this is a review day, you should play some games and activities that would reinforce the ideas being reviewed. Here's a list of some games and activities:","因为这是复习日，应该玩一些能加强复习内容的游戏和活动。以下是一些游戏和活动：",0],["h3","1. People, objects and animals-","1. 人物、物品和动物：",0],["p","Give each student a number. Throw a ball to that student and call out from a category (i.e. people objects, color, number, etc.) If the student can call out a word from that category within three seconds, then they may call out a number and a category. If not, they must return the ball to the teacher. Each student has three chances to be wrong. After the third mistake, the student is out. Use the plural sentence patterns.","给每位学生一个号码。把球丢给一位学生并喊出一个类别（例如人物、物品、颜色、数字等）。如果学生能在三秒内说出这个类别的一个字，就可以喊一个号码和类别；如果不行，就要把球还给老师。每位学生有三次答错的机会，第三次答错就出局。请使用复数句型。",0],["h3","2. \"In/on/under\"-","2. \"In/on/under\"：",0],["p","Bring a box to class. Two teams. Bring two students to the front of the classroom and give them an object. When you say \"on\", they put the object on the box and so on. Pick up the pace until they either can't keep up or make a mistake. Have the other students keep track of the number of successful moves.","带一个盒子到教室，分成两队。请两位学生到教室前面，给他们一样东西。您说 \"on\"，他们就把东西放在盒子上，依此类推。逐渐加快速度，直到他们跟不上或出错。请其他学生记录成功的次数。",0],["li","3. Feel free to use any other games and activities you think would be appropriate.","3. 也可以自由使用任何您认为合适的游戏和活动。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","Let's Check",null,0],["h3","Listening Comprehension","听力理解",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and check \"V\" or cross \"X\"","(1) 听一听，打钩“V”或打叉“X”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and write a \"V\" or an \"X\" according to the word you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and write a \"V\" or an \"X\" according to the word you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teachers can read the words to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and circle","(2) 听一听，圈出答案",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What's your favorite color? Is it red, blue, or yellow? Please turn to page 18. Let's check. Listen and circle the correct picture.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the name of each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的名称，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to circle the correct picture by listening to the mp3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边圈出正确的图片。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Connect the pictures to appropriate color","(3) 练习：把图片和适当的颜色连起来",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teachers should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability. Note: Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0]],"g":[[42,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 10","Part10.1","Part A","Part B","Part C","Part 10.2","Preposition Review","Part 10.3","Word Find"]],[42,["Part 10.4","Phonics Review","Part 10.5","Song"]],[71,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["These are"],"bd":"","m":65},{"z":"第 14 课","t":"Class 14","k":"class","p":[63,64,65],"b":[["h2","Review Day 2","复习日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","CR/CA:","C.R./C.A.：",0],["p","To review everything they've learned To have a writing quiz and listening quiz","复习所有学过的内容；进行笔试小测验和听力小测验",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","Offering compliments. Expressing likes and favorites Agreeing to the opinions of others","称赞别人；表达喜好和最爱；同意别人的意见",0],["h3","Classroom Readers none","Classroom Readers：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B none","Classroom Activities 3B：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Listening Lab tapes, tape recorder, review flash cards, copy of the quiz and the test, phonics flashcards, a box for the preposition game","听力练习录音带、录音机、复习单词卡、小测验和测验卷复印件、发音单词卡、介词游戏用的盒子",0],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 4","EEC 2 第 4 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","red, pink, brown, yellow, blue, green",null,0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","Wow, look at your jacket.","A",0],["d","Thank you.","B",0],["d","The color is wonderful.","A",0],["d","Yes. It's my favorite color.","B",0],["d","Really? Mine too.","A",0],["h2","Quiz Review (20 mins)","小测验复习 Quiz Review（20 mins）",0],["p","Spend this time reviewing for the quiz. Get a copy of the quiz and go over the material. Review sentence patterns, vocabulary and phonics. When you feel they are prepared enough, move them to the language lab and perform the listening part of the quiz. Of course you can also make all of the practice as team competitions. If they run everything well, and you still have plenty of time, you can also use the digital equipment to review for them.","利用这段时间为小测验做复习。拿一份小测验卷复习内容，包括句型、单词和发音。觉得学生准备好了之后，带他们到语言教室进行小测验的听力部分。当然也可以把所有练习都设计成分队比赛。如果一切顺利、时间还很充裕，也可以用数字教学设备帮学生复习。",0],["h2","Quiz (30 mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Pass out the quizzes and turn them loose. Make sure they stay quiet and keep their eyes on their own papers.","发下考卷让学生作答，确认他们保持安静，只看自己的考卷。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Get them all seated and quiet. Play the tape for them and have them write down their responses. I recommend playing the tape only twice.","请学生坐好并安静下来，播放录音带，请他们写下答案。建议录音带只播两次。",0],["h2","Test Review","测验复习",0],["h2","Games/ Activities","游戏／活动",0],["p","For the remainder of the class, play some games that would reinforce everything they've learned. Here are some suggestions for you:","这堂课剩下的时间，玩一些能加强所有学过内容的游戏。以下是一些建议：",0],["li","1. \"In, On, Under.\" Bring a box to class. Bring a student to the front of the class and give them an object. When you say \"in\", the student puts something in the box. Do the same with \"on\" and \"under\". Pick up the pace until they can't keep up or make a mistake. You can divide them into teams, if you'd like.","1. \"In, On, Under\"：带一个盒子到教室，请一位学生到教室前面，给他一样东西。您说 \"in\"，学生就把东西放进盒子里；\"on\" 和 \"under\" 也一样。逐渐加快速度，直到他们跟不上或出错。也可以分队进行。",0],["li","2. \"What am I Doing?\"- This is a good game to practice the continuous tense. You can do this a couple of ways. You can perform some sort of action or have a student perform. Either way is fine. Perform some sort of continuous act asking the question. \"What am I doing?\" Have the students answer using the continuous tense.","2. \"What am I Doing?\"：这是练习进行时的好游戏，有几种玩法：由您表演某个动作，或请一位学生表演都可以。表演一个进行中的动作并问 \"What am I doing?\"，请学生用进行时回答。",0],["li","3. \"Guessing Game\"- You have to prepare some pieces of paper for the game. And draw or write something on each paper every time. For example, you draw five apples on one the pieces of paper, and let the students guess by the target sentence, \" Are those _______?\" If they can guess the correct answer, they can take the paper away and repeat the sentence, \" These are apples.\" If they can't guess the answer, the other team can take a turn to guess. The team that gets the most pieces of paper will be the winner.","3. 猜猜看：这个游戏需要准备一些纸片，每张纸上画或写一样东西。例如在一张纸上画五颗苹果，让学生用目标句子 \"Are those ___?\" 猜。猜对的人可以拿走那张纸，并复诵 \"These are apples.\"；猜不到就换另一队猜。拿到最多纸片的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h2","Progress Report","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them to review for test one which is on class 15. And remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching in the next couple of days.","(3) 提醒学生准备第 15 课的测验，并提醒他们接下来几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #7","电话教学教材 #7",0],["li","1. What is your mother's name?",null,0],["li","2. What is your father's name?",null,0],["li","3. Who is talking? (Take out Classroom Activities 3B p.32 picture No.3)","3. Who is talking?（拿出 Classroom Activities 3B 第 32 页 3 号图）",0],["li","4. Who is shouting? (Take out Classroom Activities 3B p.32 picture No.1)","4. Who is shouting?（拿出 Classroom Activities 3B 第 32 页 1 号图）",0],["li","5. Are you singing?",null,0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Classroom Readers","Book 3","Lesson 1-3","Classroom Activities","Lesson 6-10"]],[46,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":110},{"z":"第 15 课","t":"Class 15","k":"class","p":[66],"b":[["h2","Test Day 2","测验日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","CR/CA:","C.R./C.A.：",0],["p","To review everything they've learned To have a written test and oral test","复习所有学过的内容；进行笔试测验和口语测验",0],["h3","Classroom Readers none","Classroom Readers：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B none","Classroom Activities 3B：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Copies of the test, copies of the oral test","测验卷复印件、口语测验复印件",0],["h2","Review (10 mins)","复习 Review（10 mins）",0],["p","Do a quick review of the major areas of the test with the students. Go over vocabulary, sentence patterns, phonics, and spelling with the students. Really emphasize the prepositions because these little words will always cause much pain and anguish. Have a copy of the test, but don't give the answer directly. Rephrase the test questions.","和学生快速复习测验的主要部分：单词、句型、发音和拼写。特别加强介词，因为这些小字总是让人很头痛。拿一份测验卷，但不要直接给答案，把测验题目换个说法。",0],["h2","Test (50 mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","The test will probably take the rest of the class. If any students should finish early, have them prepare for their oral test quietly or they can sit at their desk and draw or read.","测验大概会用掉这堂课剩下的时间。如果有学生提早写完，请他们安静地准备口语测验，或坐在座位上画画、看书。",0],["h2","Oral Test (50 mins) 3-5 minutes for each students","口语测验 Oral Test（50 mins）每位学生 3–5 分钟",0],["p","Conduct the oral test outside the classroom, individually with the students. Each question is worth four point; one for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first. Assign a classroom leader to monitor their behavior while you are out of the classroom or position yourself so you can see the class through the window. The oral test is worth 20% of the first test total!","在教室外个别进行口语测验，每题四分：理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各一分。先给学生改正自己错误的机会。您不在教室时，指定一位班长维持秩序，或站在可以从窗外看到班级的位置。口语测验占测验总成绩的 20%！",0],["h2","THE ORAL TEST","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. What are these? These are pajamas.",null,0],["li","2. What are those? Those are shoes.",null,0],["li","3. Are those socks? Yes, they are. They are socks.",null,0],["li","4. Are those sneakers? No they are not. They are slippers.",null,0],["li","5. Are vegetables good?",null,0]],"g":[[14,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Readers","Lesson 1-3","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6-10"]],[20,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":110},{"z":"第 16 课","t":"Class 16","k":"class","p":[67,68],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 2","活动日 2",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","CR/CA:","C.R./C.A.：",0],["p","To review everything they've learned by playing games and activities","通过游戏和活动复习所有学过的内容",0],["h3","Classroom Readers none","Classroom Readers：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B none","Classroom Activities 3B：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","English dictionary, copies of the dictionary areas where there were a lot of mistakes. You can reinforce any problem area by playing games","英文字典、字典练习单复印件。（讲评测验中错误较多的部分，可以用游戏加强任何有问题的部分。）",0],["h2","Games and Activities (50mins)","游戏与活动 Games and Activities（50 mins）",0],["li","1. Devote the rest of the class time to games and activities that would reinforce the lessons they have learned. Here's a list of suggested games and activities for you.","1. 这堂课剩下的时间用来进行能加强学过课程的游戏和活动。以下是一些建议的游戏和活动。",0],["li","2. \"The Mix-Up Game\". This is a great game for spelling. Bring in a couple of sets of ABC flashcards. Divide the class into teams. Have a couple students come to the front of the class. Call out a word and the first student to spell the word correctly with the flashcards wins a point for their team.","2. “字母大混乱”：这是很棒的拼写游戏。带几组 ABC 单词卡到教室，把全班分成几队，请几位学生到教室前面。喊出一个单词，最先用单词卡正确拼出单词的学生为队伍得一分。",0],["li","3. \"Touch Me\"- Using magnets, attach some word flash cards to the board. Divide the class into two teams. You say a word or use it in a sentence, and the first student to touch the correct flash card wins a point.","3. “摸摸我”：用磁铁把一些单词单词卡贴在黑板上，把全班分成两队。您说一个单词或用它造句，最先摸到正确单词卡的学生得一分。",0],["li","4. \"Freeze Tag\"- Choose an unfortunate student to be \"it\". \"It\" runs around the room chasing the other students. When the other students are touched, they must freeze. The only way they become unfrozen is to answer a question you ask them. These games are suggestions. Feel free to use any other games and activities that you think is appropriate.","4. “冰冻鬼抓人”：选一位“倒霉”的学生当“鬼”，鬼在教室里追其他学生，被碰到的学生要定住不动，唯一解冻的方法是回答您问的问题。以上游戏仅供参考，也可以自由使用任何您认为合适的游戏和活动。",0],["h2","How to Use the Dictionary (50 mins)","如何使用字典 How to Use the Dictionary（50 mins）",0],["li","1. In this part we would like your students to learn how to look up the meaning of the word. These exercises will have a series of words that are related in some way to each other. One of the words does not belong. Some words will be totally unfamiliar to them. They have to circle the word that does not belong in the sequence. Do not give them the meanings of the words. They have to look up the unfamiliar words. The second part will be about synonyms. These are words that have a similar meaning. These will be one word and they have to circle the word that has a similar meaning.","1. 这部分要让学生学会查单词的意思。练习中有一串彼此有某种关联的单词，其中一个不属于这一组，有些字学生完全不认识。学生要圈出不属于这一组的字。不要告诉学生单词的意思，他们要自己查不认识的字。第二部分是同义词，也就是意思相近的字，题目会给一个字，学生要圈出意思相近的字。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h2","Progress Report","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement in it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(1) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(2) Remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching in the next couple of days.","(2) 提醒学生接下来几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #8","电话教学教材 #8",0],["p","Take out Classroom Activities 3B, turn to page 46. 1.Where is the dog? 2.Where is the bird? 3.Where are the three girls? 4.Where are the balls? 5.Where are the cats?","拿出 Classroom Activities 3B，翻到第 46 页。1. Where is the dog? 2. Where is the bird? 3. Where are the three girls? 4. Where are the balls? 5. Where are the cats?",0]],"g":[[14,["None"]],[22,["●Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":115},{"z":"第 17 课","t":"Class 17","k":"class","p":[69,70,71,72,73,74],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To identify body parts To express possession","C.R./C.A.：能说出身体部位；能表达所有权。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Sharing/showing things to others. Making compliments Asking and answering about the origin of things","和别人分享／展示东西；称赞别人；询问并回答东西的来源",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson8","Classroom Readers 第 8 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","I'm, name, his, her, long, tail, eye(s)",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","My/Your/His/Her _________(s) is/are _______.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B Lesson11","Classroom Activities 3B 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Ear(s), nose, mouth, head",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 5","EEC 2 第 5 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Monitor, keyboard, speaker, key, mouse, printer",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Whose computer is this?","A",1],["d","It is mine.","B",1],["d","Wow. It's nice.","A",1],["d","Where did you get it?","B",1],["d","Well, it's a present from my dad.Really?","A",1],["d","Lucky you!","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Play the \"Wolves and Lambs\" game. Divide the class into two teams. Have them sit apart from each other. A \"wolf\" from the other team visits the opposite team with a list of words or phrases. The \"wolf\" then asks someone to spell or answer the phrase. If the \"sheep\" cannot answer correctly, the \"sheep\" is then captured. After a short while the shepherd, the teacher, chases the wolves away and takes the captives back to their own groups. The team with the most captives is the winner.","(2) 玩“狼与小羊”游戏：把全班分成两队，分开坐。一队的“狼”带着一张单词或短语清单去拜访另一队，请某人拼出单词或回答短语。如果“小羊”答不出来，就被抓走。过一阵子，牧羊人（老师）会把狼赶走，把被抓的小羊带回自己的队伍。抓到最多小羊的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40 mins) Lesson 8 Hello!","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 8 课 Hello! 你好！",0],["h2","8-Part 1:","8. 第 1 部分：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson at the first time by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Hello!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Hello!","Ss",0],["d","(Point to the monkey.) Everybody look here. What is it?","T",0],["d","A monkey!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody listen to the touchscreen all-in-one .(Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","I'm a monkey.","C",0],["d","Do you know what is the name of the monkey?","T",0],["d","Mike!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","My name is Mike Monkey.","C",0],["d","Let's look at his father. (Point to the Papa Monkey.)","T",0],["d","He is Papa Monkey.","C",0],["d","Everybody point to Papa Monkey and say, \" He is Papa Monkey.\"","T",0],["d","(Point to Papa Monkey.) He is Papa Monkey.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to his tail.) Look! What's this?","T",0],["d","Tail!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. This is his tail. Is it long or short?","T",0],["d","Long.","Ss",0],["d","very good. Let's listen to the next sentence.","T",0],["d","His tail is long.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat. 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","His tail is long. His tail is long.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Let's look at his mother. (Point to Mama Monkey.)","T",0],["d","She is Mama Monkey.","C",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them to read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(3) Review the possessive pronouns, \"your\", \"my\", \"his\", and \"her\". Here's a way you can do. It's called a book swap. Have them write their names in their books. Collect the students' books and distribute them to the students randomly. Have one student hold up a book and ask if it is another student's book. Here's a sample dialogue you can use:","(3) 复习所有格代词 \"your\"、\"my\"、\"his\" 和 \"her\"，可以玩“交换课本”：请学生在课本上写名字，收回学生的课本后随机发下去，请一位学生举起一本书，问是不是另一位学生的书。以下是可以使用的对话范例：",0],["d","Is this your book?","A",0],["d","No, it is not. It is his/ her book. (pointing to student C)","B",0],["d","It's my book. Thank you.","C",0],["d","You're welcome.","B",0],["p","If the book doesn't belong to student C, he should reply negatively and suggest another student. The game ends when everyone has their own books.","如果书不是 C 同学的，他要用否定句回答并猜另一位同学。每个人都拿回自己的书，游戏就结束。",0],["li","(4) After you've gone over this, have the students make sentences of their own using these patterns.","(4) 练习过后，请学生用这些句型自己造句。",0],["li","(5) Open Book:","(5) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["li","(6) Game- Face Me","(6) 游戏：画脸大赛",0],["li","1. Draw a grid on the board and insert different facial parts, i.e. eyes, ears, nose, and mouth.","1. 在黑板上画格子，填入不同的五官，例如眼睛、耳朵、鼻子和嘴巴。",0],["li","2. Also draw blank faces for each team. The students must draw or ask a question correctly before they can choose a square and draw in the face.","2. 也为每队画一张空白的脸。学生要先正确画图或问问题，才能选一格，把五官画到脸上。",0],["li","3. The crazier the facial parts like big noses, pointed ears, moles with hair, the more fun the students have. The first team to finish their face wins.","3. 五官越夸张越好玩，像是大鼻子、尖耳朵、长毛的痣，学生会玩得更开心。最先完成脸的队伍获胜。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Eleven","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 11 课",0],["h2","11-Part 1 vocabulary:","11. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content that will be taught today on the monitor at first. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"eyes\",","(1) 先在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"eyes\" 开始。",0],["d","eyes","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"eyes!\"","T",0],["d","eyes!","Ss",0],["p","After they practice saying \"eyes\", click on next new vocabulary- \"ears\",","学生练习说 \"eyes\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"ears\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"ears!\"","T",0],["d","ears!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach nose, head, and mouth. Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 nose、head 和 mouth。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) Dice GameAfter they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. This time, you can use the flashcards instead of the touchscreen all-in-one. The students have to say the word of the flashcard, which you hold according to the number of the die. For example, if you got 2 dots, the students are supposed to say the words twice. If you got 3/4/5 dots, they are supposed to say the word 3/4/5 times. For \"one\", you can ask the students to do something special, such as asking them to stand up, switch the seats, and then sit down! For \"six\", you can give each of the students one candy or a reward card. You can roll the dice by yourself or ask the volunteers to roll the dice. Then the other students have to speak out the word three times according to the number.","(2) 骰子游戏：学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。这次可以用单词卡代替触控一体机：学生要依照骰子的点数，说出您手上单词卡的单词。例如掷出 2 点，学生就把字说两次；掷出 3/4/5 点，就说 3/4/5 次。掷出“1”时，可以请学生做点特别的事，例如站起来换座位再坐下！掷出“6”时，可以给每位学生一颗糖或一张奖励卡。可以自己掷骰子，或请自愿的学生掷。",0],["li","(3) Point to various parts of your body and say, \" This is my _________.\" Have them repeat this process chorally and individually.","(3) 指着自己身体的各个部位说 \"This is my ___.\"，请学生全班一起和个别复诵。",0],["li","(4) SongTo reinforce this, sing \"Head, shoulders, knees and toes.\" They seem to like this song, plus it has fun little gestures to go with it.","(4) 歌曲：唱“Head, Shoulders, Knees and Toes”来加强，学生似乎很喜欢这首歌，而且还有有趣的动作可以搭配。",0],["li","(5) Part 11.2Introduce the new characters. Introduce them using the following sentence pattern:","(5) 11.2 部分：用以下句型介绍新角色：",0],["p","His/ Her name is ______. Enter page 11.2 and have students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct answer at first. Let them speak out the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. And then lead the class to check the answers together. Let the students take some time to know the new characters. Start with Lilly Lion. Have the class look at the pictures on the monitor with you and practice the sentence patterns with them. Part A- Look at the pictures and answer the questions. Read through this at first and have your students repeat after you. Then assign roles. Have a couple of the students come to the front of the class and read the dialogues. Gently correct any mistakes. Part B- Have them match the pictures to the correct words and complete the sentences. Call on the students to read their answers.","His/Her name is ___. 进入 11.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对。让学生花点时间认识新角色，从 Lilly Lion 开始。请全班和您一起看屏幕上的图片，练习句型。A 部分：看图回答问题。先念一遍，请学生跟着您复诵，再分配角色，请几位学生到教室前面念对话，温和地纠正错误。B 部分：请学生把图片和正确的单词配对并完成句子，再请学生念出答案。",0],["li","(6) Part 11.3- Phonics long A(a-e/ ai/ay) There are three ways to spell the long A sound. Teach the three ways at the same time. Say the words to your students and have them repeat after you. Call on some students individually. Enter page 11.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with long A sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. For example,","(6) 11.3 部分：自然拼读　长元音 A（a-e/ai/ay）。长元音 A 有三种拼法，同时教这三种拼法。念出单词请学生跟着您复诵，再个别点几位学生。进入 11.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有长元音 A 的单词发音。例如：",0],["d","Everybody say, \" a space e, /e/-/e/-/e/\"","T",0],["d","\" a space e, /e/-/e/-/e/\"","C",0],["d","a-i-a-i-/e/-/e/-/e/","T",0],["d","a-i-a-i-/e/-/e/-/e/","Ss",0],["d","a-y-a-y-/e/-/e/-/e/ Help the students memorize the rules first, and then lead them to spell each word by using phonics.","T",0],["p","Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the \"long A\" words.","重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有“长元音 A”的单词。",0],["li","(7) Part 11.4They know the short \"A\", but it's always good to review. Plus, we want them to know the difference between the two sounds. These two sounds can sound very much alike and often are confused.","(7) 11.4 部分：学生已经知道短元音“A”，但复习一下总是好的。而且我们希望学生知道这两个音的差别，这两个音听起来很像，常常被混淆。",0],["li","(8) Part 11.5 Make the students open their book to page 18 and listen to you carefully. Now they get to be quizzed on the difference between the sounds. Have them circle the \"L\" for a long sound and the \"S\" for the short sound. Enter page 11.5 and have the students check the answers of part 11.5 after they finish their writing practice.","(8) 11.5 部分：请学生打开课本第 18 页仔细听您念，这次要考他们分辨这两个音：长音圈“L”，短音圈“S”。写完后，进入 11.5 页，请学生核对 11.5 部分的答案。",0],["h3","(9) Game-The Bird Dance","(9) 游戏：鸟之舞",0],["p","Prepare some cards that have the short \"A\" and the long \"A\". Call two students to the front and tape the cards on their backs. The students have to put their hands behind their backs as well. They have to try to see what the other has on their back. The first who guesses is the winner.","准备一些写有短元音“A”和长元音“A”单词的卡片，叫两位学生到前面，把卡片贴在他们背上，学生也要把手放在背后，试着看到对方背上的卡片，最先猜出来的人获胜。",0],["li","(10) Open the Book:","(10) 打开课本：",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point to the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(11) Writing practice","(11) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hints from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly would be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h3","(12) Classroom Activities 3B Lesson 11","(12) Classroom Activities 3B 第 11 课",0],["p","Have the students open their books to Classroom Activities 3B, Lesson 11. Teach the vocabulary on page 12 by pointing to the pictures and having the students repeat after you. Teach and practice the sentence patterns on page 13 using the pictures, gestures, and your body as a living model. Practice and repeat many times. Now pair the students up and have them ask and answer the questions on page 13.","请学生打开 Classroom Activities 3B 第 11 课。指着第 12 页的图片教单词，请学生跟着您复诵。用图片、手势，并把自己当作活模特儿，教第 13 页的句型并反复练习。接着让学生两两一组，互相问答第 13 页的问题。",0],["li","(13) Activity Sheet 4:","(13) 活动单 4：",0],["p","Give the students Activity Sheet 4. Put them into groups. Let them look at and talk to their team members. Have them write their teammates' names, and \"big\" or \"small\" in each column.","发下活动单 4，把学生分组，让他们观察并和组员交谈，在每一栏写下组员的名字和“big”或“small”。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\" Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monolog of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson five. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 5 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","We can use a computer to do many things. Can you use a computer? Do you have a computer in your room? Let's listen to the conversation.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialogue. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement","加强复习 Reinforcement",0],["h3","(15 mins)","（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons of what the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down in their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides this, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Have them practice saying the long \"A\" and short \"A\".","(3) 请学生练习说长元音“A”和短元音“A”。",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[28,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼ 儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4"]],[28,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11","11.1","11.2-A"]],[71,["大儿童学习区","Big Kids","▼ 儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 11","Part 11.1","Vocabulary","Part 11.2","Class Pictures.","Part 11.3","Phonics- Long A","Part 11.4","Phonics- Short A","Part 11.5","Quiz"]],[123,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Hello!"],"bd":"","m":105},{"z":"第 18 课","t":"Class 18","k":"class","p":[75,76,77,78,79,80],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R./C.A. To express possession, objects, and identify body parts To answer \"yes\" and \"no\" questions with possessive pronouns","C.R./C.A.：能表达所有权、说出物品和身体部位；能用所有格代词回答是非问句。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Sharing/showing things to others. Making compliments Asking and answering about the origin of things","和别人分享／展示东西；称赞别人；询问并回答东西的来源",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 9","Classroom Readers 第 9 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Our, their, house, door, red, room, small, big, hat, chair, yellow, black",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","It's/ They're (adj.) / (color.)",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B Lesson 12","Classroom Activities 3B 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Hair, hand, arm, leg, foot",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die, color flashcards or colored objects, Photocopies of activity- sheet","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子、颜色单词卡或有颜色的物品、活动单复印件",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 5","EEC 2 第 5 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Monitor, keyboard, speaker, key, mouse, printer",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Whose computer is this?","A",1],["d","It is mine.","B",1],["d","Wow. It's nice.","A",1],["d","Where did you get it?","B",1],["d","Well, it's a present from my dad. Really?","A",1],["d","Lucky you!","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Start with attendance spelling. Call out a student's name and have them spell a word that they've learned.","(2) 先进行点名拼写：叫一位学生的名字，请他拼一个学过的单词。",0],["li","(3) Review the possessive pronouns.","(3) 复习所有格代词。",0],["li","(4) Activity- Stepping-Stones Draw a river on the board and two sets of stones going across the river so you can walk across the river by stepping on the stones. Two teams. For a team to take a step on their set of stones, a word is called out by the teacher and it must be spelled correctly by one of the students on that team. If it is spelled correctly it is printed on the stone.","(4) 活动：踩石头过河。在黑板上画一条河，河上有两排石头，踩着石头就能过河。分成两队。老师喊出一个单词，该队其中一位学生必须拼对，该队才能往前踩一颗石头；拼对就把字写在石头上。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40 mins) Lesson 9 Our House!","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 9 课 Our House! 我们的家！",0],["h2","9-Part 1:","9. 第 1 部分：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson at the first time by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","This is our house.!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","This is our house!","Ss",0],["d","(Point to the classroom.) Everybody say, \"This is our classroom.\"","T",0],["d","This is our classroom.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody look at the door.(Point to the door.) It's red. Everybody say, \"It's red.\"","T",0],["d","It's red.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Let's listen to next sentence.","T",0],["d","Its door is red.","C",0],["d","Everybody say, \"Its door is red.\"","T",0],["d","Its door is red!","Ss",0],["d","(Point to Mike's room.) Let's look at Mike's room. Is it big?","T",0],["d","No!","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","This is my room. My room is small.","C",0],["d","Let's look at his Papa and Mama's room. (Point to the big room.)","T",0],["d","This is mama and papa's room.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat it again.1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","This is mama and papa's room.","Ss",0],["d","Is it big?","T",0],["d","Yes!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Their room is big.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Their room is big.","Ss",0],["d","very good. (Point to the hat.) Can you see Mama's hat.","T",0],["d","Yes!","Ss",0],["d","where?","T",0],["d","On the chair.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Mama's hat is on the chair.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat. 1-2-3-go!","T",0],["d","Mama's hat is on the chair.","Ss",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(3) Teach them the new words Start with \"their\". Ask the students that have something in common to stand up. Say something likes, \"Their eyes are brown.\" And have the rest of the class repeat after you. Use this pattern with other body parts.","(3) 教学生新单词，从 \"their\" 开始。请有某个共同点的学生站起来，说 \"Their eyes are brown.\" 这样的句子，请其他同学跟着您复诵。用其他身体部位练习这个句型。",0],["li","(4) With \"our\" have some students come to the front. Make a sentence like; \"Our pencils are yellow.\" Now prompt the other students to point at the standing students and say, \"Your pencils are yellow\". The students, who are standing in front, answer, \" Our pencils are yellow.\" With \"its\" draw some animals on the board and make sentences like \"Its nose is long, etc.\"","(4) 教 \"our\" 时，请几位学生到前面，造一个句子，例如 \"Our pencils are yellow.\"，再引导其他学生指着站着的学生说 \"Your pencils are yellow.\"，站在前面的学生回答 \"Our pencils are yellow.\"。教 \"its\" 时，在黑板上画一些动物，造句如 \"Its nose is long.\" 等。",0],["h3","(5) Colors Review-","(5) 颜色复习：",0],["p","Play the color touch game to review colors. The teacher or a student is \"it\". Call out a color and all students must quickly search for an object of that color and touch it. They must remain in that position while \"it\" chases the other students around the room grabbing them. The students who are caught by \"it\" must then return to their seats because they are out of the game. The game continues until only one student is left.","玩“摸颜色”游戏复习颜色。由老师或一位学生当“鬼”，喊出一个颜色，所有学生要很快找到那个颜色的东西并摸着它，保持姿势不动，鬼在教室里追其他学生。被鬼抓到的学生要回座位，因为已经出局。游戏持续到只剩一位学生为止。",0],["li","(6) Open Book:","(6) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Twelve","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 12 课",0],["h2","12-Part 1 vocabulary:","12. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content which will be taught today on the monitor at the first time. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"hair\",","(1) 第一次在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"hair\" 开始。",0],["d","hair!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"hair!\"","T",0],["d","hair!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"hair\", click on next new vocabulary- \"hand\",","学生练习说 \"hair\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"hand\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"hand!\"","T",0],["d","hand!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach foot, arm, and leg Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 foot、arm 和 leg。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) Dice GameAfter they've learned all of the new vocabulary, you can play a quick game with them. This time, you can use the flashcards instead of the touchscreen all-in-one. The students have to say the word of the flashcard which you hold according to the number of the die. For example, if you got 2 dots, the students are supposed to say the words twice. Of you got 3/4/5 dots, they are supposed to say the word 3/4/5 times. For \"one\", you can ask the students to do something special, such as asking them to stand up, switch the seats, and then sit down! For \"six\", you can give the each of the students one candy or a reward card. You can roll the dice by yourself or ask the volunteers to roll the dice. They other students have to speak out the word three times according to the number.","(2) 骰子游戏：学生学完所有新单词后，可以和他们玩个快速的游戏。这次可以用单词卡代替触控一体机：学生要依照骰子的点数，说出您手上单词卡的单词。例如掷出 2 点，学生就把字说两次；掷出 3/4/5 点，就说 3/4/5 次。掷出“1”时，可以请学生做点特别的事，例如站起来换座位再坐下！掷出“6”时，可以给每位学生一颗糖或一张奖励卡。可以自己掷骰子，或请自愿的学生掷。",0],["li","(3) Point to various parts of your body and say, \" This is my _________.\" Have them repeat this process chorally and individually.","(3) 指着自己身体的各个部位说 \"This is my ___.\"，请学生全班一起和个别复诵。",0],["h3","(4) Part 12.2-Play Time","(4) 12.2 部分：游戏时间",0],["p","Introduce the new characters. Introduce them using the following sentence pattern:","用以下句型介绍新角色：",0],["p","His/ Her name is ______. Enter page 12.2 and have students practice the sentences with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click the \"question-mark\" to show the students to correct answer at the first. Let them speak out the answer by themselves individually, or let them have a chance to type out the answer. And they lead the class to check the answers together. Part A- Direct their attention to the pictures. Use choral drills to practice the sentence patterns. Divide the class into pairs. You are the first party and the students are the second party. The class is the third party. Each pair presents the second party statements which the class repeats the third party statements. For example:","His/Her name is ___. 进入 12.2 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习句子。一开始不要点击“问号”显示正确答案，让学生先个别说出答案，或让他们有机会输入答案，再带全班一起核对。A 部分：引导学生注意图片，用全班齐声练习句型。把全班分成两两一组：您是第一方，学生是第二方，全班是第三方。每一组说出第二方的句子，全班再复诵第三方的句子。例如：",0],["d","We are very dirty.","Pair",0],["d","They are very dirty. ( Pointing at the pair)","Students",0],["d","Our hair is dirty.","Pair",0],["d","Their hair is dirty.","Students",0],["p","Teach them that apostrophe at the end of someone's name indicates possession. Go through the statements comparing \"its\" to \"his\" and \"her\". Part B- Secretly assign 5 students to be Tina, Mike, Judy, Randy, and Lily. Make them draw the doll that they are holding in the book with the characteristics as they see them in the book. Hold up their doll one at time and the rest of the class closes their books and tries to guess which character it belongs to. For example:","教学生：名字后面加上撇号（'s）表示所有权。逐句比较 \"its\" 和 \"his\"、\"her\"。B 部分：私下指定 5 位学生分别扮演 Tina、Mike、Judy、Randy 和 Lily，请他们依照书中看到的特征，画出书中角色手上拿的洋娃娃。一次举起一个洋娃娃的图，其他同学合上课本猜是哪个角色的。例如：",0],["d","She is Tina's.","Ss",0],["d","Why?","T",0],["d","Because that is Tina's doll. Its hair is yellow, etc.","Ss",0],["h3","(5) Part 12.3- Phonics long O(o-e)","(5) 12.3 部分：自然拼读　长元音 O（o-e）",0],["p","Teach the rule of long O. Say the words to your students and have them repeat after you. Call on some students individually. Enter page 12.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with long O sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. For example,","教长元音 O 的规则。念出单词请学生跟着您复诵，再个别点几位学生。进入 12.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有长元音 O 的单词发音。例如：",0],["d","Everybody say, \" o space e, /o/-/o/-/o/\"","T",0],["d","\" o space e, /o/-/o/-/o/\"","Ss",0],["d","h-h-h","T",0],["d","/h/-/h/-/h/","Ss",0],["d","/h/-/o/?","T",0],["d","/ho/","Ss",0],["d","l-l-l","T",0],["d","/l/-/l/-/l/","Ss",0],["d","Every body say, \" hole!\"","T",0],["d","hole!","S",0],["p","Help the students memorize the rules first, then lead them spell each word by using phonics. Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long O words.","先帮学生记住规则，再带他们用自然拼读拼出每个字。重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有长元音 O 的单词。",0],["li","(6) Part 12.4They know the short \"O\", but it's always good to review. Plus, we want them to learn the difference between the two sounds. These two sounds can sound very much alike and often times are confused.","(6) 12.4 部分：学生已经知道短元音“O”，但复习一下总是好的。而且我们希望学生学会分辨这两个音，这两个音听起来很像，常常被混淆。",0],["li","(7) Part 12.5 Make the students open their book to page 24 and listen to you carefully. Now they get to be quizzed on the difference between the sounds. Have them circle the \"L\" for a long sound and the \"S\" for the short sound. Enter page 12.5 and have the students check the answers of part 12.5 after they finish their writing practice.","(7) 12.5 部分：请学生打开课本第 24 页仔细听您念，这次要考他们分辨这两个音：长音圈“L”，短音圈“S”。写完后，进入 12.5 页，请学生核对 12.5 部分的答案。",0],["h3","(8) Open the Book","(8) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(9) Writing practice","(9) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hint from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly would be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h3","(10) Activity Sheet 5: A Trip Around the School","(10) 活动单 5：校园巡礼",0],["p","Have them walk around your classroom and school, and answer the questions on Activity Sheet 5. This can be done individually, or in teams.","请学生在教室和学校里走一圈，回答活动单 5 上的问题，可以个别或分队进行。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h3","Let's Check",null,0],["p","Listening Comprehension:","听力理解：",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and color the things with the right color","(1) 听一听，把东西涂上正确的颜色",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teacher can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and color the picture according to the sentence you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and color the picture according to the sentence you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and check \"V\" the correct boxes","(2) 听一听，在正确的方格打钩“V”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What can you do in your room? Please turn to page 22. Let's check. Listen to the sentences and check the correct answer.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the sentence in each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的句子，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to check the correct box by listening to the MP3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边在正确的方格打钩。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (The teacher can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Number the words in the picture below","(3) 练习：为下图中的单词标上号码",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability. Note: Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section.","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Have them practice saying the long \"O\" and short \"O\".","(3) 请学生练习说长元音“O”和短元音“O”。",0],["li","(4) Remind that they are going to have a telephone teaching in a couple of days.","(4) 提醒学生过几天会有电话教学。",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11"]],[30,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[74,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 12","Part 12.1","Vocabulary","Part 12.2","Play Time","Part 12.3","Phonics- Long O","Part 12.4","Phonics- Short O","Part 12.5","Quiz"]],[146,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["Our House!"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 19 课","t":"Class 19","k":"class","p":[81,82,83,84,85],"b":[["h3","Goal","目标",1],["p","C.R/C.A To ask questions using \" Who\" To use simple adjectives To describe activities To use the contraction \"she's\" and \"he's\"","C.R./C.A.：能用 \"Who\" 提问；能使用简单的形容词；能描述活动；能使用缩写 \"she's\" 和 \"he's\"。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Sharing/showing things to others. Making compliments Asking and answering about the origin of things","和别人分享／展示东西；称赞别人；询问并回答东西的来源",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 10","Classroom Readers 第 10 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Home, who, she's, grandmother, he's, grandfather, busy",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Who is he/ she/ it? He/ She/ It is _______.",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B Lesson13","Classroom Activities 3B 第 13 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Mother, father, aunt, uncle, sister, brother",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die, paper for the Show and Tell game, a blindfold, photocopies of activity sheet, the pictures of the students' family","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子、“Show and Tell”游戏用的纸、一条蒙眼布、活动单复印件、学生的家人照片",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 5","EEC 2 第 5 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","Monitor, keyboard, speaker, key, mouse, printer",null,1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","Whose computer is this?","A",1],["d","It is mine.","B",1],["d","Wow. It's nice.","A",1],["d","Where did you get it?","B",1],["d","Well, it's a present from my dad.Really?","A",1],["d","Lucky you!","B",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Start with attendance spelling. Call out a student's name and have them spell a word that they've learned.","(2) 先进行点名拼写：叫一位学生的名字，请他拼一个学过的单词。",0],["h3","(3) Activity- Write On!","(3) 活动：写写看！",0],["p","This is a great game for spelling reinforcement. Divide the class into groups of 2-6 depending on the class size. The first group comes to the board. Say, \"go\" and they have 1 1/2 minutes to write down all the words they know. At the end of the time yell, \"stop!\" and count the number of words each student has written correctly. Erase any misspelled or illegible words. There should be enough students for 2-5 rounds. Write the winner of each round on the board. Finally, have all winners compete against each other for the top speller/ writer prize in the class.","这是加强拼写的好游戏。依班级人数把全班分成 2–6 组，第一组到黑板前。说 \"Go\"，他们有一分半钟写下所有知道的单词。时间到喊 \"Stop!\"，计算每位学生写对的单词数，擦掉拼错或看不清楚的字。学生人数应该够玩 2–5 轮，把每轮的优胜者写在黑板上，最后让所有优胜者互相比赛，争夺全班“拼写／书写王”。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40mins) Lesson 10 At Home","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 10 课 At Home 在家",0],["h2","10-Part 1:","10. 第 1 部分：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson at the first time by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","We are at home!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","We are at home!","Ss",0],["d","(Point to the classroom.) Everybody say, \"We are at school.\"","T",0],["d","We are at school.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody look at this.","T",0],["p","(Point to the grandmother monkey in the monitor.)","（指着屏幕上的猴子奶奶。）",0],["d","Who is this?","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Who is this?","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Let's listen to the answer.","T",0],["d","She's grandmother Monkey.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","She's grandmother Monkey.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to Mike's grandfather.) Let's look at him.","T",0],["d","Who is that?","C",0],["d","Everybody shoe me your finger.","T",0],["d","(Point out their fingers.)","Ss",0],["d","Point to him.","T",0],["d","(Point to the grandfather monkey.)","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","He's Grandfather Monkey.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","He's Grandfather Monkey.","C",0],["d","Let's see next sentence.","T",0],["d","He's my grandfather.","C",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(3) Teach them the new words Start with \"who\". Use a puppet to demonstrate how to use \" who\". Here's sample dialogue for you:","(3) 教学生新单词，从 \"who\" 开始。用布偶示范怎么使用 \"who\"，以下是对话范例：",0],["d","( to the teacher) Who is she/ he?","Puppet",0],["d","He/ She is (name.)","Teacher",0],["p","Repeat this using each student's name.","用每位学生的名字重复练习。",0],["li","(4) Get the students into groups of three. Have them ask \"Who is he/ she?\" referring to the third person. Repeat this until you think they've got it.","(4) 让学生三人一组，用 \"Who is he/she?\" 问第三个人是谁。重复练习直到您觉得他们学会了。",0],["li","(5) Draw a family tree to teach grandmother, grandfather, sister and brother. You can teach them aunt and uncle when you teach the classroom activity book.","(5) 画一棵家族树教 grandmother、grandfather、sister 和 brother。aunt 和 uncle 可以在教 Classroom Activities 时再教。",0],["li","(6) To teach busy pretend you're busy and have someone ask you a question. Shoo them away and say, \" I'm busy.\" They will understand this one real quick.","(6) 教 busy 时，假装自己很忙，请一位学生问您问题，您挥手把他赶走并说 \"I'm busy.\"，学生很快就会懂。",0],["li","(7) Open Book:","(7) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h3","(8) Game/ Activity-Show and Tell","(8) 游戏／活动：Show and Tell",0],["p","Pass out some paper. Have your students draw their family members. Have them come to the front of the class. You ask them, \"Who is he' she?\" and they answer you. Then have the class ask the same question.","发下纸张，请学生画出自己的家人，再请他们到教室前面。您问 \"Who is he/she?\"，学生回答您，再请全班问同样的问题。",0],["h3","(9) Activity Sheet 6","(9) 活动单 6",0],["p","Give each student one activity sheet, and have them draw their families at the proper place. They are also requested to write down the sentences. If their family members have English names, you can encourage them write them down, too.","每位学生发一张活动单，请他们在适当的位置画出家人，并写下句子。如果家人有英文名字，也可以鼓励学生写上去。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Thirteen","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 13 课",0],["h2","13-Part 1 vocabulary:","13. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content which will be taught today on the monitor at the first time. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"mother\",","(1) 第一次在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"mother\" 开始。",0],["d","mother!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"mother!\"","T",0],["d","mother!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"mother\", click on next new vocabulary- \"father\",","学生练习说 \"mother\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"father\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"father!\"","T",0],["d","father!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach aunt, uncle, sister, and brother Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 aunt、uncle、sister 和 brother。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) You will need to explain that aunt and uncle are the same words for both sides of the family as well as brother and sister. If we want to know the brother or sister's position in the family, we'll attach an adjective.","(2) 要向学生说明：英语中 aunt 和 uncle 不分父系或母系，brother 和 sister 也一样；如果要表达兄弟姐妹的排行，要加上形容词。",0],["li","(3) After the students clearly know the meaning of each new word, you can offer them some opportunities to practice the spelling of these words. For example, you can write the word in opposite way, and ask them try to recognize what the word is. If can be a competitive game.","(3) 学生清楚了解每个新单词的意思后，可以给他们一些练习拼写的机会。例如把单词倒过来写，请学生认出是什么字，可以用比赛的方式进行。",0],["h3","(4) Part 13.2-Peter's Family","(4) 13.2 部分：Peter's Family 彼得的家人",0],["p","Part A- We are going to be teaching a lot of things in this lesson like family members, what they're doing, and adjectives. Direct their attention to the pictures. Say each sentence and have them repeat after you. Now pair them up and have them go through the dialogue with each other. Part B- Teach them the sentence patterns. Divide the class into pairs and have the pairs present the text after pair practice. Enter page 13.2 and lead the student doing oral practice the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click on the answer at the first. Let them try to answer the questions by looking at the pictures by themselves. After they say the answers, you can click to check the correct answer with them. (4a) Before you pass out Activity Sheet 6, draw a sample family tree on the board. Explain it briefly, using vocabulary like mother, father, aunt, and uncle. (4b) Pass out Activity Sheet 6 and have the students complete it.","A 部分：这一课要教很多东西，例如家庭成员、他们在做什么，以及形容词。引导学生注意图片，念出每个句子请学生跟着您复诵，再让学生两两一组互相练习对话。B 部分：教学生句型。把全班分成两两一组，练习后请各组发表课文。进入 13.2 页，带学生跟着触控一体机做口语练习。一开始不要点击答案，让学生先自己看图试着回答，说出答案后再点击，和学生一起核对正确答案。(4a) 发活动单 6 之前，先在黑板上画一个家族树范例，用 mother、father、aunt、uncle 等单词简单说明。(4b) 发下活动单 6，请学生完成。",0],["h3","(5) Game- Blind Man's Bluff.","(5) 游戏：蒙眼抓人",0],["p","This is an all time favorite. Blindfold a student and have him/ her wander around the room until they grab someone. They have to ask, \" who are you?\" and the other has to answer.","这是大家永远的最爱。把一位学生的眼睛蒙起来，让他在教室里走动，直到抓到某个人。他要问 \"Who are you?\"，对方要回答。",0],["h3","(6) Part 13.3- Phonics Final \"Y\"","(6) 13.3 部分：自然拼读　词尾“Y”",0],["p","In this exercise the final has a long \"Y\" sound. Say each word emphasizing the \"y\". Have them repeat after you and make sure they come close to reproducing the correct sound. Enter page 13.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with final Y sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. For example,","这个练习中，词尾的 y 发长音。念出每个字并强调“y”，请学生跟着您复诵，确认他们能接近正确的发音。进入 13.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习词尾 Y 单词的发音。例如：",0],["d","Everybody say, Y-Y-Y, /i/-/i/-/i/\"","T",0],["d","Y-Y-Y, /i/-/i/-/i/","Ss",0],["d","d-d-d","T",0],["d","/d/-/d/-/d/","Ss",0],["d","/d/-/i/?","T",0],["d","/di/","Ss",0],["d","candy","T",0],["d","candy","Ss",0],["d","b-b-b?","T",0],["d","/b/-/b/-/b/","Ss",0],["d","Y-Y-Y","T",0],["d","/i/-/i/-/i/","Ss",0],["d","/b/-/i/?","T",0],["d","/bi/","Ss",0],["d","Baby!","T",0],["d","baby!","Ss",0],["p","Help the students memorize the rules first, then lead them spell each word by using phonics. Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long Y words.","先帮学生记住规则，再带他们用自然拼读拼出每个字。重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有词尾 Y 的单词。",0],["h3","(7) Part 13.4-Quiz","(7) 13.4 部分：小测验",0],["p","This test is to see if they can determine the difference between the two sounds. Have them make a \"check\" if they do, and an \"X\" if they don't. Enter page 13.4 and have the students check the answers of part 13.4 after they finish their writing practice.","这个测验要看学生能不能分辨这两个音：有就打“勾”，没有就打“X”。写完后，进入 13.4 页，请学生核对 13.4 部分的答案。",0],["h3","(8) Open the Book","(8) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(9) Writing practice","(9) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hint from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly would be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Have them practice saying the long \"Y\" .","(3) 请学生练习说长音“Y”。",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[30,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 2","Classroom Readers","Lesson 6"]],[74,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 13","Part 13.1","Vocabulary","Part 13.2","Peter's Family","Part 13.3","Phonics- Final Y","Part 13.4","Phonics-Quiz"]],[123,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["At Home"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 20 课","t":"Class 20","k":"class","p":[86,87,88,89,90,91],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["h3","C.R/C.A",null,1],["p","To identify simple objects To practice simple present progressive/ continuous tense","能说出简单的物品；练习简单的现在进行时。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Giving presents. Expressing pleasant surprises Asking for permission Expressing and responding to gratitude","送礼物；表达惊喜；请求许可；表达并回应感谢",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 11","Classroom Readers 第 11 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Say, banana, it's, money, basket, go, going, shopping, be careful",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Who is V-ing?",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B Lesson14","Classroom Activities 3B 第 14 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Shout, shouting, cry, crying, talk, talking, draw, drawing",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die, punctuation flash card, hand puppet, photocopies of activity sheet","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子、标点符号单词卡、手偶、活动单复印件",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 6","EEC 2 第 6 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","alarm clock, rawer, pillow, closet, toy box.","alarm clock, drawer, pillow, closet, toy box",1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This is for you.","A",1],["d","What a surprise! Thanks.","B",1],["p","Can I open it?",null,1],["d","Sure.","A",1],["d","Wow! I really like it. Thank you.","B",1],["d","I chose it especially for you.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (10mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Spelling review: Game-Spell it on my back. This is a great game. You divide the class into two or more teams. Two players from each team go to the board. Player 1 from each pair faces the board with a marker. Player stands behind them so they can write on player 1's back with their fingers. You show flashcard to player 2's, who then writes the word on their partner's back. Player1, who has a marker, feel what's being written on his/ her back and writes it on the board. The first person to write it correctly on the board wins a point for their team.","(2) 拼写复习：游戏“写在我背上”。这是很棒的游戏。把全班分成两队或更多队，每队派两位玩家到黑板前。玩家 1 拿着白板笔面向黑板，玩家 2 站在他后面，可以用手指在玩家 1 的背上写字。您给玩家 2 看一张单词卡，玩家 2 把字写在搭档背上，玩家 1 感觉背上写的字，再写到黑板上。最先在黑板上写对的人为队伍得一分。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40mins) Lesson 11 No Bananas","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 11 课 No Bananas 没有香蕉",0],["h3","11-Part 1","11. 第 1 部分",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson at the first time by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Who is hungry?","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Who is hungry?","Ss",0],["d","Very good! Do you know who is hungry?","T",0],["d","Mike is!","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody look at this. ( Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Mike is hungry.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Mike is hungry.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Let's listen to what Mike is saying.","T",0],["d","\"I'm very hungry,\" says Mike.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","\"I'm very hungry,\" says Mike.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to Mike.) Oh, Mike is very hungry. Let's see what he can eat.","T",0],["d","Uh-oh! No bananas!","C",0],["d","Too bad! There are no bananas he can eat. Everybody say the sentence again.","T",0],["d","Uh-oh! No bananas!","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence)","T",0],["d","It's money.","C",0],["d","(point to the money.) Can you see the money?","T",0],["d","yes!","Ss",0],["d","very good! Everybody say, \" it's money.\"","T",0],["d","It's money.","Ss",0],["d","(point to the basket in the monitor) What 's this?","T",0],["d","it's a basket.","Ss",0],["d","Very good!","T",0],["d","It's a basket.","C",0],["p","Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this procedure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(3) We will be introducing some punctuation marks in this lesson. First of all, teach the use of the comma in conjunction with quotation marks. Write several examples on the board to demonstrate this.","(3) 这一课要介绍一些标点符号。首先教逗号和引号一起使用的方法，在黑板上写几个例子示范。",0],["li","(4) Explain that \"Uh-oh\" means trouble or some sort of problem.","(4) 说明 \"Uh-oh\" 表示有麻烦或出了问题。",0],["li","(5) You will need to explain that \" going\" is continuous form of go and is often used with shopping/ fishing/ skiing, etc.","(5) 要说明 \"going\" 是 go 的进行时，常和 shopping/fishing/skiing 等一起使用。",0],["li","(6) For the next step, review the use of \"who\" and work it in the vocabulary and sentence patterns which will be used in this lesson. Use the puppet again. Here's a sample dialogue.","(6) 下一步，复习 \"who\" 的用法，并结合本课要用的单词和句型。再用一次布偶，以下是对话范例。",0],["d","(holding the puppet) This is Mary. Her name is Mary. Mary, are you busy.","T",0],["p","P: Yes, I'm busy.",null,0],["d","(to students) Who is busy?","T",0],["d","Mary is busy.","Ss",0],["d","(to Mary.) Are you eating?","T",0],["p","P: yes, I'm eating.",null,0],["d","(to students) who is eating?","T",0],["d","Mary is eating. (She is always eating. She is a pig.)","Ss",0],["d","Mary, are you going to school?","T",0],["p","P: Yes, I'm going to school.",null,0],["d","She is going to school.","Ss",0],["li","(7) Open Book:","(7) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h3","(8) Game/ Activity-The Hat Game","(8) 游戏／活动：帽子游戏",0],["p","Divide the class into two teams and choose 3-5 players from each team. Stand the players in two lines facing you. The players at the back of each line stand on a chair holding a card with a verb on it. Put tree chairs behind you and put hats on the two nearest chairs. Say, \"go\". The two players at the front of the line run to the nearest chair pick up the hat and put it on. They run around the three chairs and back to their places. The player at the back of each line then holds up the first verb card and player 1 must look at it and mime what he sees. Player 1 asks, \"What am I doing?\" Player 2 must guess correctly. Player 2 puts the hat on, runs around the three chairs, comes back to her place and mimes the next picture and so on. Each players has only five seconds to answer the question or they have to go back to the end of the line. The first team to finish wins.","把全班分成两队，每队选 3–5 位玩家，排成两排面向您。每排最后一位站在椅子上，拿着一张写有动词的卡片。在您身后放三张椅子，最近的两张椅子上各放一顶帽子。说 \"Go\"，两排最前面的玩家跑到最近的椅子，拿起帽子戴上，绕三张椅子跑一圈回到原位。每排最后一位举起第一张动词卡，玩家 1 看了之后要表演出来，并问 \"What am I doing?\"，玩家 2 必须猜对，再戴上帽子绕椅子跑一圈回来，表演下一张图，依此类推。每位玩家只有五秒可以回答，答不出来就要回到队伍最后。最先完成的队伍获胜。",0],["h3","(9) Activity Sheet-Slapping Game","(9) 活动单：拍拍乐",0],["p","Divide the class into groups. Give each group one activity- sheet. Assign the students numbers. Then roll the dive to decide who will start the game. Have player 1 say a sentence. For example, I'm _____ing. Then everybody has to pat on the picture of the verb he or she said. The last one who slap on the picture will be the next player.","把全班分组，每组发一张活动单，给学生编号，再掷骰子决定谁先开始。玩家 1 说一个句子，例如 \"I'm ___ing.\"，大家都要去拍他说的那个动词的图片，最后拍到的人当下一位玩家。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson Fourteen","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 14 课",0],["h2","14-Part 1 vocabulary:","14. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content which will be taught today on the monitor at the first time. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"shout\",","(1) 第一次在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"shout\" 开始。",0],["d","shout!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"shout!\"","T",0],["d","shout!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"shout\", click on next new vocabulary- \"cry\",","学生练习说 \"shout\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"cry\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"cry!\"","T",0],["d","cry!","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach talk and draw Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 talk 和 draw。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) Say each word and its continuous form. Explain the meaning by way of exag gerated gestures. Have each student repeat the word and the gesture. This could be a lot of fun. When any one of the students is doing the gesture, you can lead all if the rest of the students say the complete sentence. For example, S1 is pretending to cry.","(2) 念出每个字和它的进行时，用夸张的手势说明意思，请每位学生复诵单词并做手势，这会很有趣。某位学生做手势时，带其他学生说出完整的句子。例如 S1 假装在哭。",0],["d","Everybody show me your finger!","T",0],["d","Finger! (raise their fingers.)","Ss",0],["d","Point to S1!","T",0],["d","(point to the student)","Ss",0],["d","everybody say,\" He is crying.\"","T",0],["d","He is crying.","Ss",0],["li","(3) After the students clearly know the meaning of each new word, you can offer them some opportunities to practice the spelling if these words. For example, you can write the word in opposite way, and ask them try to recognize what the word is. If can be a competitive game.","(3) 学生清楚了解每个新单词的意思后，可以给他们一些练习拼写的机会。例如把单词倒过来写，请学生认出是什么字，可以用比赛的方式进行。",0],["h3","(4) Part 14.2-The Very Naughty Class","(4) 14.2 部分：The Very Naughty Class 超级调皮的班级",0],["p","Part A- Take a look at the class on the picture. It's totally out of control. Everybody is doing something that borders on chaos. Each sentence in part A describes these actions. Read through each of the sentence together, then pair them up and have them do a role-play with this. Part B- Teach them the sentence patterns. Divide the class into pairs and have the pairs present the text after pair practice.","A 部分：看看图中的班级，完全失控了，每个人都在做一些近乎混乱的事，A 部分的每个句子都在描述这些动作。先一起念每个句子，再让学生两两一组进行角色扮演。B 部分：教学生句型。把全班分成两两一组，练习后请各组发表课文。",0],["h3","(5) Activty Sheet 7","(5) 活动单 7",0],["p","Pass out Activity Sheet 7 and have the students complete it.","发下活动单 7，请学生完成。",0],["li","(6) Slap:","(6) 拍拍乐：",0],["p","Put the students into groups. Call out a word like \"shouting\" or \"crying.\" As you call out the word, the students try to be the first to slap the picture corresponding to the word you have called out. Now choose a student from each group and let him be the \"caller.\"","把学生分组，喊出一个单词，例如 \"shouting\" 或 \"crying\"，学生要抢先拍到和这个字对应的图片。接着每组选一位学生当“出题者”。",0],["h3","(7) Oral Practice","(7) 口语练习",0],["p","Enter page 14.2 and lead the student doing oral practice using the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't click on the answer at the first. Let them try to answer the questions by looking at the pictures by themselves. After they say the answers, you can click to check the correct answer with them.","进入 14.2 页，带学生用触控一体机做口语练习。一开始不要点击答案，让学生先自己看图试着回答，说出答案后再点击，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(8) Part 14.3- Phonics: long \"I\"","(8) 14.3 部分：自然拼读　长元音“I”",0],["p","Say each word emphasizing the \"I\". Have them repeat after you and make sure they come close to reproducing the correct sound. Enter page 14.3 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words with long I sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. For example,","念出每个字并强调“I”，请学生跟着您复诵，确认他们能接近正确的发音。进入 14.3 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习有长元音 I 的单词发音。例如：",0],["d","Everybody say, i space e /aɪ/-/aɪ/-.aɪ/","T",0],["d","i space e /aɪ/-/aɪ/-.aɪ/","Ss",0],["d","b-b-b","T",0],["d","/b/-/b/-/b/","Ss",0],["d","i space e","T",0],["d","/aɪ/-/aɪ/-.aɪ/","Ss",0],["d","/b/-/aɪ/?","T",0],["d","/baɪ/","Ss",0],["d","bike","T",0],["d","bike","Ss",0],["d","r-r-r?","T",0],["d","/r/-/r/-/r/","Ss",0],["d","i space e","T",0],["d","/i/-/i/-/i/","Ss",0],["d","/r/-/aɪ/?","T",0],["d","/raɪ/","Ss",0],["d","rice!","T",0],["d","rice!","Ss",0],["p","Help the students memorize the rules first, then lead them spell each word by using phonics. Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long I words.","先帮学生记住规则，再带他们用自然拼读拼出每个字。重复这个流程几次，让学生练习所有长元音 I 的单词。",0],["h3","(9) Part 14.4- Short I","(9) 14.4 部分：短元音 I",0],["p","Bring to their attention that there is no \"e\" at the end of the word. Also teach them that a double consonant follows a short vowel.","提醒学生注意这些字的词尾没有“e”，也教他们短元音后面会接重复的辅音。",0],["d","Everybody say, \"I-I-I, /I/-/I/-/I/","T",0],["d","I-I-I, /I/-/I/-/I/","Ss",0],["li","(10) Part 14.5-Quiz This test is to see if they can determine the difference between the two sounds. Have them make a \"circle\" at \"L\" or \"S\" according to the sound of the words. You have to read each word clearly and slowly and have them respond. Enter page 14.5 and have the students check the answers of part 14.5 after they finish their writing practice. After they've completed the quiz, divide the class into teams. Make up a list of words with the short I and the long I. Say a word and the first team to answer correctly gets a point.","(10) 14.5 部分：小测验。这个测验要看学生能不能分辨这两个音：依照单词的音圈“L”或“S”。您要清楚、慢慢地念出每个字，让学生作答。写完后，进入 14.5 页，请学生核对 14.5 部分的答案。完成小测验后，把全班分成几队，列出一些短元音 I 和长元音 I 的单词，说出一个字，最先答对的队伍得一分。",0],["li","(11) Open the Book:","(11) 打开课本：",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(12) Writing practice","(12) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hint from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly would be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","Motivation","导入（Motivation）",0],["p","This is the time to warm the class up by providing the students with a general picture of the lesson that they are going to learn today. Make sure all the students have a general idea about today's lesson before going to the next part of \"Let's See And Say.\" Let's See And Say","这是让全班热身的时间，让学生对今天要学的课程有整体的概念。进入“Let's See & Say”之前，请确认所有学生对今天的课程都有大致的了解。Let's See And Say：",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Context Introduction:","情境介绍：",0],["p","The teacher introduces the lesson to the class by having the students to listen to the monologue of \"Let's See and Say\" section in lesson six. Teacher can read or play the MP3 for the monolog to the class, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's See And Say:","老师让学生听第 6 课“Let's See and Say”的独白，向全班介绍本课。老师可以念或播放 MP3 给全班听，如下所示。Let's See And Say 独白：",0],["p","What do you do with your friends and family on their birthdays? Do you buy presents for them? Now, let see what will happen in this conversation.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Have the class to guess and predict about the theme and the words that relate to this lesson based on the idea of the monolog they have listened. Encourage the students to use their imagination and give them a chance to share their own ideas in class. Write down the students' ideas on the board and add the points you also want to emphasis for this lesson. Then play the dialog to the class for the first time and have the students to listen to the dialog carefully.","请全班根据刚听到的独白，猜测并预测与本课相关的主题和单词。鼓励学生发挥想象力，并给他们机会在课堂上分享自己的想法。把学生的想法写在黑板上，并补充您想在本课强调的重点。接着第一次播放对话，请学生仔细聆听。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Continue to play the dialog to the class for the second time and have the students to repeat after the narrator. Remind the students listen carefully to the narrator's pronunciation and intonation while practicing each sentence of the dialog. The teacher also needs to listen carefully to the students' pronunciation and intonation and give help if it's necessary.","第二次播放对话，请学生跟着录音复诵。提醒学生练习每一句对话时，仔细听录音的发音和语调。老师也要仔细听学生的发音和语调，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Introduce the theme of the lesson to the class again by combining with the dialog that the students have practiced and the core vocabulary of this lesson. (The teacher can play or read the dialogue to the class again if it's necessary.) Make sure all the students are familiar with the dialog and vocabulary and able to do the conversation with the others. At this stage, the teacher should also tell the students about the possible situations where they can apply the type of conversation in the real life.","结合学生刚练习过的对话和本课的核心单词，再次向全班介绍本课主题。（必要时老师可以再播放或念一次对话。）确认所有学生都熟悉对话和单词，并能和其他人进行对话。这个阶段老师也应该告诉学生，在现实生活中有哪些情境可以用到这类对话。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group practice the conversation for a comprehension check.","让学生两两一组，各组练习对话，检查理解程度。",0],["h3","Step 6","步骤 6",0],["p","Remind the students to review the lesson at home by listening to the MP3 and encourage them to practice the dialog with their family or friends before coming to the next class.","提醒学生回家听 MP3 复习本课，并鼓励他们在下次上课前和家人或朋友练习对话。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(5) Have them practice saying the long \"I\" and short \"I\".","(5) 请学生练习说长元音“I”和短元音“I”。",0],["li","(6) Remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching.","(6) 提醒学生会有电话教学。",0]],"g":[[25,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[28,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 14","Part 14.1","Vocabulary","Part 14.2","The Very Naughty Class","Part 14.3","Phonics- Long I","Part 14.4","Phonics-Shot I","Part 14.5","Quiz"]],[155,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["No Bananas"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 21 课","t":"Class 21","k":"class","p":[92,93,94,95,96],"b":[["h3","Goals","目标",1],["p","C.R/.C.A. To ask position using 'where\" To answer \"where\" questions and using prepositions","C.R./C.A.：能用 \"where\" 询问位置；能用介词回答 \"where\" 问句。",1],["h3","EEC",null,1],["p","Giving presents. Expressing pleasant surprises Asking for permission Expressing and responding to gratitude","送礼物；表达惊喜；请求许可；表达并回应感谢",1],["h3","Classroom Readers Lesson 12","Classroom Readers 第 12 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Work, where, coconut, road, but, smile, smiling",null,1],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",1],["p","Where is/ are ________ ?",null,1],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B Lesson15","Classroom Activities 3B 第 15 课",1],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",1],["p","Behind, in front of, beside, near",null,1],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",1],["p","Vocabulary flashcards, two plastic hammers, the digital equipment, phonics flashcards, a die, A4 paper, copy of the words for reconstruction game, photocopies of activity sheet","单词单词卡、两支塑料锤、数字教学设备、发音单词卡、一颗骰子、A4 纸、重组游戏用的单词复印件、活动单复印件",1],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 6","EEC 2 第 6 课",1],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",1],["p","alarm clock, rawer, pillow, closet, toy box.","alarm clock, drawer, pillow, closet, toy box",1],["h3","Dialogue","对话",1],["d","This is for you.","A",1],["d","What a surprise! Thanks.","B",1],["p","Can I open it?",null,1],["d","Sure.","A",1],["d","Wow! I really like it. Thank you.","B",1],["d","I chose it especially for you.","A",1],["h2","Warm Up (10 mins)","热身 Warm Up（10 mins）",0],["li","(1) Review the previous lesson. Practice the sentence patterns that were learned. Practice spelling some of the words from various lessons. You can also play a quick competitive game with them.","(1) 复习上一课，练习学过的句型，练习拼各课的一些单词，也可以和学生玩个快速的比赛游戏。",0],["li","(2) Spelling- They've learned a lot of words with long vowels and short vowels. I suggest that you have spelling bee. You can either do it individually or in teams.","(2) 拼写：学生已经学了很多长元音和短元音的单词，建议举办一场拼写比赛，可以个别或分队进行。",0],["li","(3) Game/ Activity-Reconstruction. Take some words that they've learned. Write them in large letters on A4 paper. Copy the list and give a list to each group of three. Cut all the words in half and mix them up. Pass one cut-up list out to each group and tell tem to start. As they look at the word halves, they must put the list back together. The team that finishes first wins. This can also be an individual effort if you make one list for each student.","(3) 游戏／活动：单词重组。选一些学过的单词，用大字写在 A4 纸上，复印这份清单，每三人一组一份。把每个字从中间剪成两半并打乱，发给每一组，请他们开始。学生要看着这些半个字，把清单拼回去，最先完成的队伍获胜。如果每位学生都做一份清单，也可以个别进行。",0],["h2","Classroom Readers (40mins) Lesson 12 On Coconut Road","Classroom Readers（40 mins）第 12 课 On Coconut Road 在椰子路上",0],["h2","12-Part 1:","12. 第 1 部分：",0],["li","(1) Show the content of this lesson at the first time by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(1) 第一次用触控一体机展示本课内容。",0],["li","(2) Lead the students read the conversation with the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 带学生跟着触控一体机念对话。",0],["d","Mama Monkey is at work.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Mama Monkey is at work.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Everybody look at Papa monkey. (Click on next sentence.)","T",0],["d","Papa Monkey is at work, too.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Papa Monkey is at work, too.","Ss",0],["d","Very good. Let's take a look at the Grandmother and the Grandfather.","T",0],["d","Grandmother and the Grandfather Monkey are at home.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","Grandmother and the Grandfather Monkey are at home.","Ss",0],["d","(Point to Mike.) Where is Mike?","T",0],["d","He is on Coconut Road.","C",0],["d","Everybody say the sentence again.","T",0],["d","He is on Coconut Road.","Ss",0],["d","(Click on next sentence)","T",0],["d","He's hungry..","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","He's hungry.","Ss",0],["d","very good! (Click on next sentence)","T",0],["d","but he's happy.","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat!","T",0],["d","but he's happy.","Ss",0],["d","Mike is smiling.","C",0],["d","Mike is smiling.","S",0],["li","(3) Go over the whole reading by the same process and don't forget to repeat this proce dure 2-3 times. When they've got it, ask them read all the sentences out by themselves. You can also do individual practice.","(3) 用相同的流程把整篇读完，别忘了重复 2–3 次。学生熟练后，请他们自己念出所有句子，也可以进行个别练习。",0],["li","(4) Teach \"where\" to your students. You can do this in a number of ways. Have a student hide. You ask, \"Where is _______?\" and look all around the classroom. Use one of the new prepositions for the answer. For example, \"Where is Mike?\" \"Oh, look! He is behind the door.\" Repeat this procedure using different students and different prepositions.","(4) 教学生 \"where\"，有很多方法：请一位学生躲起来，您问 \"Where is ___?\" 并在教室里四处找，用一个新的介词回答，例如 \"Where is Mike?\" \"Oh, look! He is behind the door.\"。换不同的学生和不同的介词重复这个流程。",0],["li","(5) Now teach them \"at home\" and \"at work\". Draw a picture of a house with a family member relaxing in it. Say, \"He/ She is at home.\" And have them repeat. Do the same with \"at work.\"","(5) 接着教 \"at home\" 和 \"at work\"。画一间房子，里面有一位家人在休息，说 \"He/She is at home.\"，请学生复诵。\"at work\" 也用同样的方式教。",0],["li","(6) Now, randomly ask a student where one of their family members are. Using singular and plural forms.","(6) 接着随机问一位学生他的某位家人在哪里，练习单数和复数形。",0],["li","(7) Open Book:","(7) 打开课本：",0],["p","When they seem to have grasped all the target sentences, ask them to open their books and go over the dialogue with you. If you have plenty of time, you can have them read the dialogue as a group and individually.","学生似乎掌握了所有目标句子后，请他们打开课本，跟您一起把对话念一遍。时间充裕的话，可以请学生全组一起念，再个别念。",0],["h3","(8) Game/ Activity-Prepositional Chain Drill","(8) 游戏／活动：介词接龙",0],["p","Teach the new prepositions. Take a small object, like a pen, and do something with it, then describe your action. Place the object somewhere, like on the desk and ask, \"where is the pen?\" The student answers and then doe something different with the object that involves a different preposition of place. They then ask their classmate, \"Where is the pen?\" This activity continues until no one can do something different with the pen that can be describe using a preposition of place. You might want to write all the prepositions on the board as a reference.","教新的介词。拿一个小东西，例如一枝笔，对它做一个动作并描述这个动作。把东西放在某个地方，例如桌上，问 \"Where is the pen?\"。学生回答后，再用另一个表示位置的介词对这个东西做不同的动作，接着问同学 \"Where is the pen?\"。持续进行，直到没有人能再用表示位置的介词做出不同的动作。可以把所有介词写在黑板上供参考。",0],["h2","Classroom Activities (40 mins) Lesson 15","Classroom Activities（40 mins）第 15 课",0],["h2","15-Part 1 vocabulary:","15. 第 1 部分　单词：",0],["li","(1) Show the content which will be taught today on the monitor at the first time. Introduce the words one by one. Start out with \"behind \",","(1) 第一次在屏幕上展示今天要教的内容，逐一介绍单词，从 \"behind\" 开始。",0],["d","behind!","C",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"behind!\"","T",0],["d","behind!","Ss",0],["p","After them practice saying \"behind\", click on next new vocabulary- \"in front of\",","学生练习说 \"behind\" 之后，点击下一个新单词 \"in front of\"。",0],["d","Everybody repeat, \"in front of!\"","T",0],["d","in front of !","Ss",0],["p","Follow the steps above to teach talk and draw Repeat this procedure for about 5 times, until all of the vocabulary is presented.","依照上面的步骤教 talk 和 draw。重复这个流程大约 5 次，直到所有单词都介绍完。",0],["li","(2) Prepositions are sometimes the most difficult concept to grasp for the beginning student. They are very easy to mix up. Teach them by using some type of exaggerated gesture.","(2) 对初学的学生来说，介词有时是最难理解的概念，非常容易混淆。用一些夸张的手势来教。",0],["li","(3) After the students surly know the meaning of each new word, you can offer them some opportunities to practice the spelling if these words. For example, you can write the word in opposite way, and ask them try to recognize what the word is. If can be a competitive game.","(3) 学生清楚了解每个新单词的意思后，可以给他们一些练习拼写的机会。例如把单词倒过来写，请学生认出是什么字，可以用比赛的方式进行。",0],["h3","(4) Part 15.2-Hide and Seek","(4) 15.2 部分：Hide and Seek 捉迷藏",0],["p","Part A- Hide and seek is a great way to learn preposition. They'll also have a chance to practice the, \"Where are/ is you/he/she?\" sentence pattern. Go through each sentence chorally and individually with your students. To help reinforce these new prepositions, have your students make a gesture with their hands as they are reading the sentences. Part B-Matching. Now they have to identify the prepositions in a sentence. Draw a line from the question to correct answer. Enter page 15.2 and lead the student practice each question with the touchscreen all-in-one. Don't just click on the questions and make them repeat. You should offer them some opportunities to speak out their own answers first. After they speak out the answers, you can click on the answers and lead everybody to check the correct answers together.","A 部分：捉迷藏是学介词的好方法，学生也有机会练习 \"Where are/is you/he/she?\" 的句型。和学生一起全班齐声和个别练习每个句子。为了加强这些新的介词，请学生念句子时用手做出手势。B 部分：配对。学生要找出句子中的介词，从问句画线连到正确的答案。进入 15.2 页，带学生跟着触控一体机练习每一题。不要只点击问题让学生复诵，要先给学生机会自己说出答案，说出答案后再点击答案，带大家一起核对。",0],["h3","(5) Part 15.3- Complete the Sentence","(5) 15.3 部分：完成句子",0],["p","On this exercise we're teaching them to describe opposite things suing the conjunction \"but\". This may be a little difficult to grasp at first. They've learned the opposites, but not how to put them together like this. Take a look at the example and explain it to them. Move on to the exercise. You may have to walk them through each exercise. Don't just click on the questions and make them repeat. You should offer them some opportunities to speak out their own answers first. After they speak out the answers, you can click on the answers and lead everybody to check the correct answers together. with long I sound with the touchscreen all-in-one. Help the students memorize the rules first, then lead them spell each word by using phonics. Repeat the procedure several times to let them practice all the long I words.","这个练习要教学生用连词 \"but\" 描述相反的事物。一开始可能有点难理解：学生学过反义词，但还没学过怎么像这样把它们放在一起。看看例题并向学生说明，再进行练习，可能需要带学生逐题练习。不要只点击问题让学生复诵，要先给学生机会自己说出答案，说出答案后再点击答案，带大家一起核对。",0],["li","(7) Quickly go over these sounds and have your students repeat after you.","(7) 快速复习这些音，请学生跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","(8) Part 15.6-Qize","(8) 15.6 部分：小测验",0],["p","Now it's time for the listening part. These sounds are very difficult to distinguish, so say each word solely and clearly. Correct the quizzes and review any weak area. Enter page 15.6 and have the students check the answers of part 15.6 after they finish their writing practice.","现在进行听力部分。这些音非常难分辨，所以每个字都要念得慢而清楚。批改小测验，并复习较弱的部分。写完后，进入 15.6 页，请学生核对 15.6 部分的答案。",0],["h3","(9) Open the Book","(9) 打开课本",0],["p","Have students open their books and practice what they've learned. Encourage them to read aloud and point the vocabulary, sentences, or pictures.","请学生打开课本练习刚学到的内容，鼓励他们大声朗读，并指着单词、句子或图片。",0],["h3","(10) Writing practice","(10) 书写练习",0],["p","This competitive game could be a writing practice game. For example, the students have to write the complete sentences on the board according to hint from the teacher. The one who can write it correctly would be the winner.","这个比赛游戏也可以变成书写练习，例如学生要依照老师的提示，在黑板上写出完整的句子，写对的人获胜。",0],["h3","(11) Part 15.4- Phonics- nk ng","(11) 15.4 部分：自然拼读　nk／ng",0],["p","Say each word emphasizing the \"I\". Have them repeat after you and make sure they come close to reproducing the correct sound. These two sounds are easily confused because they sound so much alike. Say these words VERY slowly and clearly and have your students repeat after you. Drill them individually. Enter page 15.4 and have the students practice the pronunciation of the words","念出每个字并强调词尾的音，请学生跟着您复诵，确认他们能接近正确的发音。这两个音听起来很像，很容易混淆。“非常”慢、清楚地念出这些字，请学生跟着您复诵，并个别操练。进入 15.4 页，请学生跟着触控一体机练习这些单词的发音。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["h2","Let's Check",null,0],["p","Listening Comprehension:","听力理解：",0],["p","Note: For the listening exercises, the teacher needs to read the words to the students for exercise 1 (please refer to the appendix for the script) and play the MP3 to the class for exercise 2. For exercise 3, the teacher should give the instruction first and have the students do the exercise by themselves.","注意：听力练习的第 1 题，老师需要念单词给学生听（稿件请参考附录）；第 2 题播放 MP3 给全班听；第 3 题由老师先说明，再让学生自己完成。",0],["h3","(1) Listen and color the things with the right color","(1) 听一听，把东西涂上正确的颜色",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Quickly review the dialog that the students have learned from the previous class. The teachers can do the conversation with the students by being \"A\" and have the students to be \"B\". Do it again by switching roles.","快速复习学生上一堂课学过的对话。老师可以扮演“A”、学生扮演“B”进行对话，再交换角色练习一次。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Attract the students' attention by saying, \" Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.\" \"Pay careful attentions to what your teacher says and color the picture according to the sentence you hear.\"","说“Open your book to page ___ and take out your pencil.”“Pay careful attention to what your teacher says and color the picture according to the sentence you hear.”吸引学生的注意。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Read the words to the students and have them to listen to you and do the exercise. (The teacher can read the words to the class again if it's necessary.) Take a look around and check the correct answers with the students.","念单词给学生听，请他们边听边做练习。（必要时老师可以再念一次。）巡视教室，和学生一起核对正确答案。",0],["h3","(2) Listen and check \"V\" the correct boxes","(2) 听一听，在正确的方格打钩“V”",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the monolog of Let's Check section as the introduction of the second listening exercise, as indicated below. Monolog Of Let's Check:","播放“Let's Check”部分的独白，作为第二个听力练习的引导，如下所示。Let's Check 独白：",0],["p","What can you see in the bedroom? There is an alarm clock, a closet, a toy box, a drawer and a pillow. What do you like to do in your room? Please turn to page 26. Let's Check. Listen to the sentences and check the correct answer.",null,0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Tell the class the sentence in each picture and have them repeat after you.","告诉全班每张图片的句子，请他们跟着您复诵。",0],["h3","Step 3","步骤 3",0],["p","Explain that they have to check the correct box by listening to the mp3. Continue to play the MP3 to the class for the listening exercise.","说明他们要边听 MP3，边在正确的方格打钩。接着继续播放 MP3 进行听力练习。",0],["h3","Step 4","步骤 4",0],["p","Take a look around and make sure all the students can do the exercise while playing the MP3 to the class.","播放 MP3 时巡视教室，确认所有学生都会做这个练习。",0],["h3","Step 5","步骤 5",0],["p","As soon as they finish start the correction by telling them the answers and help them to correct their mistakes. (Teachers can play the dialog the class again if it's necessary.)","学生一完成就开始订正：告诉他们答案，并帮助他们改正错误。（必要时老师可以再播放一次对话。）",0],["h3","(3) Exercise: Connect the words to the right place","(3) 练习：把单词连到正确的位置",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Give the instruction to the class about exercise 3 by referring to the exercise heading of the lesson. Make sure your explanation is clear enough for the students to do the exercise by themselves. Take a look around while the students are doing the exercise and give help if it's necessary.","参考本课练习的标题，向全班说明第 3 题的做法，确认说明够清楚，让学生能自己完成。学生做练习时巡视教室，必要时给予协助。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Check the answers with the class by inviting the answers from the students. The teacher should give more chance for the students to talk and interact with the others in class to increase learner's communicative ability. Note: Please refer to the appendix for the MP3 script and answers of \"Let's Check\" section","请学生说出答案，和全班一起核对。老师应多给学生在课堂上说话、和别人互动的机会，提升学习者的沟通能力。注意：“Let's Check”部分的 MP3 对话稿和答案请参考附录。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons what students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Write a few examples on the board so they have somewhat of an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，在黑板上写几个例子，让学生有初步的了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report）",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Have them practice saying the long \"I\" and short \"I\".","(3) 请学生练习说长元音“I”和短元音“I”。",0]],"g":[[24,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book3","Classroom Reader","Learning","And","Playing"]],[29,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼"]],[29,["Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Activity","Lesson 15","Part 15.1","Vocabulary","Part 15.2","Hide and Seek","Part 15.3","Complete the Sentence","Part 15.4","Phonics- nk ng","Phonics- N","Part 15.6","Quiz"]],[119,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":["On Coconut Road"],"bd":"","m":120},{"z":"第 22 课","t":"Class 22","k":"class","p":[97,98],"b":[["h2","Review Day 3","复习日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","C.R/C.A To review everything they've learned To To have a writing quiz and listening quiz","C.R./C.A.：复习所有学过的内容；进行笔试小测验和听力小测验。",0],["h3","EEC",null,0],["p","Giving presents. Expressing pleasant surprises Asking for permission Expressing and responding to gratitude Classroom Readers none","送礼物；表达惊喜；请求许可；表达并回应感谢。Classroom Readers：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","review Classroom Activities 3B none","复习　Classroom Activities 3B：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Listening Lab tapes, tape recorder, review flash cards, copy of the quiz and the test, phonics flashcards,","听力练习录音带、录音机、复习单词卡、小测验和测验卷复印件、发音单词卡",0],["h3","EEC 2 Lesson 6","EEC 2 第 6 课",0],["h3","Vocabulary","单词",0],["p","alarm clock, rawer, pillow, closet, toy box.","alarm clock, drawer, pillow, closet, toy box",0],["h3","Dialogue","对话",0],["d","This is for you.","A",0],["d","What a surprise! Thanks.","B",0],["p","Can I open it?",null,0],["d","Sure.","A",0],["d","Wow! I really like it. Thank you.","B",0],["d","I chose it especially for you.","A",0],["h2","Quiz Review (20mins)","小测验复习 Quiz Review（20 mins）",0],["p","Take this time for the quiz and the test. Go over any areas that might need reviewing. I would recommend drilling them on the continuous tense. This tense, as you know, takes a long time to really master.","利用这段时间准备小测验和测验，复习任何可能需要加强的部分。建议反复操练进行时，因为您也知道，这个时态需要很长的时间才能真正掌握。",0],["h2","Quiz (30mins)","小测验 Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Pass out the quizzes and turn them loose. Make sure they stay quiet and keep their eyes on their own papers. When they finish, have them sit quietly.","发下考卷让学生作答，确认他们保持安静，只看自己的考卷。写完后请他们安静坐好。",0],["h2","Listening Quiz (30 mins)","听力小测验 Listening Quiz（30 mins）",0],["p","Get them all settled down and start the listening portion. Try not to play the tape too many times for them. This is, after all, a listening quiz. The voice are clear and the pace is relatively slow. Rehearsal for the PTA show Use the remaining portion for the PTA rehearsal. There's a complete list of activities in day 24.","请学生坐好并安静下来，开始听力部分。尽量不要播放太多次，毕竟这是听力小测验。录音的声音很清楚，速度也相对较慢。家长活动排练：利用剩下的时间排练家长活动，第 24 课有完整的活动清单。",0],["h2","EEC (15 mins)","EEC（15 mins）",0],["p","What Can I do?","What Can I Do?",0],["h3","Step 1","步骤 1",0],["p","Play the dialog using the MP3 as a quick review and a listening reinforcement to start today's class.","用 MP3 播放对话，作为今天上课的快速复习和听力加强。",0],["h3","Step 2","步骤 2",0],["p","Explain the meaning of each topic in \"What Can I do?\" and let them check the suitable place for their performance. Allow five minutes for the students to do the exercise and select a few students to report their self-evaluation about what they can do to the class.","解释“What Can I Do?”中每个项目的意思，让学生依照自己的表现在适当的位置打钩。给学生五分钟做这个练习，再选几位学生向全班报告自己的自我评估，说说自己能做到什么。",0],["h3","Step3","步骤 3",0],["p","Divide the class into pairs and have each group to do a mini role-play of the dialog of the unit. Each group needs to demonstrate in front the class, and the teacher needs to make sure everyone can do the conversation with ease in terms of achieving the functional goals of this lesson. Also, pay attention to the students' pronunciation and intonation.","让学生两两一组，各组进行本单元对话的小型角色扮演。每一组都要到全班面前表演，老师要确认每个人都能轻松进行对话，达到本课的功能目标，同时注意学生的发音和语调。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (15 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（15 mins）",0],["h3","Progress Report","学习进度手册",0],["li","(1) Write the learning items on the board and have students to write down on their progress reports.","(1) 把学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中。",0],["li","(2) Check their progress reports individually and also give each student some comments or encouragement on it. Besides, it is a good time to give students reward cards according their performances today.","(2) 个别检查学生的学习进度手册，并在上面给每位学生一些评语或鼓励。此外，这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["li","(3) Remind them to review for test one which is on class 23. And remind them that they are going to have a telephone teaching in the couple of days.","(3) 提醒学生准备第 23 课的测验，并提醒他们过几天会有电话教学。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #11","电话教学教材 #11",0],["p","Take out Classroom Activities 3B, turn to page 40. Look at the picture B. 1.Make a sentence with \"these\". 2.Is your hair green? 3.Are you shouting? 4.Make a sentence with \"uncle\". 5.Is your teacher's head big?","拿出 Classroom Activities 3B，翻到第 40 页，看 B 图。1. 用 \"these\" 造句。2. Is your hair green? 3. Are you shouting? 4. 用 \"uncle\" 造句。5. Is your teacher's head big?",0]],"g":[[23,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4-Lesson 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11-Lesson 15"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Review Day","m":110},{"z":"第 23 课","t":"Class 23","k":"class","p":[99],"b":[["h2","Test Day 3","测验日 3",0],["h3","Goals","目标",0],["p","To review everything they've learned To To have a written test and oral test","复习所有学过的内容；进行笔试测验和口语测验",0],["h3","Classroom Readers none","Classroom Readers：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Sentence Patterns","句型",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Classroom Activities 3B none","Classroom Activities 3B：无",0],["h3","New Vocabulary","新单词",0],["p","review","复习",0],["h3","Teaching Aids","教具",0],["p","Copies of the test, copies of the oral test","测验卷复印件、口语测验复印件",0],["h2","Review (10 mins)","复习 Review（10 mins）",0],["p","Do a quick review of the major areas of the test with the students. Go over vocabulary, sentence patterns, phonics, and spelling with the students. Really emphasize the prepositions because these little words will always cause much pain and anguish. Have a copy of the test, but don't give the answer directly. Rephrase the test questions.","和学生快速复习测验的主要部分：单词、句型、发音和拼写。特别加强介词，因为这些小字总是让人很头痛。拿一份测验卷，但不要直接给答案，把测验题目换个说法。",0],["h2","Test (50 mins)","测验 Test（50 mins）",0],["p","The test will probably take the rest of the class. If any students should finish early, have them prepare for their oral test quietly or they can sit at their desk and draw or read.","测验大概会用掉这堂课剩下的时间。如果有学生提早写完，请他们安静地准备口语测验，或坐在座位上画画、看书。",0],["h2","Oral Test (50 mins) 3-5 minutes for each students","口语测验 Oral Test（50 mins）每位学生 3–5 分钟",0],["p","Conduct the oral test outside the classroom, individually with the students. Each question is worth four point; one for question comprehension, grammar, pronunciation and fluency. Give students the opportunity to correct their own mistakes first. Assign a classroom leader to monitor their behavior while you are out of the classroom or position yourself so you can see the class through the window. The oral test is worth 20% of the first test total!","在教室外个别进行口语测验，每题四分：理解问题、语法、发音和流畅度各一分。先给学生改正自己错误的机会。您不在教室时，指定一位班长维持秩序，或站在可以从窗外看到班级的位置。口语测验占测验总成绩的 20%！",0],["h2","THE ORAL TEST","口语测验题目",0],["li","1. (turn to lesson 9) Are the balls on the chair?","1.（翻到第 9 课）Are the balls on the chair?",0],["li","2. Is the bird in the clock?",null,0],["li","3. Is the pencil in the desk?",null,0],["li","4. Are Mike's eyes blue?",null,0],["li","5. Who is busy?",null,0]],"g":[[13,["大儿童学习区▼▼▼","Big Kids","▼儿童进阶▼▼","Lesson IV","Book 3","Classroom Readers","Lesson 4- Lesson 8","Classroom Activities","Lesson 11-Lesson 15"]],[19,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Test Day","m":110},{"z":"第 24 课","t":"Class 24","k":"class","p":[100,101,102],"b":[["h2","Activity Day 3","活动日 3",0],["h3","Goal","目标",0],["p","To correct \"Test 3\" To prepare \"PTA\"","订正“测验 3”；准备“家长活动”",0],["h2","Digital Operating Procedures","数字教学操作流程",0],["h3","10mins","10 分钟",0],["p","Go over the test with the students pointing out and correcting any mistakes they may have made.","和学生一起讲评测验，指出并订正他们的错误。",0],["h2","PTA Preparation","家长活动准备",0],["h3","30mins","30 分钟",0],["p","PTA Preparation:","家长活动准备：",0],["p","This is the big day! Take this time to rehearse for the graduation ceremony. Here's the format for the actual ceremony.","今天是大日子！利用这段时间排练结业典礼。正式典礼的流程如下：",0],["li","1. Song. Start out by having the students sing a song. Any song that they have learned would be fine. Have the students sing the song first, then teach the song to the parents. Get everyone involved.","1. 唱歌：先请学生唱一首歌，任何学过的歌都可以。学生先唱，再教家长唱，让大家都参与。",0],["li","2. Game/Competition. Volleyball would be a good game to play during this part. Divide the students and their parents into two teams. Make a paper ball. Give it to one side of the class. The person who has the ball asks a question using a sentence pattern that they've learned and throws the ball to the other team. Somebody has to catch it. Whoever catches the ball has to answer the question and ask another question, throwing the ball to the other side of the room.","2. 游戏／比赛：这部分很适合玩排球游戏。把学生和家长分成两队，做一颗纸球交给其中一边。拿到球的人用学过的句型问一个问题，再把球丢给另一队，一定要有人接住。接到球的人要回答问题，再问另一个问题，把球丢回另一边。",0],["li","3. Role Play. This will be the most challenging, but it will be the most fun. Basically, this part will be a series of short skits. This part will be entertaining for the parents, but it's a chance for the students to speak English. Below is the script for the role-plays.","3. 角色扮演：这部分最有挑战性，但也最有趣，基本上是一系列短剧。这个部分能让家长看得开心，也是学生说英语的好机会。以下是角色扮演的剧本。",0],["h2","Play- The First Day of School (30mins)","短剧：开学第一天（30 mins）",0],["h2","The First Day of School","开学第一天",0],["p","Get into the digital teaching, and play a song to make atmosphere funny. Peter's Family Cast of Characters: Peter, Mike, Peter's mother, Peter's grandmother, Peter's brother, and Peter's sister.","进入数字教学，播放一首歌营造欢乐气氛。短剧“Peter's Family 彼得的家人”，角色：Peter、Mike、Peter 的妈妈、Peter 的奶奶、Peter 的弟弟、Peter 的姐姐。",0],["d","Peter and Mike are at Peter's house. Peter is introducing each family member to Mike. Everyone is doing something.","Scenario",0],["d","This is my family. She is my mother.","Peter",0],["d","What is she doing?","Mike",0],["d","Mother, what are you doing?","Peter",0],["d","I am cooking dinner. Peter, who is this?","Mother",0],["d","He is my friend, Mike.","Peter",0],["d","Hello, Mike. How are you?","Mother",0],["d","I'm O.K, thank you. And you?","Mike",0],["d","I am busy now. I am busy cooking dinner.","Mother",0],["p","(Peter and Mike leave Peter's mother.)","（Peter 和 Mike 离开 Peter 的妈妈。）",0],["d","Who is that girl?","Mike",0],["d","She is my sister.","Peter",0],["d","Hello, what are you doing?","Mike",0],["p","Peter's sister: I am watching TV. What is your name?",null,0],["d","My name is Mike. I am Peter's friend. Who is he?","Mike",0],["p","Peter's sister: He is our brother. He is very young.",null,0],["d","Are you a baby?","Mike",0],["p","Peter's brother: No, I'm not. I am not a baby. I am a ten- year-old boy. Are you thirsty?",null,0],["d","No, I am not thirsty, but I am hungry.","Mike",0],["p","Peter's brother: Don't worry. My mother is cooking dinner. Peter's Mother: Dinner is ready. Come on, kids. Let's enjoy our dinner.",null,0],["d","Wow! We have noodles, fried chicken, and corn soup!","Peter",0],["p","Peter's sister: They look so yummy.",null,0],["d","Peter, your mother is good at cooking.","Mike",0],["p","Peter's mother: Thank you, Mike. Everybody, eat up! This is the script for the play. Feel free to add anything and use any props you think might be appropriate. Make sure your students know their parts well. You can rehearse in class about two weeks before. Don't let students feel performing is a lot of pressure, as long as they are speaking English and having fun, that's the main purpose. It's show time! Move the kids to the graduation place in an orderly fashion. Run through the program. Hopefully, they will be well rehearsed so everything will run smoothly. After the performance, it's time for the actual ceremony. Have the awards and certificates prepared and call the student's names and have them come up to the front to receive their awards. Shake their hands or hug them and congratulate them. This is a big moment for them and their parents. After the ceremony, have some drinks and snacks prepared. Spend some time talking to the parents. At the Playground Cast of Characters: Sam, Katie, Kim, Kai, Charlie, (Everyone is outside playing in the playground) (Props: slide, kite, doll, yo-yo, balls, see-saw)","Peter's mother: Thank you, Mike. Everybody, eat up!　以上是短剧的剧本。可以自由加入任何内容，使用任何您认为合适的道具。确认学生都熟悉自己的台词，可以在大约两周前开始在课堂上排练。不要让学生觉得表演压力很大，只要他们说英语、玩得开心，就达到主要目的了。表演时间到了！带孩子有秩序地移动到典礼场地，依照节目流程进行。希望他们都排练得很好，一切顺利进行。表演结束后是正式典礼：准备好奖项和证书，叫学生的名字请他们到前面领奖，和他们握手或拥抱并恭喜他们。这对学生和家长来说都是重要的时刻。典礼结束后，准备一些饮料和点心，花点时间和家长聊聊。短剧“在游乐场”，角色：Sam、Katie、Kim、Kai、Charlie。（大家都在外面的游乐场玩。）（道具：滑梯、风筝、洋娃娃、溜溜球、球、跷跷板）",0],["d","What is this?","Kai",0],["d","This is a slide.","Sam",0],["d","Look! A kite!","Charlie",0],["d","What color is it?","Kai",0],["d","It is blue. It is a blue kite.","Charlie",0],["d","What is that?","Katie",0],["d","It is a slide.","Sam",0],["d","Is it small?","Kim",0],["d","Yes, it is, It is a small slide.","Charlie",0],["d","(pointing to the balls) How many balls?","Kai",0],["d","I can count 3 balls.","Kim",0],["d","Are they big?","Charlie",0],["d","No, they are not big. They are small balls.","Katie",0],["d","(looking at Kai and Charlie). We are friends.","Sam",0],["d","Yes, we are friends.","Charlie",0],["d","Are we happy?","Kai",0],["d","Yes, we are happy!","Sam",0],["h2","The Graduation Ceremony (15 Minutes)","结业典礼 The Graduation Ceremony（15 分钟）",0],["p","Have the students move to the graduation area in an orderly fashion. Run through the games and activities mentioned above. After they've finished the activities, it's time for the awards ceremony. Have the students come to the front to receive their award and certificate. Be sure to shake their hand and congratulate them. After the ceremony, spend some time talking to the parents. Answer any question the parents have.","请学生有秩序地移动到典礼场地，进行上面提到的游戏和活动。活动结束后是颁奖典礼，请学生到前面领取奖项和证书，一定要和他们握手并恭喜他们。典礼结束后，花点时间和家长聊聊，回答家长的任何问题。",0],["h2","Reinforcement (10 mins)","加强复习 Reinforcement（10 mins）",0],["h2","1-Total Review","1. 总复习",0],["li","(1) Review the lessons that the students have learned today by using the books.","(1) 用课本复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["li","(2) Review the lessons that the students have learned today by using the touchscreen all-in-one.","(2) 用触控一体机复习学生今天学到的内容。",0],["h2","2-Homework Exercises","2. 作业练习（Homework Exercises）",0],["p","Take this time to preview their homework. Find an example or difficult problem to explain so they have an understanding.","利用这段时间预习作业，找一个例题或较难的题目说明，让学生了解。",0],["h2","3-Progress Report Book","3. 学习进度手册（Progress Report Book）",0],["li","(1) Write the main learning items on the board and have students write down in their progress reports. comments. Also, it is a good time to give students reward cards according to their performance today.","(1) 把主要学习项目写在黑板上，请学生抄写到学习进度手册中，并给每位学生一些评语。这也是依照学生今天的表现发奖励卡的好时机。",0],["h2","Telephone Teaching Material #12","电话教学教材 #12",0],["p","Take out Classroom Activities 3B, turn to page 40. Look at the picture B. 1.Where is Judy? 2.Where are Randy and Tina? 3.Where is Lily? 4.Make a sentence with \"under\". 5.Are you watching TV?","拿出 Classroom Activities 3B，翻到第 40 页，看 B 图。1. Where is Judy? 2. Where are Randy and Tina? 3. Where is Lily? 4. 用 \"under\" 造句。5. Are you watching TV?",0]],"g":[[3,["None"]],[67,["● Follow the same steps","above"]]],"tp":[],"bd":"Activity Day","m":40},{"z":"作业本解答","t":"Homework Exercises Answers","k":"img","p":[103,104,105,106,107],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"语法／发音总整理","t":"Grammar/Phonics Summaries","k":"img","p":[108,109],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0},{"z":"EEC“Let's Check”解答","t":"EEC \"Let's Check \"Answers","k":"img","p":[110],"b":[],"g":[],"tp":[],"bd":"","m":0}];